 put into a graveyard from the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', "When Myr Battlesphere enters the battlefield, create four 1/1 colorless Myr artifact creature tokens.\\nWhenever Myr Battlesphere attacks, you may tap X untapped Myr you control. If you do, Myr Battlesphere gets +X/+0 until end of turn and deals X damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.", 'When Myr Retriever dies, return another target artifact card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Myr Sire dies, create a 1/1 colorless Phyrexian Myr artifact creature token.', 'When Phyrexian Gargantua enters the battlefield, you draw two cards and you lose 2 life.', 'When Reclamation Sage enters the battlefield, you may destroy target artifact or enchantment.', 'When Reef Worm dies, create a 3/3 blue Fish creature token with "When this creature dies, create a 6/6 blue Whale creature token with \'When this creature dies, create a 9/9 blue Kraken creature token.\'"', 'When Sea Gate Oracle enters the battlefield, look at the top two cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the other on the bottom of your library.', 'When Solemn Simulacrum enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.\\nWhen Solemn Simulacrum dies, you may draw a card.', "When Spine of Ish Sah enters the battlefield, destroy target permanent.\\nWhen Spine of Ish Sah is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return Spine of Ish Sah to its owner's hand.", "When Spitebellows leaves the battlefield, it deals 6 damage to target creature.\\nEvoke {1}{R}{R} (You may cast this spell for its evoke cost. If you do, it's sacrificed when it enters the battlefield.)", 'When Sylvan Ranger enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'When Terastodon enters the battlefield, you may destroy up to three target noncreature permanents. For each permanent put into a graveyard this way, its controller creates a 3/3 green Elephant creature token.', 'When Titania, Protector of Argoth enters the battlefield, return target land card from your graveyard to the battlefield.\\nWhenever a land you control is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, create a 5/3 green Elemental creature token.', "When Tornado Elemental enters the battlefield, it deals 6 damage to each creature with flying.\\nYou may have Tornado Elemental assign its combat damage as though it weren't blocked.", "When Well of Ideas enters the battlefield, draw two cards.\\nAt the beginning of each other player's draw step, that player draws an additional card.\\nAt the beginning of your draw step, draw two additional cards.", 'When Wood Elves enters the battlefield, search your library for a Forest card, put that card onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'When you cast this spell, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.\\nAnnihilator 2 (Whenever this creature attacks, defending player sacrifices two permanents.)', "Whenever Frost Titan becomes the target of a spell or ability an opponent controls, counter that spell or ability unless its controller pays {2}.\\nWhenever Frost Titan enters the battlefield or attacks, tap target permanent. It doesn't untap during its controller's next untap step.", "Whenever Lorthos, the Tidemaker attacks, you may pay {8}. If you do, tap up to eight target permanents. Those permanents don't untap during their controllers' next untap steps.", "Whenever a creature attacks you or a planeswalker you control, it gets +2/+0 until end of turn.\\n{2}: Target player other than Crown of Doom's owner gains control of it. Activate only during your turn.", 'Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control.', 'Whenever a creature you control attacks, you may put a quest counter on Beastmaster Ascension.\\nAs long as Beastmaster Ascension has seven or more quest counters on it, creatures you control get +5/+5.', "Whenever a player casts a green spell, put a +1/+1 counter on Titania's Chosen.", 'Whenever another creature enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever another creature with power 2 or less enters the battlefield under your control, you may pay {1}. If you do, draw a card.', 'Whenever equipped creature deals combat damage to a player, you may draw two cards. If you do, discard a card.\\nEquip {1} ({1}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', 'Whenever you cast a creature spell, you may draw a card.', 'Whenever you cast an Elf spell, you may create a 1/1 green Elf Warrior creature token.', 'Whipflare deals 2 damage to each nonartifact creature.', 'White spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.', 'Worn Powerstone enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {C}{C}.', 'You have no maximum hand size.\\n{T}: Add {C}.', 'You may have Masterwork of Ingenuity enter the battlefield as a copy of any Equipment on the battlefield.', '[+1]: Look at the top two cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the other on the bottom of your library.\\n[−1]: Untap up to four target permanents.\\n[−10]: You get an emblem with "You may activate loyalty abilities of planeswalkers you control on any player\'s turn any time you could cast an instant."\\nTeferi, Temporal Archmage can be your commander.', '[+2]: Create a 1/1 green Elf Druid creature token with "{T}: Add {G}."\\n[−2]: Destroy target artifact or enchantment.\\n[−6]: Draw a card for each green creature you control.\\nFreyalise, Llanowar\'s Fury can be your commander.', '[+2]: Create a 1/1 white Kor Soldier creature token. You may attach an Equipment you control to it.\\n[−2]: You may put an Equipment card from your hand or graveyard onto the battlefield.\\n[−10]: Create a colorless Equipment artifact token named Stoneforged Blade. It has indestructible, "Equipped creature gets +5/+5 and has double strike," and equip {0}.\\nNahiri, the Lithomancer can be your commander.', '[+2]: Discard up to two cards, then draw that many cards.\\n[−2]: Sacrifice an artifact. If you do, return target artifact card from your graveyard to the battlefield.\\n[−10]: You get an emblem with "Whenever an artifact is put into your graveyard from the battlefield, return that card to the battlefield at the beginning of the next end step."\\nDaretti, Scrap Savant can be your commander.', '[+2]: Each opponent loses 1 life. You gain life equal to the life lost this way.\\n[−2]: Create a 5/5 black Demon creature token with flying. You lose 2 life.\\n[−8]: You get an emblem with "{1}{B}, Sacrifice a creature: You gain X life and draw X cards, where X is the sacrificed creature\'s power."\\nOb Nixilis of the Black Oath can be your commander.', '{1}, {T}, Discard a card: You gain 4 life.\\n{1}, {T}, Pay 1 life: Create a 0/1 white Goat creature token.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice a creature: Return target artifact card from your graveyard to your hand.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice an artifact: Draw a card.', "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Wayfarer's Bauble: Search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.", '{2}, {T}: Add {B} for each Swamp you control.', '{2}, {T}: Draw a card, then discard a card.', '{2}: Target creature gains flying until end of turn.\\n{5}, {T}: Destroy target creature with flying.', "{2}{R}, {T}: Create a token that's a copy of target creature card in your graveyard, except it's an artifact in addition to its other types. It gains haste. Sacrifice it at the beginning of the next end step.", '{2}{U}, {T}: Each player mills three cards. Exile up to two creature cards put into graveyards this way. Create an X/X blue Zombie creature token, where X is the total power of the cards exiled this way.', '{3}, Sacrifice Burnished Hart: Search your library for up to two basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{3}, {T}: Draw three cards. This ability costs {1} more to activate for each card in your hand.', '{3}{U}: Draw a card.', '{3}{W}{W}: You draw a card and target opponent gains 3 life.', '{4}{G}, Sacrifice a creature: Destroy target creature with flying.', "{B}, {T}, Sacrifice another creature: Create X 2/2 black Zombie creature tokens, where X is the sacrificed creature's power.", "{B}: Evernight Shade gets +1/+1 until end of turn.\\nUndying (When this creature dies, if it had no +1/+1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a +1/+1 counter on it.)", '{B}: Nantuko Shade gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{G}: Regenerate another target Elf.\\n{2}{G}{G}{G}: Elf creatures you control get +3/+3 and gain trample until end of turn.', '{T}, Sacrifice Evolving Wilds: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', "{T}, Sacrifice Panic Spellbomb: Target creature can't block this turn.\\nWhen Panic Spellbomb is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, you may pay {R}. If you do, draw a card.", '{T}, Sacrifice Terramorphic Expanse: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', "{T}, Sacrifice Tormod's Crypt: Exile target player's graveyard.", "{T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity.\\nSacrifice Commander's Sphere: Draw a card.", '{T}: Add {C}. You gain 1 life.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\nMorph {2} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Mind Stone: Draw a card.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Tectonic Edge: Destroy target nonbasic land. Activate only if an opponent controls four or more lands.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice an artifact: You gain 1 life.', "{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Until end of turn, creatures your opponents control lose hexproof and shroud and can't have hexproof or shroud.", '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Buried Ruin: Return target artifact card from your graveyard to your hand.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{3}, {T}, Sacrifice Haunted Fengraf: Return a creature card at random from your graveyard to your hand.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{5}, {T}, Sacrifice Gargoyle Castle: Create a 3/4 colorless Gargoyle artifact creature token with flying.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{7}, {T}, Sacrifice Unstable Obelisk: Destroy target permanent.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}, Sacrifice Crystal Vein: Add {C}{C}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}, Sacrifice Ghost Quarter: Destroy target land. Its controller may search their library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}. Activate only if you control five or more lands.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}{C}.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}{C}.\\n{3}, {T}, Sacrifice Dreamstone Hedron: Draw three cards.', '{T}: Add {G} for each Elf on the battlefield.', '{T}: Add {G}.', '{T}: Add {R}.', "{T}: Choose target artifact a player controls and target artifact card in that player's graveyard. If both targets are still legal as this ability resolves, that player simultaneously sacrifices the artifact and returns the artifact card to the battlefield.", '{T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature for each Elf you control.', '{T}: Target creature gets +X/+X until end of turn, where X is the number of Elves on the battlefield.', '{T}: Target permanent becomes an artifact in addition to its other types until end of turn.', '{T}: You gain 1 life for each Elf on the battlefield.', '{U}, {T}: Target creature attacks target opponent this turn if able.\\nMorph {U} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)']
flavor: ['"A crafter must imbue her weapon with part of her soul—something the Phyrexians are incapable of doing."\\n—Melira', '"A richer people could give more but they could never give as much."', '"A riddle is nothing more than a trap for small minds, baited with the promise of understanding."', '"As my kha, he is the source of my inspiration. As my brother, he is the embodiment of my aspirations."\\n—Ajani Goldmane', '"Avacyn has abandoned us! We have nothing left except what we can take!"', '"Avacyn has deserted you. I welcome your devotion in her stead."', '"Beauty determines value, and we determine beauty."', '"Close your ears to the voice of greed, and you can turn a gift for one into a gift for many."', '"Eyeblights are easy to track. Just follow the imperfections."', '"For dim-witted, thick-skulled genetic mutants, they have pretty good aim."\\n—Sisay, captain of the *Weatherlight*', '"Four parts molten bronze, yes . . . one part frozen mercury, yes, yes . . . but then what?"', '"From a tiny sprout, the greatest trees grow and flourish. May the seeds of your mind be equally fruitful."', '"Geralf, must you always whine? I agreed to nothing. I\'ll raise ghouls anytime I wish."', '"He has been to the heart of the wood. Did you truly expect to wield power over him?"\\n—Oakhide druid', '"Hold the line, hold the li—"\\n—General Srok, last words', '"Holy places are no longer sanctuary from death, and death is no longer sanctuary from anything."\\n—Thalia, Knight-Cathar', '"I am not Raksha. I never will be. But I refuse to be the kha who watched her pride be torn asunder."', '"I don\'t have time for you right now."\\n—Teferi', '"I have schemed too long to be supplanted by dead gods. If I cannot have this world, no one can."', '"I saw the devastation when the juggernauts crashed the walls of An Karras. Then I got to thinking."\\n—Janji, sylvan druid', '"I wrecked your metal guy, boss. But look! I made you an ashtray."', '"If our former masters would have us kneel again, they shall feel our defiance slashed across their membranes."', '"In these halls there is no pass or fail. Your true test comes with the first full moon."', '"It has been my experience that disasters like to strike in pairs."', '"It\'s hard to say which is more satisfying: the search for that missing piece or fitting that piece into place."\\n—Evo Ragus', '"It\'s only torture if you\'re strong enough to survive. Otherwise, it\'s a simple, gruesome death. I\'m happy either way."\\n—Liliana Vess', '"Just a taste?"', '"Knowledge is a stain that only instinct and ferocity can cleanse."\\n—Drarg, wolfcaller', '"Let go your grudges, or risk wandering the bogs forever in a murderous rage."\\n—Hildin, priest of Avacyn', '"Life grows everywhere. My kin merely find those places where it grows strongest."\\n—Nissa Revane', '"Like dawn\'s first light, blind the unprepared and banish the shadows."\\n—Skyhunter creed', '"Limitless power is glorious until you gain limitless understanding."\\n—Ixidor, reality sculptor', '"Lord Bolas has shown me how each miserable little life holds untold resources."', '"May you wake to find you were only ever a dream."\\n—Mephidross curse', '"No doubt the arbiters would put you away, after all the documents are signed. But I will have justice now."\\n—Alovnek, Boros guildmage', '"Not all paths are found on the forest floor."', '"Nothing in nature goes to waste, not even the rotting corpse of a good-for-nothing, blood-sucking vampire."\\n—Halana of Ulvenwald', '"Obey!"', '"Our glorious infection has taken hold."\\n—Elesh Norn, Grand Cenobite', '"Ribbit."', '"Roil tide! Roil tide! Tie yourselves down!"', '"Serra isn\'t dead. She lives on through me."', '"She will come back to me."', '"So even the heart of our world has succumbed."\\n—Koth of the Hammer', '"Such an affliction appears to seek out the pure."\\n—Byro, plague doctor', '"The beasts of the wild are my senses. It is through their eyes that all knowledge shall come to me."', '"The crucible yields what you have forged in your mind. You need only reach in and draw the masterwork forth."\\n—Wahara, Keeper of the Crucible', '"The dead have it easy. They suffer no more. If breaking their rest helps the living, so be it."\\n—Olka, mistmeadow witch', '"The light of beauty protects our journeys through darkness."', '"The more our numbers grow, the more I gain hope that Volrath and his cursed stronghold will one day fall."\\n—Eladamri, Lord of Leaves', '"The scourge of Skyshroud is airborne once more."\\n—Oracle *en*-Vec', '"The secret entrance should be near."', '"The shadow travels toward the apex. I predict we will soon see the true measure of darkness."', '"The treasure in my mind is greater than any worldly glory."', '"The union of sea and sky makes a perfect cover."\\n—Talrand, sky summoner', '"There are always leftovers."\\n—Derecht, flesh carver', '"There is great wisdom in rushing headlong into combat . . . if you\'re prepared."\\n—Kenjek, captain of the Thousand Swords', '"There is nothing you can do that I cannot simply deny."\\n—Ertai, wizard adept', '"They had it coming."\\n—Squire Imalia, savior of Thiswick', '"They\'ll soon become accustomed to wearing skin that is not their own."\\n—Elesh Norn, Grand Cenobite', '"Thraben\'s pleas fall on deaf ears. Ours do not."', '"Tools and artisans can be destroyed, but the act of creation is inviolate."\\n—Elspeth Tirel', '"Trust me, your lost fingers and toes are nothing compared to the lost treasures of Sejiri."\\n—Zahr Gada, Halimar expedition leader', '"Under the suns, Mirrodin kneels and begs us for perfection."\\n—Geth, Lord of the Vault', '"Verdant bloom does exist. It merely hides for its own safety."', '"We draw our power from the infinite ocean of the mind, where all manner of things can be conceived."\\n—Azure creed', '"We move because the earth does."\\n—Bruse Tarl, Goma Fada nomad', '"We will descend upon you like a plague of locusts to purge you from our lands!"\\n—Hirov, commander of the Thousand Swords', '"What do a hero and an arrow have in common? In times of war are many more made."\\n—Elvish riddle', '"What is mana but possibility, an idea not yet given form?"\\n—Jhoira, master artificer', '"What was once formed by masons, shaped by smiths, or given life by mages, I will return to the embrace of the earth."', '"Whatever Yawgmoth marks, dies. There is no escape."\\n—Tsabo Tavoc, Phyrexian general', '"When the land is angry, so are they."\\n—Nissa Revane', '"Where a lesser mind sees junk, I see infinite potential."', '"Where will you run when I punish you with the very ground you flee on?"\\n—Nicol Bolas', '"Why keep such trinkets? They only add weight to your travels."', '"Your superstitions and mumblings are useless chaff before my righteousness."', 'A blazing sun that never sets.', "A ghoulcaller's playground.", "A scavenger's favorite appetizer is death.", 'After a hundred failed experiments, Urza was stunned to find that common silver passed through the portal undamaged. He immediately designed a golem made of the metal.', 'After the Battle of Liet Field, the white sun crested above Taj-Nar, bringing hope to all who survived the carnage.', 'All that remains of the Cabal are the echoes in its deepest vault. Yet those who hear the echoes feel a power undiminished by the dust of ages.', 'As Glissa searches for the truth about Memnarch, Bosh searches to unearth the secrets of his past.', "As the Phyrexian contagion corroded Karn's body, the praetors whispered psalms to corrupt his mind.", "Avacyn's holy warriors kept hope alive in her darkest hours. Now they will carry that hope across Innistrad.", 'By the time the spider comes to slurp up its dinner, its victims have been partially dissolved by acidic silk.', 'Crovax gazed on the dead, and for one dark moment he saw a banquet.', "Darkness doesn't always send its minions to do its dirty work.", 'Death in form and function.', 'Deserted, but not uninhabited.', 'Disaster stalks with gaping jaws across unready lands.', "Dominaria's most extravagant crypt nevertheless holds an empty grave.", 'Dozens of spells known only to the Auriok elders were lost, but the next generation, galvanized by war, devised even more potent magic.', 'Elementals are ideas given form. This one is the idea of "smashitude."', 'Elves of the immaculate class weave flora into living creatures—sometimes to endorse an elite warrior, sometimes to create a breathing work of art.', 'Even a fragment of a powerstone contains within it not just energy, but space—vast dimensions trapped in fragile crystal.', "Even through the Mirari's voice, the elves still hear the call of their kinship.", "Ever since the disaster, the city's survivors viewed the star-strewn sky with dread.", 'Every branch a crossroads, every vine a swift steed.', 'Every head it rests upon winds up severed.', 'Few who encounter the strange, human-like grove leave once the lilting chorus of the dryads reaches their ears.', 'For each creature that arrives in its audience, the sage imparts another piece of ancient wisdom for all to hear.', 'For the Phyrexians, death is not an end, nor a one-time occurrence.', 'Forged by divine hands to wander mortal realms.', "From the highest tiers of Dawn's Light Palace to the deepest shade of Wren's Run, the silver notes of the horn shimmer through the air, and all who hear it feel its pull.", 'Garbage in, treasure out.', 'Gerrard savored a grim smile as the Phyrexian portals disappeared behind the *Weatherlight*.', 'He collects the precious metals, and then converts the rest to propellant.', 'He knows the name of every elf born in the last four centuries. More importantly, they all know his.', 'He relishes the devotion of his Skirsdag puppets and their belief that it will earn them immortality.', 'Her presence on the battlefield can transform an unruly mob into a disciplined army.', 'His slaves crave death more than they desire freedom. He denies them both.', 'His verdict is always guilty. His sentence is always death.', "His victims don't have time to feel despair.", 'History has buried its treasures deep.', "If you hear it, it's too late.", 'In a culture of beauty, the most beautiful are worshipped as gods.', 'In life, the nantuko study nature by revering it. In death, they study nature by disemboweling it.', 'Instead of creating a tool that would be damaged by heat, the Thran built one that was charged by it.', 'It claws at the earth in a vain attempt to reclaim what it once was.', 'It harmonizes with the essence of its master.', 'It is the forest beyond the horizon, the mountain waiting to be climbed, the new land across the endless sea.', 'It shambled from the cloud of ash and bone dust, undeterred by its own extinction.', "It's there when a seed sprouts, when gourds ripen on the vines, and when the reapers cut the grains under the Harvest Moon.", 'Its collapse is like the lashing out of a long-dead civilization that resents being forgotten.', 'Its wings beat to the howls of war and fan the fires of rage.', 'Its wings disturb more than air.', 'Kuldotha, wellspring of molten metal, temple of the goblin horde.', "Linger on death's door and risk being invited in.", 'Little agonies pave the way to greater power.', "Lost to time is the artificer's art of trapping light from a distant star in a ring of purest gold.", 'Mages come from far and wide to bathe in its wisdom.', 'Massive, mindless, and imbued with one terrible purpose.', 'Mephidross gives up treasure easily . . . as long as you take its place.', "Mirrodin's creator still lives, still shapes metal, and still commands world-shaking power.", 'Most books simply deliver knowledge. This one expects some in return.', "Most knew of the tower's wizard and gargoyle. Few realized which was guardian and which was master.", 'Most see krakens as wantonly violent, failing to notice their meticulous attention to detail when dismantling a vessel.', "Nature doesn't walk.", 'No spot in nature is truly barren.', 'Nothing breaks the monotony like a good old-fashioned riot.', 'Nothing escapes its gaze—or its breath.', 'Nothing lives within it, yet there is life.', 'Once guarded by the Knights of the Reliquary, the tower stands now protected only by its own remoteness, its dusty treasures open to plunder by anyone.', 'One bone broken for every twig snapped underfoot.\\n—Llanowar penalty for trespassing', 'Only the Eldrazi mind thinks in the warped paths required to open the hedrons and tap the power within.', 'Other Phyrexians have nightmares about the gargantua.', 'Pharika has written her secrets on its bones so that only the worthy may discover them.', 'Reinforcements . . . or refreshments?', 'Remade by Eldrazi magic, Tuktuk inspired an entire clan of misguided goblins.', 'Saltfield nomads call a sudden storm a "whitemane."', 'She arrived like a meteorite, and the enemy fell in a shock wave of holy vengeance.', "She doesn't escort the dead to the afterlife, but instead raises them to fight and die again.", 'Some protection requires a bit of finesse.', 'Some spellcrafting mistakes go on to become spells of their own.', 'Some timelines forever fray, branch, and intermingle. Others end abruptly.', 'Structures built from darksteel yield to neither assault nor age.', 'The Izzet specialize in unnatural disaster.', "The dead know lessons the living haven't learned.", 'The infamous Ezuri commands the highest bounty the vedalken have ever placed upon an outlaw.', 'The kor send their thopter kites to see if the land is in a welcoming mood.', 'The militia formed up in the central plaza awaiting the onslaught, but the giants never quite made it.', 'The mind is a beautiful bounty encased in an annoying bone container.', 'The myr are like the Glimmervoid: blank canvases on which to build grand creations.', 'The oil created the mycosynth. The mycosynth created New Phyrexia.', "The path back to the world of the living is murky and bewildering. A geist may not even realize that it's terrifying its own loved ones.", 'The priest cast Xantcha to the ground. "It is defective. We must scrap it."', 'The slag-workers wasted no time in creating their own flare pulses to cleanse the area of the *incompleat*.', 'The spires of Ravnica are no different from the tall trees of other planes. The elves navigate and protect them just the same.', 'Their arrows are tipped with basilisk eyes and fletched with cockatrice feathers.', 'Their war forgotten, the nations of Bant stood united in the face of a common threat.', 'There may exist powers even greater than Phyrexia.', 'These waters remain uncharted, but not for lack of trying.', 'They only appear in emergencies, and emergencies never last long.', 'Those who bring nothing to the temple take nothing away.', 'Those who forget the horrors of the past are doomed to re-meet them.', 'Titania rewards all who honor the forest by making them a living part of it.', 'Ur-golems once dominated the plane. Even now, they maintain a deep connection to it.', 'Urza tried to rule the air, but Gaea taught him that she controlled all the elements.', "Urza's metathran children were conceived, birthed, and nurtured by an integrated system of machines.", 'Wars are won with strength, valor, and numbers—especially numbers.', 'Water calls to water, and the world is left exhausted and withered in its wake.', 'We all must profit for peace to last.\\n—Mercadian saying', 'What are the orders of a king or the demands of a creed next to such melodies?', 'When Lorthos emerges from his deepwater realm, the tides bow to his will and the coastline cowers in his presence.', 'When angels despair, what hope can remain for mortals?', "When tempers run high, it's easy to lose your head.", 'When the blood hunt lost its thrill, she looked for less tangible means of domination.', 'When wielded by a true believer, it matters little whether the sword is a relic or a replica.', 'Whether trained, ridden, or eaten, few goblin military innovations have rivaled the bug.', 'Without the interfering hands of civilization, nature will always shape itself to its own needs.']
artist: ['Aaron Miller', 'Adam Paquette', 'Adam Rex', 'Alan Pollack', 'Alex Horley-Orlandelli', 'Andreas Rocha', 'Andrew Goldhawk', 'Anthony Palumbo', 'Arnie Swekel', 'Ben Thompson', 'Bob Eggleton', 'Bob Petillo', 'Brandon Kitkouski', 'Brian Snõddy', 'Brom', 'Carl Critchlow', 'Chase Stone', 'Chippy', 'Chris Rahn', 'Christopher Moeller', 'Ciruelo', 'Cliff Childs', 'Clint Cearley', 'Craig Mullins', 'D. Alexander Gregory', 'Daarken', 'Dan Frazier', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Daniel Ljunggren', 'Daren Bader', 'Darrell Riche', 'Dave Allsop', 'Dave Dorman', 'Dave Kendall', 'David Rapoza', 'Dermot Power', 'Don Hazeltine', 'Donato Giancola', 'Doug Chaffee', 'Eric Deschamps', 'Eric Fortune', 'Eric Peterson', 'Eric Velhagen', 'Erica Yang', 'Eytan Zana', 'Franz Vohwinkel', 'Gabor Szikszai', 'Gary Leach', 'Goran Josic', 'Greg Staples', 'Heather Hudson', 'Henry G. Higginbotham', 'Howard Lyon', 'Hugh Jamieson', 'Iain McCaig', 'Igor Kieryluk', 'Izzy', 'Jack Wang', 'Jaime Jones', 'James Paick', 'James Ryman', 'Jana Schirmer & Johannes Voss', 'Jason A. Engle', 'Jason Chan', 'Jason Felix', 'Jasper Sandner', 'Jeff Easley', 'Jeremy Enecio', 'Jeremy Jarvis', 'Jerry Tiritilli', 'Jesper Ejsing', 'Jim Murray', 'Jim Nelson', 'Johann Bodin', 'John Avon', 'John Matson', 'John Stanko', 'Jonas De Ro', 'Jung Park', 'Justin Sweet', 'Karl Kopinski', 'Karla Ortiz', 'Kekai Kotaki', 'Kev Walker', 'Kieran Yanner', 'Larry MacDougall', 'Lars Grant-West', 'Lindsey Look', 'Liz Danforth', 'Magali Villeneuve', 'Marco Nelor', 'Mark A. Nelson', 'Mark Tedin', 'Mark Winters', 'Mark Zug', 'Matt Cavotta', 'Matt Stewart', 'Michael Bruinsma', 'Michael Sutfin', 'Mike Bierek', 'Mike Sass', 'Nic Klein', 'Nils Hamm', 'Noah Bradley', 'Pat Lewis', 'Paul Bonner', 'Pete Venters', 'Peter Mohrbacher', 'Ralph Horsley', 'Raymond Swanland', 'Rebecca Guay', 'Richard Wright', 'Rob Alexander', 'Robbie Trevino', 'Ron Spears', 'Ryan Alexander Lee', 'Ryan Yee', 'Scott Chou', 'Scott M. Fischer', 'Scott Murphy', 'Seb McKinnon', 'Slawomir Maniak', 'Stephen Daniele', 'Stephen Tappin', 'Steve Argyle', 'Steve Prescott', 'Steven Belledin', 'Svetlin Velinov', 'Terese Nielsen', 'Thomas Gianni', 'Thomas M. Baxa', 'Todd Lockwood', 'Tomasz Jedruszek', 'Trevor Claxton', 'Trevor Hairsine', 'Tyler Jacobson', 'Ulrich Brunin', 'Val Mayerik', 'Vance Kovacs', 'Vincent Proce', 'Volkan Baǵa', 'Véronique Meignaud', 'Warren Mahy', 'Wayne England', 'Wayne Reynolds', 'Wesley Burt', 'William Wu', 'Yeong-Hao Han', 'Zina Saunders', 'Zoltan Boros', 'Zoltan Boros & Gabor Szikszai', 'rk post']
