rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because the "search" requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\\\'t have to find the card if you don\\\'t want to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "The sacrifice of a land is part of the cost of casting Harrow. You can\'t pay this cost more than once to get a multiple effect."}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The two lands do not count toward your normal one land you can play each turn.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because the "search" requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\\\'t have to find the card if you don\\\'t want to.\'}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Can never affect the colored part of the cost.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If this card is sacrificed to pay part of a spell’s cost, the cost reduction still applies.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The effect is cumulative.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The generic X cost is still considered generic even if there is a requirement that a specific color be used for it. For example, “only black mana can be spent this way”. This distinction is important for effects which reduce the generic portion of a spell’s cost.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The lower cost is not optional like with some other cost reducers.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This can lower the cost to zero, but not below zero.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Does not trigger on a card on the battlefield being changed into a creature.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The ability will not trigger on itself entering the battlefield, but it will trigger on any other creature that is put onto the battlefield at the same time.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If you have less than 2 cards in your hand, discard all the cards you have. If you have no cards in hand, you can discard zero and draw 3.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It can be used during upkeep to create a Pegasus token in time for it to be sacrificed.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Since it is an Elf, it counts itself.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The ability is never a mana ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-25\', \'text\': "You get the mana whether you want it or not. If you don\'t spend it, it will disappear at the end of the current step (or phase)."}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The power/toughness of the token is set when this spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'If you pay the entwine cost, you draw five cards, then lose five life, then put the Demon token onto the battlefield. The five cards you draw count toward the Demon’s power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'The power and toughness of the Demon token are set when Promise of Power resolves. They’re unaffected if the number of cards in your hand changes later.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The trigger occurs when you use the Morph ability to turn the card face up, or when an effect turns it face up. It will not trigger on being revealed or on leaving the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': \'If a spell with split second is on the stack, you can still respond by turning this creature face up and targeting that spell with the trigger. This is because split second only stops players from casting spells or activating abilities, while turning a creature face up is a special action.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability targets multiple things, you can\'t target it with Willbender\'s triggered ability, even if all but one of those targets have become illegal."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability targets the same player or object multiple times, you can\'t target it with Willbender\'s ability."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "You don\'t choose the new target for the spell until Willbender\'s triggered ability resolves. You must change the target if possible. However, you can\'t change the target to an illegal target. If there are no legal targets to choose from, the target isn\'t changed. It doesn\'t matter if the original target of that spell has somehow become illegal itself."}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'X can be zero.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2004-12-01\', \'text\': \'Aether Snap removes all counters from permanents, no matter what kind they are.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-12-01\', \'text\': "Counters on objects that aren\'t permanents, such as time counters on a suspended card or poison counters on a player, are unaffected by Aether Snap."}]', "[{'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'Gift of Estates does nothing if each of your opponents has the same number of lands or fewer as you.'}, {'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'You can find nonbasic lands if they have the Plains land type, such as dual lands (Tundra, et al).'}]", "[{'date': '2006-02-01', 'text': 'This has a triggered ability when it enters the battlefield, not a replacement effect, as previously worded.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2006-05-01\', \'text\': "If you target Ghost Quarter with its own ability, the ability won\'t resolve because its target is no longer on the battlefield. You won\'t get to search for a land card."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If the targeted land is an illegal target by the time Ghost Quarter\'s ability resolves, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. The land\'s controller won\'t get to search for a basic land card."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "The target land\'s controller gets to search for a basic land card even if that land wasn\'t destroyed by Ghost Quarter\'s ability. This may happen because the land has indestructible or because it was regenerated."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2006-07-15\', \'text\': "Adarkar Valkyrie\'s ability can target a token creature, but since token creatures cease to exist when they leave the battlefield, it won\'t be returned to the battlefield."}]', "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'If Fool’s Demise and the enchanted creature go to the graveyard from the battlefield at the same time, both abilities will trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'If Ixidron and another creature are entering the battlefield at the same time, the other creature enters the battlefield face up.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'The controller of a face-down creature can look at it at any time, even if it doesn’t have morph. Other players can’t, but the rules for face-down permanents state that “you must ensure at all times that your face-down spells and permanents can be easily differentiated from each other.” As a result, all players must be able to figure out what each of the creatures Ixidron turned face down is.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'Turning a face-down creature face-down typically has no effect; the creature’s status is unchanged.'}, {'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'You turn the creatures face-down *as* Ixidron enters the battlefield. There is never a moment when Ixidron is on the battlefield and the creatures are face-up. If a creature on the battlefield has a “whenever another creature enters the battlefield” ability, it won’t trigger because that creature will be face down before Ixidron enters the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Creatures turned face down by Ixidron are 2/2 creatures with no text, no name, no subtypes, no expansion symbol, and no mana cost. These values are copiable if an object becomes a copy of one of those creatures, and their normal values are not copiable.'}]", "[{'date': '2007-02-01', 'text': 'You choose whether the targeted creature gets +2/-2 or -2/+2 as the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2007-05-01', 'text': 'Epochrasite will enter the battlefield with three +1/+1 counters on it if you cast it from a zone other than your hand, or if an effect let you put it directly onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'A creature cast using suspend will enter the battlefield with haste. It will have haste until another player gains control of it. (In some rare cases, another player may gain control of the creature spell itself. If this happens, the creature won’t enter the battlefield with haste.)'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'As the second triggered ability resolves, you must cast the card if able. You must do so even if it requires targets and the only legal targets are ones that you really don’t want to target. Timing permissions based on the card’s type are ignored.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Cards exiled with suspend are exiled face up.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Exiling a card with suspend isn’t casting that card. This action doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a “suspended card,” that means a card that (1) has suspend, (2) is in exile, and (3) has one or more time counters on it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again at the beginning of the card’s owner’s next upkeep.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the second triggered ability is countered, the card can’t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it’s exiled.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you can’t cast the card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” such as with suspend, you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if you want to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Suspend is a keyword that represents three abilities. The first is a static ability that allows you to exile the card from your hand with the specified number of time counters (the number before the dash) on it by paying its suspend cost (listed after the dash). The second is a triggered ability that removes a time counter from the suspended card at the beginning of each of your upkeeps. The third is a triggered ability that causes you to cast the card when the last time counter is removed. If you cast a creature spell this way, it gains haste until you lose control of that creature (or, in rare cases, you lose control of the creature spell while it’s on the stack).'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'The mana value of a spell cast without paying its mana cost is determined by its mana cost, even though that cost wasn’t paid.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) triggers. It doesn’t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You are never forced to activate mana abilities to pay costs, so if there is a mandatory additional mana cost (such as from Thalia, Guardian of Thraben), you can decline to activate mana abilities to pay for it and hence fail to cast the suspended card, leaving it in exile.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effects that modify when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that stop you from casting it (such as from Meddling Mage’s ability) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or that requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2007-10-01\', \'text\': "The value chosen for X applies to each X in the spell\'s effect. You pay {X} only once."}]', "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'Effects that cause you to pay more or less to cast a spell will cause you to pay that much more or less while casting it for its evoke cost, too. That’s because they affect the total cost of the spell, not its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'Evoke doesn’t change the timing of when you can cast the creature that has it. If you could cast that creature spell only when you could cast a sorcery, the same is true for cast it with evoke.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'If a creature spell cast with evoke changes controllers before it enters the battlefield, it will still be sacrificed when it enters the battlefield. Similarly, if a creature cast with evoke changes controllers after it enters the battlefield but before its sacrifice ability resolves, it will still be sacrificed. In both cases, the controller of the creature at the time it left the battlefield will control its leaves-the-battlefield ability.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'If you’re casting a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t use its evoke ability.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'When you cast a spell by paying its evoke cost, its mana cost doesn’t change. You just pay the evoke cost instead.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'Whether evoke’s sacrifice ability triggers when the creature enters the battlefield depends on whether the spell’s controller chose to pay the evoke cost, not whether they actually paid it (if it was reduced or otherwise altered by another ability, for example).'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'A card with a monocolored hybrid mana symbol in its mana cost is each of the colors that appears in its mana cost, regardless of what mana was spent to cast it. Thus, Spectral Procession is white even if you spend six blue mana to cast it.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'A card with monocolored hybrid mana symbols in its mana cost has a converted mana cost equal to the highest possible cost it could be cast for. Its converted mana cost never changes. Thus, Spectral Procession has a converted mana cost of 6, even if you spend {W}{W}{W} to cast it.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If a cost includes more than one monocolored hybrid mana symbol, you can choose a different way to pay for each symbol. For example, you can pay for Spectral Procession by spending {W}{W}{W}, {2}{W}{W}, {4}{W}, or {6}.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If an effect reduces the cost to cast a spell by an amount of generic mana, it applies to a monocolored hybrid spell only if you’ve chosen a method of paying for it that includes generic mana.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'As the new wording makes clear, both targets must still be legal as the ability resolves in order for it to do anything. If either one or both has become illegal, nothing gets sacrificed and nothing gets returned to the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Cycling is an activated ability. Effects that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle or Rings of Brighthearth) will interact with cycling. Effects that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul or Faerie Tauntings) will not.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "If multiple effects modify your hand size, apply them in timestamp order. For example, if you put Null Profusion (an enchantment that says your maximum hand size is two) onto the battlefield and then put Reliquary Tower onto the battlefield, you\'ll have no maximum hand size. However, if those permanents enter the battlefield in the opposite order, your maximum hand size would be two."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Martial Coup checks the number you chose for X, not the amount of mana you actually spent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "No one can cast spells or activate abilities between the time the Soldier tokens are put onto the battlefield and the time all other creatures are destroyed. For example, you can\'t sacrifice one of those Soldier tokens to regenerate a Skeletal Kathari."}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "You do what the spell says in order. If X is 5 or more, you\'ll put the Soldier tokens onto the battlefield, then you\'ll destroy all other creatures."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Elvish Archdruid\'s first ability affects only other Elves you control. However, Elvish Archdruid\'s second ability counts all Elves you control — including itself."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "Elvish Archdruid\'s activated ability is a mana ability. It doesn\'t use the stack and players can\'t respond to it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "If the targeted permanent is an illegal target by the time Into the Roil resolves, the entire spell doesn\'t resolve. You don\'t draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers when a player casts a kicked spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger, but after targets have been chosen for that spell. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "If the target nonland permanent is an illegal target by the time Into the Roil tries to resolve, the spell doesn\'t resolve. You don\'t draw a card if it was kicked."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "If you copy a kicked spell, the copy is also kicked. If a card or token enters the battlefield as a copy of a permanent that\'s already on the battlefield, the new permanent isn\'t kicked, even if the original was."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "If you put a permanent with a kicker ability onto the battlefield without casting it, you can\'t kick it."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'Kicker represents an optional additional cost that you may choose to pay as you cast the spell. A spell cast with that additional cost paid is "kicked."\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "Some instant or sorcery spells require alternative or additional targets if they\'re kicked. You ignore these targeting requirements if those spells aren\'t kicked, and you can\'t kick those spells unless you can choose the appropriate targets. On the other hand, you can kick a permanent spell even if you won\'t be able to choose targets for an enters-the-battlefield ability of that permanent once the spell resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "To determine a spell\'s total cost, start with the mana cost (or an alternative cost if another card\'s effect allows you to pay one instead), add any cost increases (such as kicker), then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "You can\'t pay a kicker cost more than once."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "If you attack with multiple creatures, Beastmaster Ascension\'s first ability triggers multiple times."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Oran-Rief\'s second ability affects all permanents that are green creatures that entered the battlefield this turn, not just the ones you control."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Oran-Rief\'s third ability cares about permanents\' characteristics at the time the ability resolves, not their characteristics at the time they entered the battlefield. For example, if a blue creature enters the battlefield, then is turned green by a spell or ability, then Oran-Rief\'s second ability resolves, you\'ll put a +1/+1 counter on that creature."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "The landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability (such as Rampant Growth) causes you to put a land onto the battlefield under your control. It will even trigger when a spell or ability causes another player to put a land onto the battlefield under your control (as can happen with Yavimaya Dryad\'s ability, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one that resolves.\'}]', "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'As the token or tokens are created, they check the printed values of the creature they’re copying — or, if that creature is itself a token, the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that put it onto the battlefield — as well as any copy effects that have been applied to it. It won’t copy counters on the creature, nor will it copy other effects that have changed the creature’s power, toughness, types, color, or so on.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If the targeted creature is an illegal target by the time Rite of Replication resolves, the entire spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t get any tokens.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The tokens see each other enter the battlefield. If they have a triggered ability that triggers when a creature enters the battlefield, they’ll all trigger for one another.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Emeria, the Sky Ruin’s triggered ability has an “intervening ‘if’ clause.” That means (1) the ability won’t trigger at all unless you control seven or more Plains as your upkeep starts, and (2) the ability will do nothing if you control fewer than seven Plains by the time it resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Essentially, Sphinx of Jwar Isle lets you play with the top card of your library revealed only to you. Knowing what that card is becomes part of the information you have access to, just like you can look at the cards in your hand. You may look at the top card of your library whenever you want, even if you don’t have priority. This action doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If the top card of your library changes during the process of casting a spell or activating an ability, you can’t look at the new top card until the process of casting the spell or activating the ability ends (all targets are chosen, all costs are paid, and so on).'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If a targeted permanent is untapped at the time its controller’s next untap step begins, this ability has no effect on it. It won’t apply at some later time when the targeted permanent is tapped.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If an affected permanent changes controllers before its old controller’s next untap step, this ability will prevent it from being untapped during its new controller’s next untap step.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'You may target any eight (or fewer) permanents. It’s okay if any of them are already tapped, and it’s okay if any of them are controlled by someone other than the defending player.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If you have two Xathrid Demons, both abilities will trigger at the beginning of your upkeep. When the first Demon’s ability resolves, you can sacrifice the second Demon to satisfy the requirement (“Sacrifice a creature other than Xathrid Demon” really means “Sacrifice a creature other than this creature”). When the second Demon’s ability resolves, you must sacrifice another creature. If you can’t (because the first Demon has somehow left the battlefield and you control no other creatures), you lose 7 life, regardless of whether the second Demon is still on the battlefield at this time.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'When the ability resolves, if you control any other creatures, you must sacrifice one of them. You lose life only if no creature can be sacrificed.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Only white creatures you control at the time Brave the Elements resolves gain the protection ability. Creatures that come under your control later in the turn, or that turn white later in the turn, won’t have it.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'You choose a color as Brave the Elements resolves. Once the color is chosen, it’s too late for players to respond.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Overrun affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. It won’t affect creatures that come under your control later in the turn.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': "If multiple creatures you control (possibly including Butcher of Malakir itself) are put into their owners\' graveyards at the same time, Butcher of Malakir\'s triggered ability will trigger that many times."}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': "If you and an opponent each control a Butcher of Malakir and a creature is put into a graveyard, a chain reaction happens. First the ability of one player\'s Butcher will trigger, causing each opponent to sacrifice a creature. That sacrifice causes the ability of the other player\'s Butcher to trigger, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': "If you control more than one Butcher of Malakir and a creature you control is put into a graveyard, each of those Butchers\' abilities will trigger. Each opponent will sacrifice a creature each time one of those abilities resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': \'When the triggered ability resolves, first the player whose turn it is (if that player is an opponent) chooses which creature they will sacrifice, then each other opponent in turn order does the same, then all chosen creatures are sacrificed at the same time.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': "The landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability (such as Rampant Growth) causes you to put a land onto the battlefield under your control. It will even trigger when a spell or ability causes another player to put a land onto the battlefield under your control (as can happen with Yavimaya Dryad\'s ability, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': \'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one that resolves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': \'You choose whether to pay {2} as the ability resolves. You may pay {2} only once per resolution.\'}]', "[{'date': '2010-03-01', 'text': 'Assuming you can activate Tectonic Edge’s second ability, you can target any nonbasic land with it (not just one controlled by an opponent that controls four or more lands).'}, {'date': '2010-03-01', 'text': 'Tectonic Edge’s second ability checks how many lands an opponent controls only at the time you activate the ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-03-01', 'text': 'The last ability counts the total number of +1/+1 counters on Joraga Warcaller, not just the ones placed on it as a result of its enters-the-battlefield ability.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': \'The targeted permanents may be controlled by different players.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "If a targeted permanent has indestructible or regenerates, its controller won\'t get an Elephant token for it. Similarly, if the targeted permanent is destroyed but a replacement effect moves it to a different zone instead of its owner\'s graveyard, its controller won\'t get an Elephant token for it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "Annihilator abilities trigger and resolve during the declare attackers step. The defending player chooses and sacrifices the required number of permanents before they declare blockers. Any creatures sacrificed this way won\'t be able to block."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "If a creature with annihilator is attacking a planeswalker, and the defending player chooses to sacrifice that planeswalker, the attacking creature continues to attack. It may be blocked. If it isn\'t blocked, it simply won\'t deal combat damage to anything."}]', "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'At the beginning of your upkeep, all delayed triggered abilities created by rebound effects trigger. You may handle them in any order. If you want to cast a card this way, you do so as part of the resolution of its delayed triggered ability. Timing restrictions based on the card’s type (if it’s a sorcery) are ignored. Other restrictions are not (such as the one from Rule of Law).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a replacement effect would cause a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand to be put somewhere else instead of your graveyard (such as Leyline of the Void might), you choose whether to apply the rebound effect or the other effect as the spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand doesn’t resolve for any reason (due being countered by a spell like Cancel, or because all of its targets are illegal), rebound has no effect. The spell is simply put into your graveyard. You won’t get to cast it again next turn.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you are unable to cast a card from exile this way, or you choose not to, nothing happens when the delayed triggered ability resolves. The card remains exiled for the rest of the game, and you won’t get another chance to cast the card. The same is true if the ability is countered (due to Stifle, perhaps).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a card from exile this way, it will go to your graveyard when it resolves, fails to resolve, or is countered. It won’t go back to exile.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with rebound from anywhere other than your hand (such as from your graveyard due to Sins of the Past, from your library due to cascade, or from your opponent’s hand due to Sen Triplets), rebound won’t have any effect. If you do cast it from your hand, rebound will work regardless of whether you paid its mana cost (for example, if you cast it from your hand due to Maelstrom Archangel).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with rebound from your hand and it resolves, it isn’t put into your graveyard. Rather, it’s exiled directly from the stack. Effects that care about cards being put into your graveyard won’t do anything.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Rebound will have no effect on copies of spells because you don’t cast them from your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Both Tuktuk the Explorer and Tuktuk the Returned are legendary creatures. However, since they have different names, one of each may coexist without being affected by the “legend rule.”'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the targeted creature is an illegal target by the time the ability resolves, the ability doesn’t resolve. Drana won’t get the bonus.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The value of X may exceed the targeted creature’s toughness. Drana’s bonus is based on the value of X, regardless of what the targeted creature’s toughness was.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You may target Drana itself with its ability. For example, if you do and X is 3, Drana will become 7/1 until end of turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Pestilence Demon deals 1 damage to itself, as well as to each other creature and each player.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': "The affected creature\'s last known existence on the battlefield is checked to determine its toughness."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'A permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': "If a card in your graveyard has no mana symbols in its upper right corner (because it\'s a land card, for example), its mana value is 0."}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'If the mana cost of a card in your graveyard includes {X}, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a card in your graveyard is determined solely by the mana symbols printed in its upper right corner. The mana value is the total amount of mana in that cost, regardless of color. For example, a card with mana cost {3}{U}{U} has mana value 5.\'}]', "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'Frost Titan’s first ability affects each spell (including Aura spells), activated ability, and triggered ability that’s controlled by an opponent and that Frost Titan becomes a target of.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If the permanent affected by Frost Titan’s second ability changes controllers before its old controller’s next untap step, Frost Titan’s second ability will prevent it from being untapped during its new controller’s next untap step.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If the permanent affected by Frost Titan’s second ability is untapped at the time that permanent’s controller’s next untap step begins, the last part of Frost Titan’s second ability has no effect.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'You may target any permanent with Frost Titan’s second ability. It’s okay if that permanent is already tapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'You check the power of your creatures as Overwhelming Stampede resolves. For example, if you control a 2/1 creature, a 2/2 creature, a 2/4 creature, a 4/1 creature, a 5/5 creature, and a 5/6 creature at that time, each of your creatures gets +5/+5 and gains trample until end of turn.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "Becoming an artifact doesn\'t change what color(s) a permanent is."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'You may target any permanent with the ability, including an artifact.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If Steel Hellkite\'s third ability is activated with X equal to 0, it will destroy each nonland permanent with mana value 0 the appropriate players control."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If a nonland permanent has no mana symbols in its upper right corner (because it\'s a token that\'s not copying of something else, for example), its mana value is 0."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If a permanent is copying something else, its mana value is the mana value of whatever it\'s copying."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'If the mana cost of a permanent includes {X}, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'In all cases, ignore any alternative costs or additional costs (such as kicker) paid when the permanent was cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "It doesn\'t matter who controlled those permanents at the time Steel Hellkite dealt combat damage, or if those permanents were even on the battlefield at that time."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "Steel Hellkite\'s last ability destroys only nonland permanents whose mana value is exactly equal to X, and only those controlled by players who have been dealt combat damage by Steel Hellkite this turn."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "The mana value of a permanent is determined solely by the mana symbols printed in its upper right corner, unless it\'s copying something else (see below). The mana value is the total amount of mana in that cost, regardless of color. For example, a card with mana cost {3}{U}{U} has mana value 5."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "You may activate the last ability even if Steel Hellkite hasn\'t dealt combat damage to any players that turn. If you do, the ability won\'t do anything."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "The second ability destroys each creature that\'s tapped at the time it resolves, including creatures you control. If Sunblast Angel has become tapped by the time its ability resolves, it will be destroyed too."}]', "[{'date': '2011-01-01', 'text': 'Ezuri’s first ability can’t affect itself, but its second ability does.'}, {'date': '2011-01-01', 'text': 'Only Elf creatures you control when the last ability resolves will get +3/+3 and gain trample until end of turn. Non-Elf creatures that become Elves or Elf creatures that enter the battlefield under your control later in the turn won’t get the bonuses.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'If the mana cost of a permanent includes {X}, that X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If the targeted artifact is an illegal target by the time the activated ability resolves, the ability doesn\'t resolve. Hoard-Smelter Dragon won\'t get the bonus."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "If the activated ability resolves but the targeted artifact isn\'t destroyed (perhaps because it has indestructible or it regenerates), Hoard-Smelter Dragon will still get the bonus."}]', "[{'date': '2011-01-01', 'text': 'It must be clear to all players which token has deathtouch and which token has lifelink.'}, {'date': '2011-01-01', 'text': 'The two creature tokens enter the battlefield at the same time.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-01', 'text': 'The bonus counts all lands on the battlefield with the same name as the exiled card, not just lands you control.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-01', 'text': 'The second ability triggers and resolves during the declare attackers step. The target permanent will be destroyed before blockers are declared.'}, {'date': '2011-01-01', 'text': 'You may target any permanent with the triggered ability, not just one controlled by the defending player. If no other player controls a permanent, you must target one of your own.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Count the number of creature cards in your graveyard when Grim Flowering resolves.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "Although creature tokens go to the graveyard before ceasing to exist, they never count as creature cards and won\'t increase the bonus granted by Bonehoard, however briefly."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "If lethal damage is dealt simultaneously to the equipped creature and another creature, both creatures are put into the graveyard at the same time. The equipped creature won\'t get an additional bonus from the other creature."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "If there are no creature cards in any graveyard when Bonehoard\'s living weapon ability resolves, the Germ will be 0/0 and put into its owner\'s graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': \'The value of X is calculated continuously as the number of creature cards in graveyards changes.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If the Germ token is destroyed, the Equipment remains on the battlefield as with any other Equipment.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If the living weapon trigger causes two Germs to be created (due to an effect such as that of Doubling Season), the Equipment becomes attached to one of them. The other will be put into your graveyard and subsequently cease to exist, unless another effect raises its toughness above 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Like other Equipment, each Equipment with living weapon has an equip cost. You can pay this cost to attach an Equipment to another creature you control. Once the Germ token is no longer equipped, it will be put into your graveyard and subsequently cease to exist, unless another effect raises its toughness above 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'The Germ token enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature and the Equipment becomes attached to it before state-based actions would cause the token to die. Abilities that trigger as the token enters the battlefield see that a 0/0 creature entered the battlefield.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "If this spell doesn\'t resolve, none of its effects occur. In particular, it will go to the graveyard rather than to its owner\'s library."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "Pristine Talisman has a mana ability. Its ability doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "Spine of Ish Sah\'s last ability doesn\'t allow you to sacrifice it. You must find another way to get Spine of Ish Sah into the graveyard."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "The ability will trigger when Ichor Wellspring is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, even if the ability that triggered when it entered the battlefield hasn\'t resolved yet."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "The ability will trigger when Mycosynth Wellspring is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, even if the ability that triggered when it entered the battlefield hasn\'t resolved yet."}]', "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'Fresh Meat counts all creatures you owned that went to the graveyard this turn, including creature tokens that entered the battlefield under your control and nontoken creatures you owned but didn’t control.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'Once you activate the ability and sacrifice an artifact, it’s too late for anyone to respond to try and prevent you from paying the cost.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'A permanent card is a card with one or more of the following card types: artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If the permanent is an illegal target by the time Chaos Warp tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will occur. No library will be shuffled and no card will be revealed."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If the revealed card is a permanent card but can\'t enter the battlefield (perhaps because it\'s an Aura with nothing to enchant), it remains on top of that library."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'If the revealed card is not a permanent card, it remains on top of that library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "The owner of a token is the player under whose control the token was put onto the battlefield. If a token is shuffled into a player\'s library this way, that player shuffles before revealing the top card of that library."}]', "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'As long as Geist-Honored Monk is on the battlefield, its second ability will count itself.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The ability that defines Geist-Honored Monk’s power and toughness works in all zones, not just the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Grand Abolisher doesn’t affect triggered abilities or static abilities.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Grand Abolisher doesn’t stop your opponents from activating abilities of artifact, creature, or enchantment cards in zones other than the battlefield (like cycling abilities, for example).'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The morbid ability is mandatory. If you control the only non-Demon creature when the ability triggers, you must choose it as the target.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'You can remove any +1/+1 counter on Pentavus to activate its first activated ability, not just ones created by Pentavus’s other abilities.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'You can sacrifice any Pentavite creature you control (such as an Adaptive Automaton with Pentavite as its chosen type) to activate Pentavus’s second activated ability, not just ones created by Pentavus’s other abilities.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'A creature card that enters the battlefield as a copy of a token creature is still a nontoken creature. You’ll be able to draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'Because creatures you control enter the battlefield as a copy of the enchanted creature, any enters-the-battlefield triggered abilities printed on such creatures won’t trigger. However, if the enchanted creature has any enters-the-battlefield triggered abilities, those will trigger.'}, {'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'Creatures you control don’t copy whether the enchanted creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it, whether it has any Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any noncopy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on.'}, {'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'External abilities may still affect how a creature enters the battlefield. For example, if your opponent controls Urabrask the Hidden, which reads, in part, “Creatures your opponents control enter the battlefield tapped,” a creature entering the battlefield under your control will be a tapped copy of the enchanted creature.'}, {'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'If Infinite Reflection enters the battlefield attached to a creature and then becomes attached to a different creature before its enters-the-battlefield trigger resolves, each other nontoken creature you control will become a copy of the first creature.'}, {'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'If Infinite Reflection enters the battlefield attached to a token creature, the nontoken creatures that become copies of that creature are not themselves tokens.'}, {'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'If Infinite Reflection leaves the battlefield or becomes attached to a different creature, none of the copy effects end. Your creatures will still be copies of whatever creature each was a copy of.'}, {'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'If a creature such as Clone is entering the battlefield under your control, there will be two copy effects to apply: the creature’s own and Infinite Reflection’s. No matter what order these effects are applied, the creature will be a copy of the enchanted creature when it enters the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'If you control more than one Infinite Reflection, you can apply those copy effects in any order. Creatures you control will enter the battlefield as a copy of the one whose copy effect you apply last.'}, {'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'Infinite Reflection can enchant a creature controlled by another player.'}, {'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'Other enters-the-battlefield replacement abilities printed on the creature entering the battlefield won’t be applied because the creature will already be a copy of the enchanted creature at that point (and therefore it won’t have those abilities). For example, if the enchanted creature is Serra Angel, a creature that normally enters the battlefield tapped will enter the battlefield as an untapped copy of Serra Angel, and a creature that would normally enter the battlefield with counters on it will enter the battlefield as a copy of Serra Angel with no counters.'}, {'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'Replacement effects that modify how a permanent enters the battlefield are now applied in the following order: control-changing effects (such as Gather Specimens), then copy effects (such as the abilities of Infinite Reflection and Clone), then all other effects.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'Evernight Shade’s ability doesn’t put +1/+1 counters on it; it just gives Evernight Shade +1/+1 until end of turn. If Evernight Shade has no +1/+1 counters on it and dies after its ability has resolved, undying will still return it to the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'The creature that entered the battlefield and caused the ability to trigger will also get a +1/+1 counter, provided it’s still on the battlefield when the ability resolves.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': "Magmaquake doesn\'t target any creature or planeswalker. For example, it will deal damage to a creature without flying that has hexproof."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': "The effect is based on the number of Swamps you control when Mutilate resolves. Only creatures on the battlefield at that time will be affected. The effect won\'t change later in the turn, even if the number of Swamps you control changes."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "The amount of life you gain from extort is based on the total amount of life lost, not necessarily the number of opponents you have. For example, if your opponent\'s life total can\'t change (perhaps because that player controls Platinum Emperion), you won\'t gain any life."}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "The extort ability doesn\'t target any player."}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': \'You may pay {W/B} a maximum of one time for each extort triggered ability. You decide whether to pay when the ability resolves.\'}]', "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you cast this card for its evoke cost, you may put the sacrifice trigger and the regular enters-the-battlefield trigger on the stack in either order. The one put on the stack last will resolve first.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The amount of life you gain from extort is based on the total amount of life lost, not necessarily the number of opponents you have. For example, if your opponent’s life total can’t change (perhaps because that player controls Platinum Emperion), you won’t gain any life.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The extort ability doesn’t target any player.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You may pay {W/B} a maximum of one time for each extort triggered ability. You decide whether to pay when the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a creature with persist stops being a creature, persist will still work.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a creature with persist that has +1/+1 counters on it receives enough -1/-1 counters to cause it to be destroyed by lethal damage or put into its owner’s graveyard for having 0 or less toughness, persist won’t trigger and the card won’t return to the battlefield. That’s because persist checks the creature’s existence just before it leaves the battlefield, and it still has all those counters on it at that point.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a permanent has multiple instances of persist, they’ll each trigger separately, but the redundant instances will have no effect. If one instance returns the card to the battlefield, the next to resolve will do nothing.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a token with no -1/-1 counters on it has persist, the ability will trigger when the token is put into the graveyard. However, the token will cease to exist and can’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If multiple creatures with persist are put into the graveyard at the same time (due to combat damage or a spell that destroys all creatures, for example), the active player (the player whose turn it is) puts all of their persist triggers on the stack in any order, then each other player in turn order does the same. The last trigger put on the stack is the first one that resolves. That means that in a two-player game, the nonactive player’s persist creatures will return to the battlefield first, then the active player’s persist creatures do the same. The creatures return to the battlefield one at a time.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'The persist ability triggers when the permanent is put into a graveyard. Its last known information (that is, how the creature last existed on the battlefield) is used to determine whether it had a -1/-1 counter on it.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'When a permanent with persist returns to the battlefield, it’s a new object with no memory of or connection to its previous existence.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'Masked Admirers will return to your hand before the creature spell you cast resolves.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'The second triggered ability triggers only if Masked Admirers is in your graveyard when you cast a creature spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If the player’s hand is empty when the triggered ability resolves, you’ll still put a Zombie token onto the battlefield.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Scry appears on some spells and abilities with one or more targets. If all of the spell or ability\'s targets are illegal when it tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t scry."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "The loss of life is part of the spell\'s effect. It\'s not an additional cost. If Read the Bones doesn\'t resolve, you won\'t lose life."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'When you scry, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards on the bottom of your library, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them on the bottom.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'You choose how to order cards returned to your library after scrying no matter where you put them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, that means you\'ll scry last. For others, that means you\'ll scry and then perform other actions."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': "Although Darksteel Citadel is an artifact, it can\'t be cast as a spell. Playing it follows the normal rules for playing a land."}]', "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Effects that modify a creature’s power and/or toughness, such as the effect of Titanic Growth, will apply to the creature no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for any counters that change its power and/or toughness and effects that switch its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If one of the Theros block Gods is affected by Turn to Frog, it will be a legendary 1/1 blue Frog enchantment creature with no abilities. If it stops being a creature, perhaps because your devotion to its color(s) decreased, it will be a legendary blue enchantment with no abilities. The way continuous effects work, the God’s type-changing ability is applied before the effect that removes that ability is applied.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If the affected creature gains an ability after Turn to Frog resolves, it will keep that ability.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The creature will lose all other colors and creature types, but it will retain any other card types (such as artifact) or supertypes (such as legendary) it may have.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Turn to Frog doesn’t counter abilities that have already triggered or been activated. In particular, there is no way to cast this spell to stop a creature’s ability that says “At the beginning of your upkeep,” “When this creature enters the battlefield,” or similar from triggering.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Turn to Frog overwrites all previous effects that set the creature’s base power and toughness to specific values. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply after Turn to Frog resolves will overwrite this effect.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "Comeuppance\'s effect is not a redirection effect. If it prevents damage, Comeuppance (not the original source) deals damage to the permanent or player as part of that prevention effect. Comeuppance is the source of the new damage, so the characteristics of the original source (such as its color, or whether it had lifelink or deathtouch) don\'t affect the new damage. The new damage is not combat damage, even if the prevented damage was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "Count the number of creature cards in your graveyard as the triggered ability resolves, including Hallowed Spiritkeeper itself if it\'s still there, to determine how many Spirits are created."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "Each creature\'s controller still chooses which player or planeswalker the creature attacks."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "If there are multiple combat phases in a turn, creatures must attack during each combat phase in which they\'re able to."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "If, during a player\'s declare attackers step, a creature is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can\'t attack, or hasn\'t been under that player\'s control continuously since the turn began (and doesn\'t have haste), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having a creature attack, the player isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack in that case either."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "Only creatures that are attacking when the last ability resolves will get +1/+0. That is, activating that ability before attackers have been declared won\'t give the bonus to any creatures, including ones that attack later in the turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "Each of those creatures blocks only if it\'s able to do so as the declare blockers step begins. If, at that time, one of the creatures is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can\'t block, or no creatures are attacking that creature\'s controller or a planeswalker controlled by that player, then it doesn\'t block. If there\'s a cost associated with having the creature block, the player isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t block in that case either."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "Notably, Domineering Will doesn\'t give any of the target creatures haste. Unless they have haste due to some other means, they won\'t be able to attack that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': \'The controller of the creatures still chooses which attacking creature each of the three target creatures blocks.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "Fell the Mighty won\'t destroy the target creature."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target when Fell the Mighty tries to resolve, Fell the Mighty won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No creatures will be destroyed."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "Use the power of the target creature as Fell the Mighty resolves to determine which creatures are destroyed. Fell the Mighty doesn\'t target any of those creatures, so a creature with hexproof or protection from white will be destroyed if its power is high enough."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "If an effect instructs you to sacrifice a creature, and you control any creatures other than the creature equipped with Assault Suit, you must sacrifice one of them. You can\'t try to sacrifice the equipped creature, fail, and therefore ignore the effect."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "The equipped creature can\'t be sacrificed for any reason. If an effect instructs you to sacrifice it, you can\'t and it remains on the battlefield. You also can\'t sacrifice it to pay a cost that requires you to sacrifice a creature."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "If the creature is normally colorless, it will simply become black. It can\'t be both black and colorless."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "Necromantic Selection doesn\'t overwrite any of the creature\'s colors or types. Rather, it adds another color and another creature type."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "In some unusual cases, the Spirit tokens will have a toughness of 0 or less as they enter the battlefield, perhaps because an opponent controls an enchantment that gives your creatures -1/-1. Because state-based actions aren\'t performed in the middle of a spell\'s resolution, you\'ll gain 2 life for each of those Spirit tokens. After Benevolent Offering has finished resolving, the Spirit tokens will die and subsequently cease to exist."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': \'You choose the opponents for each effect as the spell resolves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': \'You may choose the same opponent for each of the effects, or you may choose different opponents. None of the affected players are targets of the spell.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "You must choose six different legal targets in order to cast Aether Gale. If some, but not all, of those targets become illegal before Aether Gale resolves, the remaining legal targets will be put into their owners\' hands."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "“Exiled this way” refers to the exile instruction that\'s part of the ability\'s effect. If the cards each player would put into their graveyard are exiled because of a replacement effect, those cards won\'t be in the graveyards to be exiled by the next part of the ability. In this case, the value of X will be 0. You\'ll put a 0/0 token onto the battlefield, then that token will die and subsequently cease to exist (unless something else raises its toughness above 0)."}]', "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'After the second ability resolves, continuous effects generated by the resolution of spells and abilities that would give hexproof or shroud to one of the affected creatures aren’t created. For example, after the second ability resolves, a spell cast by an opponent that gives creatures they control hexproof wouldn’t cause the creatures to have hexproof. (If that spell has additional effects, such as raising the power of the creatures, those effects will apply as normal.)'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'Continuous effects generated by static abilities (such as an Aura that grants hexproof to a creature) will not apply during the turn, but will resume applying once the turn ends.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'The second ability applies only to creatures controlled by your opponents when it resolves. Creatures that enter the battlefield or come under an opponent’s control later in the turn won’t be affected.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'Bitter Feud applies to damage dealt by any source controlled by one of the chosen players, not just combat damage.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'If multiple effects modify how damage is dealt, the player being dealt damage, or the controller of the permanent being dealt damage, chooses the order in which to apply the effects. For example, the ability of Decorated Griffin says “{1}{W}: Prevent the next 1 combat damage that would be dealt to you this turn.” Suppose you control a Decorated Griffin, and you and an opponent are the chosen players for a Bitter Feud. If a creature that player controls would deal 3 combat damage to you, and Decorated Griffin’s ability has resolved once, you can choose to either (a) apply the effect from Decorated Griffin first and prevent 1 damage, and then let Bitter Feud’s effect double the remaining 2 damage, for a result 4 damage being dealt to you, or (b) let Bitter Feud’s effect apply first and double the damage to 6, and then apply the effect from Decorated Griffin to prevent 1 damage, for a result of 5 damage being dealt to you.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'If there are two Bitter Feuds on the battlefield, and the same two players were chosen for each, damage dealt will be doubled for each. So, two Bitter Feuds will end up multiplying the damage by four, three will multiply the damage by eight, and four by sixteen.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'The source of the damage doesn’t change. A spell that deals damage will specify the source of the damage. This is usually the spell itself. An ability that deals damage will specify the source of the damage, although it will never be the ability itself. Usually the source of the ability is also the source of the damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'Creatures that were declared as attackers or entered the battlefield attacking continue to be attacking creatures until the combat phase ends. It’s possible to exile all attacking creatures after they’ve dealt combat damage if you cast Angel of the Dire Hour during the combat damage step or end of combat step.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'If a spell or ability instructs you to put Angel of the Dire Hour onto the battlefield from your hand, that means you won’t have cast it, so its triggered ability won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'If you cast Angel of the Dire Hour outside of combat, its triggered ability will trigger but have no effect.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'Effects that modify the target creature’s power and/or toughness, such as the effect of Giant Growth or Glorious Anthem, will apply to the creature no matter when they started applying. The same is true for counters that affect the target creature’s power and toughness and effects that switch its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'The activated ability overwrites all previous effects that set the target creature’s base power and/or toughness to specific values. Other effects that set its base power and/or toughness that start to apply after Creeperhulk’s ability resolves will overwrite Creeperhulk’s effect.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'If Demon of Wailing Agonies deals combat damage to a player at the same time your commander is dealt lethal damage, the triggered ability will trigger and the player will sacrifice a creature.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'If a triggered ability granted by a lieutenant ability triggers, and in response to that trigger you lose control of your commander (causing the lieutenant to lose that ability), that triggered ability will still resolve.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'If you gain control of a creature with a lieutenant ability owned by another player, that ability will check to see if you control your commander and will apply if you do. It won’t check whether its owner controls their commander.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'If you lose control of your commander, lieutenant abilities of creatures you control will immediately stop applying. If this causes a creature’s toughness to become less than or equal to the amount of damage marked on it, the creature will be destroyed.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'Lieutenant abilities apply only if your commander is on the battlefield and under your control.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'Lieutenant abilities refer only to whether you control your commander, not any other player’s commander.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'If Impact Resonance has multiple targets, and some, but not all, of them become illegal before Impact Resonance resolves, Impact Resonance will still deal damage to the remaining legal targets according to the original damage division.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'Impact Resonance looks at the entire turn to see the greatest amount of damage dealt from a single source to a single permanent or player. For example, if the only damage dealt during the turn was Earthquake, which dealt 5 damage to each of four creatures and two players, then X is 5.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'You determine the value for X and announce how damage will be divided as you cast Impact Resonance. Each chosen target must receive at least 1 damage. Once the value of X is determined, it won’t change, even if a source deals a greater amount of damage before Impact Resonance resolves. (Most of the time, the value of X in an effect would be determined only as the spell resolves. However, the rules state that if damage needs to be “divided,” that information is checked as the spell is put on the stack.)'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'If Raving Dead can’t attack the chosen player for one of the above reasons but it can still attack elsewhere, you may choose to have it attack another player, attack a planeswalker, or not attack at all.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'If your turn has multiple combat phases, Raving Dead’s ability triggers at the beginning of each of them. Ignore any choices made during previous combat phases that turn.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'If, as attackers are declared, Raving Dead is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t attack, or hasn’t been under your control continuously since your turn began (and doesn’t have haste), then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having Raving Dead attack the chosen player, you aren’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to attack that player in that case either.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'Raving Dead must attack the chosen player if able, not a planeswalker controlled by that player.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'The last ability triggers and resolves after combat damage has been dealt. For example, if an opponent has 17 life and Raving Dead deals 2 combat damage to them, they will end up at 8 life.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': \'If a triggered ability granted by a lieutenant ability triggers, and in response to that trigger you lose control of your commander (causing the lieutenant to lose that ability), that triggered ability will still resolve.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "If you gain control of a creature with a lieutenant ability owned by another player, that ability will check to see if you control your commander and will apply if you do. It won\'t check whether its owner controls their commander."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "If you lose control of your commander, lieutenant abilities of creatures you control will immediately stop applying. If this causes a creature\'s toughness to become less than or equal to the amount of damage marked on it, the creature will be destroyed."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': \'Lieutenant abilities apply only if your commander is on the battlefield and under your control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "Lieutenant abilities refer only to whether you control your commander, not any other player\'s commander."}]', "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'If a triggered ability granted by a lieutenant ability triggers, and in response to that trigger you lose control of your commander (causing the lieutenant to lose that ability), that triggered ability will still resolve.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'If you gain control of a creature with a lieutenant ability owned by another player, that ability will check to see if you control your commander and will apply if you do. It won’t check whether its owner controls their commander.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'If you lose control of your commander, lieutenant abilities of creatures you control will immediately stop applying. If this causes a creature’s toughness to become less than or equal to the amount of damage marked on it, the creature will be destroyed.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'Lieutenant abilities apply only if your commander is on the battlefield and under your control.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'Lieutenant abilities refer only to whether you control your commander, not any other player’s commander.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'If either the target creature or the target player is an illegal target when the activated ability tries to resolve, the ability will have no effect. The creature won’t be forced to attack that opponent, but it still can if able.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'If the creature can’t attack the player for one of the above reasons but it can still attack elsewhere, its controller may choose to have it attack another player, attack a planeswalker, or not attack at all.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'If, as attackers are declared, the target creature is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t attack, or hasn’t been under its controller’s control continuously since their last turn began (and doesn’t have haste), then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having the creature attack the opponent, its controller isn’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to attack that player in that case either.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'The target creature must attack the target opponent if able, not a planeswalker controlled by that player.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': '“Target opponent” means one of your opponents. In other words, Dulcet Sirens’s ability can’t make a creature attack you.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'If the permanent was an Aura or an Equipment, it becomes unattached from whatever it was attached to.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'The enchanted permanent loses any card types, subtypes, and colors it previously had. It keeps any supertypes it had and its name remains unchanged. It gains “{T}: Add {G}” and loses all other abilities from its rules text. It will still have any abilities it gained from other effects.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'If you control Teferi’s emblem, the rule that says you can activate a loyalty ability only if none of that permanent’s loyalty abilities have been activated that turn still applies. In other words, you could activate a planeswalker’s loyalty ability once on your turn and once on each of your opponents’ turns.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'If you control The Chain Veil (from the Magic 2015 core set) and its activated ability has resolved, and you also control Teferi’s emblem, for each planeswalker you control, you can activate one of its loyalty abilities during that turn any time you could cast an instant, and then you may activate a loyalty ability again that turn (choosing the same loyalty ability or a different one) any time you could cast an instant.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'The ability of Daretti’s emblem will return the artifact card only if it’s still in your graveyard when the delayed triggered ability resolves at the beginning of the next end step. If the artifact card left your graveyard before that point (even if it was put back into your graveyard), the ability won’t return it to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'You choose which artifact to sacrifice as the second ability resolves. You must sacrifice an artifact if you control at least one at that time. For example, if you control two artifacts when you activate the second ability, but the artifact you intended to sacrifice is destroyed in response, you must sacrifice the other artifact as the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'You may choose to discard zero cards as the first ability resolves. In that case, you won’t draw any cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'The chosen opponent for each effect may choose the same target nonbasic land or creature you don’t control that you did.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'Unlike the other Offerings, you choose the opponents for Volcanic Offering as you cast the spell because those players are involved in choosing the spell’s targets.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'You may choose the same opponent for each of the effects, or you may choose different opponents. None of the affected players are targets of the spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'The creature type each player chooses applies only to that player. For example, if another player chose Elf, you wouldn’t return Elf cards to your hand unless you also chose Elf (or if an Elf card in your graveyard also had the creature type you chose).'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'The damage is dealt simultaneously. If this causes all players to have 0 or less life, the game is a draw.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'The delayed triggered ability that makes you sacrifice the creatures will trigger only once. If you don’t sacrifice one or more of those creatures at that time (perhaps because another player gained control of them), the ability won’t try to make you sacrifice them on future turns.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'The sacrifice isn’t optional. If you control at least one creature, you must sacrifice one. If you control no creatures, you won’t sacrifice one and you won’t draw two cards. The same is true for the chosen opponent.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'You choose the opponents for each effect as the spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'You choose which creature card you’re returning to the battlefield, then the chosen opponent chooses which creature card they are returning. These choices aren’t made until Infernal Offering resolves. Neither card is a target of Infernal Offering.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'You may choose the same opponent for each of the effects, or you may choose different opponents. None of the affected players are targets of the spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'The triggered ability affects all nonblue creatures, including those you control.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'The triggered ability tracks the creatures, but not their controllers. If any of the creatures changes controllers before its original controller’s next untap step has come around, that creature won’t untap during its new controller’s next untap step.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'Use Flesh Carver’s power when it died (including any +1/+1 counters it had) to determine the value of X.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'Use Lifeblood Hydra’s power when it died (including any +1/+1 counters it had) to determine how much life to gain and how many cards to draw.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'Use the number of creatures that died that turn as Spoils of Blood resolves to determine the value of X. In other words, creatures that die in response to Spoils of Blood will count.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'You are Crown of Doom’s owner if it started the game in your deck. Therefore, once you hand off the Crown, your opponents cannot give it back to you by activating its ability (although other effects, such as the one Zedruu the Greathearted’s ability creates, may do this).'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'You choose the opponents for each effect as the spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'You may choose the same opponent for each of the effects, or you may choose different opponents. None of the affected players are targets of the spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'You decide whether to assign a creature’s combat damage as though it weren’t blocked just before it assigns that damage. You may make a different choice for each creature you control—that is, you may have none, some, or all of those creatures assign combat damage as though they weren’t blocked.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': '“Exiled this way” refers to the exile instruction that’s part of Scrap Mastery’s effect. If the sacrificed artifacts are instead exiled because of a replacement effect, those cards won’t be put onto the battlefield.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': "As Dualcaster Mage\'s triggered ability resolves, it creates a copy of a spell on the stack. The copy isn\'t cast, so abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': "Dualcaster Mage\'s triggered ability can target (and copy) any instant or sorcery spell, not just one with targets. It doesn\'t matter who controls it."}, {\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': \'If the copy says that it affects "you," it affects the controller of the copy, not the controller of the original spell. Similarly, if the copy says that it affects an "opponent," it affects an opponent of the copy\\\'s controller, not an opponent of the original spell\\\'s controller.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': \'If the spell has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Earthquake does), the copy has the same value of X.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': \'If the spell is modal (that is, it says "Choose one —" or the like), the copy will have the same mode. You can\\\'t choose a different one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': "The copy will have the same targets as the spell it\'s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}, {\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': "You can\'t choose to pay any additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any additional or alternative costs paid for the targeted spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy."}]', "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Abilities that define a creature’s power and toughness apply while that card is in exile, but abilities that add or subtract from it don’t. For example, the ability of Battle Squadron applies to determine Phyrexian Ingester’s power and toughness, but the ability of Werebear doesn’t. Phyrexian Ingester’s power and toughness are constantly updated if the exiled card’s power and/or toughness change.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'If the card in exile isn’t a creature card (perhaps because it was a land that was temporarily a creature while on the battlefield), Phyrexian Ingester doesn’t get a bonus.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Phyrexian Ingester will get bonuses based on the card’s power and toughness in exile. Counters, Auras, and Equipment it had on it before it was exiled won’t add to those numbers.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'If the targeted creature is an illegal target when Annihilate tries to resolve, the entire spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Lys Alana Huntmaster’s ability will resolve before the Elf spell that caused it to trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Nothing happens if there are no nonartifact, nonblack creatures on the battlefield when Nekrataal enters the battlefield, but if there is one, you must target it, even if it’s a creature you control.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'The copy of Malicious Affliction is created on the stack. It’s not cast, so the copy won’t cause the morbid ability to trigger again.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'The copy will have the same target as the original spell unless you choose a new one. You don’t have to change this target if you don’t want to or can’t choose a new legal target (perhaps because there are no other nonblack creatures on the battlefield).'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'The number of Elves on the battlefield is counted only as Timberwatch Elf’s ability resolves. If Timberwatch Elf is still on the battlefield, it’ll count itself.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': \'You draw two cards and discard two cards all while Faithless Looting is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the chosen creature will also work.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If the copied creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If the copied creature is a token, the token that’s created copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created the token.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If the copied creature is copying something else (for example, if the copied creature is an Evil Twin), then the token enters the battlefield as whatever that creature copied.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'The token copies exactly what was printed on the original creature and nothing else (unless that creature is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn’t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it’s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card’s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': '“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”'}]", "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If there’s only one card in your library as Sea Gate Oracle’s ability resolves, you’ll put it into your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'The target player can discard either one land card or two cards which may or may not be lands. The player can discard one land and one other card or two land cards if they choose.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "A pile can have no cards in it. In this case, you\'ll choose whether to put all the revealed cards into your hand or into your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "In multiplayer games, you choose an opponent to separate the cards when the ability resolves. This doesn\'t target that opponent. Because the cards are revealed, all players may see the cards and offer opinions."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'You (not your opponent) choose which pile to put into your hand and which to put into your graveyard.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "Abyssal Persecutor won\'t preclude an opponent\'s life total from reaching 0 or less. It will just preclude that player from losing the game as a result."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'Effects that say the game is a draw, such as the _Legends_(TM) card Divine Intervention, are not affected by Abyssal Persecutor.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "Even though your opponents can\'t lose the game, a player can\'t pay an amount of life that\'s greater than their life total. If a player\'s life total is 0 or less, that player can\'t pay life at all, with one exception: a player may always pay 0 life."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'If Abyssal Persecutor leaves the battlefield while an opponent has 0 or less life, that opponent will lose the game as a state-based action. No player can respond between the time Abyssal Persecutor leaves the battlefield and the time that player loses the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "No game effect can cause you to win the game or cause any opponent to lose the game while you control Abyssal Persecutor. It doesn\'t matter whether an opponent has 0 or less life, an opponent is forced to draw a card while their library is empty, an opponent has ten or more poison counters, an opponent is dealt combat damage by Phage the Untouchable, you control Felidar Sovereign and have 40 or more life, or so on. You keep playing."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "Other circumstances can still cause an opponent to lose the game, however. An opponent will lose a game if they concede, if that player is penalized with a Game Loss or a Match Loss during a sanctioned tournament due to a DCI rules infraction, or if that player\'s Magic Online® game clock runs out of time."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If some of the creatures or players are illegal targets as Bogardan Hellkite\'s triggered ability tries to resolve, the original division of damage still applies and the damage that would have been dealt to the illegal targets is lost. It won\'t be dealt instead to a legal target."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "You choose how many targets Bogardan Hellkite\'s triggered ability has and how the damage is divided as you put the ability onto the stack. Each target must receive at least 1 damage."}]', "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Fog Bank’s prevention effect isn’t considered while assigning combat damage from a creature with trample. For example, if it blocks a 5/5 creature with trample, that creature’s controller must assign 2 of that creature’s combat damage to Fog Bank and the remainder can be assigned to the defending player or planeswalker.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If Blood Moon is on the battlefield and a player controls a face-down Zoetic Cavern, it can\'t be turned face up since it won\'t have a morph cost."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "When Zoetic Cavern is turned face up, any Auras on it that can\'t legally enchant it will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on it will remain on it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If a creature enters the battlefield under your control and gains haste, but then loses it before attacking, it won\'t be able to attack that turn. This means that you can\'t use one Swiftfoot Boots to allow two new creatures to attack in the same turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "You can choose to find one basic land card with Myriad Landscape\'s last ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'A mana cost of {X}{X} means that you pay twice X. If you want X to be 3, you pay {8}{W}{W} to cast Decree of Justice.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "The cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. If the triggered ability doesn\'t resolve (because, for example, it has been countered, or all of its targets have become illegal), the cycling ability will still resolve, and you\'ll draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': \'When you cycle this card, first the cycling ability goes on the stack, then the triggered ability goes on the stack on top of it. The triggered ability will resolve before you draw a card from the cycling ability.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'All players get to see which card you return to your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Because Haunted Fengraf\'s ability doesn\'t target any creature card, any creature card put into the graveyard in response to that ability may be returned to your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "The creature card returned to your hand is chosen at random as the ability resolves. If any player responds to the ability, that player won\'t yet know what card will be returned."}]', "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If blocked by a creature with banding, the defending player decides whether or not the damage is assigned “as though it weren’t blocked”.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'When assigning combat damage, you choose whether you want to assign all damage to blocking creatures, or if you want to assign all of it to the player or planeswalker this creature is attacking. You can’t split the damage assignment between them.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'You can decide to assign damage to the defending player or planeswalker even if the blocking creature has protection from green or damage preventing effects on it.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Apply power bonuses from counters the creature enters the battlefield with and continuous effects such as that of Valiant Knight before checking to see if Mentor of the Meek\'s ability will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Mentor of the Meek\'s ability checks the power of the other creature only as it enters the battlefield. If that creature\'s power is 2 or less, the ability will trigger. Once the ability triggers, raising that creature\'s power above 2 won\'t affect that ability. Similarly, reducing the creature\'s power to 2 or less after it enters the battlefield won\'t cause the ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "While resolving the triggered ability of Mentor of the Meek, you can\'t pay {1} multiple times to draw more than one card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "Exclude can target a creature spell that can\'t be countered. When Exclude resolves, that spell won\'t be countered, but you\'ll still draw a card."}]', "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'An “attacking creature” is one that has been declared as an attacker or put onto the battlefield attacking during a turn’s combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be an attacking creature through the end of combat step, even if the player it was attacking has left the game or the planeswalker it was attacking has left combat.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you cast Wing Shards after combat damage has been dealt, only creatures that survived combat can be sacrificed.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Storm counts spells cast before the spell with storm was cast. Spells cast after the spell with storm was cast but before the storm ability resolves aren’t counted.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The copies storm creates are created on the stack, so they’re not cast. Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell (such as storm) won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The storm ability and the copies it creates all resolve before the spell with storm. They resolve even if the spell with storm is countered.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Wing Shards doesn’t target the creature to be sacrificed. The target player chooses the creature as it resolves.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Colorless and generic mana symbols ({C}, {0}, {1}, {2}, {X}, and so on) in mana costs of permanents you control don\'t count toward your devotion to any color."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'Hybrid mana symbols, monocolored hybrid mana symbols, and Phyrexian mana symbols do count toward your devotion to their color(s).\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If an activated ability or triggered ability has an effect that depends on your devotion to a color, you count the number of mana symbols of that color among the mana costs of permanents you control as the ability resolves. The permanent with that ability will be counted if it\'s still on the battlefield at that time."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If you put an Aura on an opponent\'s permanent, you still control the Aura, and mana symbols in its mana cost count towards your devotion."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Mana symbols in the text boxes of permanents you control don\'t count toward your devotion to any color."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'The amount of life you gain is the total amount of life lost, not simply the value of X.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "As the last ability resolves, you can tap untapped Myr you control even if Myr Battlesphere is no longer on the battlefield by then. If that has happened, Myr Battlesphere won\'t be able to get the +X/+0 bonus, but it will still deal X damage to the appropriate player or planeswalker."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You can tap any untapped Myr you control as the last ability resolves, not just the Myr tokens you created with the first ability. This includes Myr that haven\'t been under your control since your most recent turn began."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You choose the value for X as the last ability resolves. You can\'t choose a value for X that\'s greater than the number of untapped Myr you control."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Because a spell with overload doesn\'t target when its overload cost is paid, it may affect permanents with hexproof or with protection from the appropriate color."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If you are instructed to cast a spell with overload “without paying its mana cost,” you can\'t choose to pay its overload cost instead."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If you don\'t pay the overload cost of Cyclonic Rift, that spell will have a single target. If you pay the overload cost, the spell won\'t have any targets."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying (such as an overload cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If you control at least one other creature when the ability resolves, you must sacrifice one. If you don\'t control any other creatures at that time, the ability won\'t do anything."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "The creature\'s power as it last existed on the battlefield is the amount of life you gain and the number of cards you draw."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Masterwork of Ingenuity enters the battlefield unattached. It doesn\'t enter attached to the same creature as the Equipment it copies."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Unlike Skirsdag High Priest itself, the two other creatures you tap to activate its ability aren\'t required to have been under your control continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn."}]', "[{'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'Bosh can be sacrificed to pay the cost of its last ability.'}, {'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'If an artifact on the battlefield has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'If Myr Retriever dies at the same time as another artifact you own, its ability can target that other artifact card.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'If a permanent on the battlefield has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If there are no other creatures on the battlefield when the morbid ability triggers, the ability must target Morkrut Banshee itself.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Morkrut Banshee\'s morbid ability triggers only once, not once for each creature that has died this turn. If no creatures have died by the time it enters the battlefield, its ability won\'t trigger at all."}]', "[{'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'The number of Equipment attached to Kemba is determined as the ability resolves. If Kemba is no longer on the battlefield at that time, its last existence on the battlefield is checked to determine the number of Equipment attached to it.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Although players may respond to Blasphemous Act once it\'s been cast, once it\'s announced, they can\'t respond before the cost is calculated and paid."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Blasphemous Act\'s ability can\'t reduce the total cost to cast the spell below {R}."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'The total cost to cast Blasphemous Act is locked in before you pay that cost. For example, if there are three creatures on the battlefield, including one you can sacrifice to add {C} to your mana pool, the total cost of Blasphemous Act is {5}{R}. Then you can sacrifice the creature when you activate mana abilities just before paying the cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Blasphemous Act). The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "As Victimize resolves, you must sacrifice a creature if able. You can\'t change your mind and choose not to sacrifice anything."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If one of the targeted creature cards is an illegal target (for instance, because it has left your graveyard before Victimize resolves), you\'ll still sacrifice a creature and put the other card onto the battlefield. If both are illegal targets, Victimize won\'t resolve. You won\'t sacrifice a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The creature you sacrifice isn\'t chosen until Victimize resolves. You can\'t return the creature you sacrifice because it will still be on the battlefield at the time targets are chosen."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "You must choose two targets. You can\'t cast Victimize targeting only one creature card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Commander\'s Sphere\'s first ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Commander\'s Sphere\'s first ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The number of counters to put on the target creature is determined only as Immaculate Magistrate\'s ability resolves. Elves coming and going later won\'t cause that creature to gain or lose +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The target creature doesn\'t have to be an Elf."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "You don\'t sacrifice Nevinyrral\'s Disk to activate its ability. It\'s destroyed as part of the ability\'s resolution if it\'s still on the battlefield. If an effect gives Nevinyrral\'s Disk indestructible or regenerates it, it stays on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "You draw a card and discard a card all while Jalum Tome\'s ability is resolving. Nothing can happen in between, and no player can choose to take actions."}]', "[{'date': '2020-11-10', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to Elves you control may become lethal if Imperious Perfect leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-11-10', 'text': 'Use the number of cards in your hand at the time you activate the ability (before drawing three cards) to determine how much mana to add to the activation cost.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled permanent will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist. Once the exiled permanent returns, it\'s considered a new object with no relation to the object that it was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If the permanent that returns to the battlefield has any abilities that trigger at the beginning of the end step, those abilities won\'t trigger that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'The exiled card will return to the battlefield at the beginning of the end step even if Flickerwisp is no longer on the battlefield.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Containment Priest\'s last ability won\'t affect any creatures that were cast, including ones cast from unusual zones such as your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If Containment Priest enters the battlefield at the same time as other creatures, its ability won\'t affect those creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If Containment Priest enters the battlefield without being cast, its ability won\'t exile itself."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a noncreature card wasn\'t cast and is entering the battlefield as a creature (due to an effect such as that of March of the Machines), it will be exiled. Conversely, if a creature card wasn\'t cast and is entering the battlefield as a noncreature permanent (for example, Heliod, Sun-Crowned with insufficient devotion), it won\'t be exiled."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability copies Return to Dust, the copy exiles only the first target artifact or enchantment. This is because the copy wasn\'t cast at all."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Return to Dust can always target a second artifact or enchantment; it just won\'t exile it if it\'s not your main phase when you cast Return to Dust."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If an effect says that something doesn\'t untap during its controller\'s next untap step, that effect applies to the next untap step that isn\'t skipped."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Skipping your "next" untap step is cumulative. If a player turns two Brine Elementals face up on the same turn, that player\\\'s opponents will each skip their next two untap steps.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Pongify tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. No player creates an Ape token. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), its controller does create an Ape token."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If you pay the evoke cost, you can have Mulldrifter\'s own triggered ability resolve before the evoke triggered ability. You can cast spells after that ability resolves but before you have to sacrifice Mulldrifter."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying (such as an evoke cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined by only its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast that spell was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If you pay the evoke cost, you can have Shriekmaw\'s own triggered ability resolve before the evoke triggered ability. You can cast spells after that ability resolves but before you have to sacrifice Shriekmaw."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying (such as an evoke cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined by only its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast that spell was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You can cast Everflowing Chalice without kicking it at all if you wish. However, if Everflowing Chalice has no charge counters on it, activating its last ability won\'t produce any mana."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "You choose the target for Dread Return before paying any of its costs, so it\'s not possible to cast it using flashback and bring back one of the creatures you sacrifice."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'After a spell with split second resolves (or otherwise leaves the stack), players may again cast spells and activate abilities before the next object on the stack resolves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Casting a spell with split second won\'t affect spells and abilities that are already on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If the resolution of a triggered ability involves casting a spell, that spell can\'t be cast if a spell with split second is on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Players may turn face-down creatures face up while a spell with split second is on the stack.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Players still get priority while a card with split second is on the stack; their options are just limited to mana abilities and certain special actions.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Split second doesn\'t stop triggered abilities from triggering, such as that of Chalice of the Void. If one does, its controller puts it on the stack and chooses targets for it, if any. Those abilities will resolve as normal."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'After a spell with split second resolves (or otherwise leaves the stack), players may again cast spells and activate abilities before the next object on the stack resolves.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a white creature may become lethal if Celestial Crusader leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Casting a spell with split second won’t affect spells and abilities that are already on the stack.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If the resolution of a triggered ability involves casting a spell, that spell can’t be cast if a spell with split second is on the stack.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Players may turn face-down creatures face up while a spell with split second is on the stack.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Players still get priority while a card with split second is on the stack; their options are just limited to mana abilities and certain special actions.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Split second doesn’t stop triggered abilities from triggering, such as that of Chalice of the Void. If one does, its controller puts it on the stack and chooses targets for it, if any. Those abilities will resolve as normal.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'After a spell with split second resolves (or otherwise leaves the stack), players may again cast spells and activate abilities before the next object on the stack resolves.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Casting a spell with split second won’t affect spells and abilities that are already on the stack.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If the resolution of a triggered ability involves casting a spell, that spell can’t be cast if a spell with split second is on the stack.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Players may turn face-down creatures face up while a spell with split second is on the stack.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Players still get priority while a card with split second is on the stack; their options are just limited to mana abilities and certain special actions.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Split second doesn’t stop triggered abilities from triggering, such as that of Chalice of the Void. If one does, its controller puts it on the stack and chooses targets for it, if any. Those abilities will resolve as normal.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Sudden Spoiling affects only creatures the target player controls at the time it resolves. Creatures they begin to control later in the turn won’t change power and toughness or lose abilities.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Sudden Spoiling overwrites any effects that set a creature’s power and toughness. Any existing effects or counters that raise, lower, or switch a creature’s power and/or toughness continue to apply to the creature’s newly-set power and toughness.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature card will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the copied creature card will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If Feldon\'s ability creates multiple tokens due to a replacement effect (such as the one Doubling Season creates), each of those tokens will gain haste and you\'ll sacrifice each of them."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If another creature becomes a copy of, or enters the battlefield as a copy of the token, that creature will copy the creature card the token is copying, except it will also be an artifact. This is true even if the creature card that was copied by Feldon of the Third Path is no longer in the graveyard at that time. However, the new copy won\'t gain haste and you won\'t sacrifice it at the beginning of the next end step."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature card has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'The token copies exactly what was printed on the original creature card (except that the copy is also an artifact) and nothing else.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Any permanent can be targeted by the second ability, not just one with counters on it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Vampire Hexmage\'s ability can\'t target a permanent card in a zone other than the battlefield, such as a suspended card."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Tendrils of Corruption tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You don’t gain X life.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'A creature cast using suspend will enter the battlefield with haste. It will have haste until another player gains control of it. (In some rare cases, another player may gain control of the creature spell itself. If this happens, the creature won’t enter the battlefield with haste.)'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'As the second triggered ability resolves, you must cast the card if able. You must do so even if it requires targets and the only legal targets are ones that you really don’t want to target. Timing permissions based on the card’s type are ignored.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Cards exiled with suspend are exiled face up.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Exiling a card with suspend isn’t casting that card. This action doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a “suspended card,” that means a card that (1) has suspend, (2) is in exile, and (3) has one or more time counters on it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again at the beginning of the card’s owner’s next upkeep.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the second triggered ability is countered, the card can’t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it’s exiled.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you can’t cast the card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” such as with suspend, you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if you want to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Suspend is a keyword that represents three abilities. The first is a static ability that allows you to exile the card from your hand with the specified number of time counters (the number before the dash) on it by paying its suspend cost (listed after the dash). The second is a triggered ability that removes a time counter from the suspended card at the beginning of each of your upkeeps. The third is a triggered ability that causes you to cast the card when the last time counter is removed. If you cast a creature spell this way, it gains haste until you lose control of that creature (or, in rare cases, you lose control of the creature spell while it’s on the stack).'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'The mana value of a spell cast without paying its mana cost is determined by its mana cost, even though that cost wasn’t paid.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) triggers. It doesn’t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You are never forced to activate mana abilities to pay costs, so if there is a mandatory additional mana cost (such as from Thalia, Guardian of Thraben), you can decline to activate mana abilities to pay for it and hence fail to cast the suspended card, leaving it in exile.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effects that modify when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that stop you from casting it (such as from Meddling Mage’s ability) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or that requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-06-10\', \'text\': "An ability that triggers from the resolution of an activated mana ability is also a mana ability. This means that if the land\'s ability that caused you to add mana was an activated mana ability, Caged Sun\'s triggered ability won\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "Whitemane Lion\'s ability doesn\'t target any creature, therefore no player may take actions between the time you choose the creature to return and the time you return it."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "You may return Whitemane Lion itself to its owner\'s hand as its triggered ability resolves. If you don\'t control any other creature, you must return it."}]', "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Flametongue Kavu’s ability can target itself. If it’s the only creature on the battlefield as its ability triggers, its ability must target itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'If Serra Avatar is no longer in your graveyard when its triggered ability resolves, you still shuffle your library.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'The ability that defines Serra Avatar’s power and toughness works in all zones, not only the battlefield.'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': "Bolas\' Schülerin", \'text\': "Wenn Bolas\' Schülerin ins Spiel kommt, opfere eine andere Kreatur. Du erhältst X Lebenspunkte dazu und ziehst X Karten, wobei X gleich der Stärke dieser Kreatur ist.", \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Fürst Bolas hat mir gezeigt, welch wertvolle Rohstoffe noch im kleinsten Lebewesen stecken."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390159&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f676f27-1ab6-4ecb-ae28-5063d56459c9\', \'multiverseId\': 390159}, \'multiverseid\': 390159}, {\'name\': \'Discípulo de Nicol Bolas\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Discípulo de Nicol Bolas entre al campo de batalla, sacrifica otra criatura. Ganas X vidas y robas X cartas, donde X es la fuerza de esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi Señor Nicol Bolas me ha mostrado que cada pequeña y miserable vida tiene sus recursos ocultos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef59818c-99aa-4cc5-abf1-053e498bf165\', \'multiverseId\': 391507}, \'multiverseid\': 391507}, {\'name\': \'Disciple de Bolas\', \'text\': \'Quand la Disciple de Bolas arrive sur le champ de bataille, sacrifiez une autre créature. Vous gagnez X points de vie et vous piochez X cartes, X étant la force de cette créature.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Le Seigneur Bolas m\'a montré comment chaque petite vie misérable renferme des ressources considérables. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390496&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'277ac3ad-4d0c-497a-ad85-83c9d5162868\', \'multiverseId\': 390496}, \'multiverseid\': 390496}, {\'name\': \'Discepola di Bolas\', \'text\': "Quando la Discepola di Bolas entra nel campo di battaglia, sacrifica un\'altra creatura. Guadagni X punti vita e peschi X carte, dove X è la forza di quella creatura.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Lord Bolas mi ha mostrato come ogni piccola vita miserabile contiene risorse inaudite."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390833&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7e96cde-181d-4947-bc90-28fe3dd99a16\', \'multiverseId\': 390833}, \'multiverseid\': 390833}, {\'name\': \'ボーラスの信奉者\', \'text\': \'ボーラスの信奉者が戦場に出たとき、他のクリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる。あなたはＸ点のライフを得て、カードをＸ枚引く。Ｘはそのクリーチャーのパワーに等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「ボーラス卿は私に、哀れな小さき生命がどれほどの価値を秘めているかを教えてくれました。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc1a52f3-0744-4225-8481-2a4943871b11\', \'multiverseId\': 391170}, \'multiverseid\': 391170}, {\'name\': \'波拉斯信徒\', \'text\': \'当波拉斯信徒进战场时，牺牲另一个生物。你获得X点生命且抓X张牌，X为该生物的力量。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「波拉斯大人向我展示过低贱的生命如何掩饰秘密。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5004e44-a089-4101-a4a6-e0ad89ce9bb9\', \'multiverseId\': 389822}, \'multiverseid\': 389822}]', "[{'name': 'Abgelegene Steppe', 'text': 'Die Abgelegene Steppe kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {W}.\\nUmwandlung {W} ({W}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390339&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd1290044-07c9-4ebd-a2da-e13e8482567b', 'multiverseId': 390339}, 'multiverseid': 390339}, {'name': 'Estepa aislada', 'text': 'La Estepa aislada entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} a tu reserva de maná.\\nCiclo {W}. ({W}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391687&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a2966e6e-aeac-41cf-bcd8-ea2a6c5502d1', 'multiverseId': 391687}, 'multiverseid': 391687}, {'name': 'Steppes retirées', 'text': 'Les Steppes retirées arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} à votre réserve.\\nRecyclage {W} ({W}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390676&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ba438aa9-9606-4e75-ac4a-bb084a21a7b7', 'multiverseId': 390676}, 'multiverseid': 390676}, {'name': 'Steppa Isolata', 'text': 'La Steppa Isolata entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} alla tua riserva di mana.\\nCiclo {W} ({W}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391013&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '774cdc19-98ef-473a-accc-a9d7ef17789c', 'multiverseId': 391013}, 'multiverseid': 391013}, {'name': '隔離されたステップ', 'text': '隔離されたステップはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{W}を加える。\\nサイクリング{W}（{W}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391350&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3a661d2e-763c-4ab5-98bd-f26f499c405a', 'multiverseId': 391350}, 'multiverseid': 391350}, {'name': '远僻草原', 'text': '远僻草原须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{W}到你的法术力池中。\\n循环{W}（{W}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390002&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd4c9ab73-49e1-4d5f-a0c2-f21e897f6cae', 'multiverseId': 390002}, 'multiverseid': 390002}]", '[{\'name\': \'Abgenutzter Kraftstein\', \'text\': \'Der Abgenutzte Kraftstein kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {2}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Selbst der Splitter eines Kraftsteins enthält nicht nur Energie, sondern Raum — gewaltige Dimensionen gefangen in zerbrechlichem Kristall.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390428&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3be771e4-31f6-4765-995f-fae4bc02a208\', \'multiverseId\': 390428}, \'multiverseid\': 390428}, {\'name\': \'Piedra de poder desgastada\', \'text\': \'La Piedra de poder desgastada entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {2} a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Incluso un fragmento de piedra de poder contiene en su interior no solo energía, sino espacio... vastas dimensiones encerradas en un frágil cristal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'629658f0-a80c-45e3-b41e-5dcc0e405b22\', \'multiverseId\': 391776}, \'multiverseid\': 391776}, {\'name\': \'Lithoforce usée\', \'text\': \'La Lithoforce usée arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {2} à votre réserve.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Même à l\'état de fragment, les lithoforces ne renferment pas que de l\'énergie, mais aussi de l\'espace : de vastes dimensions piégées dans un cristal fragile.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390765&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e801a007-cb56-4bfe-a140-7f227f028052\', \'multiverseId\': 390765}, \'multiverseid\': 390765}, {\'name\': \'Pietra del Potere Consunta\', \'text\': \'La Pietra del Potere Consunta entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {2} alla tua riserva di mana.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Persino un frammento di una pietra del potere contiene al suo interno non solo energia, ma anche spazio: dimensioni enormi intrappolate nella fragilità del cristallo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a7a9682-7f6c-4ca1-a87e-9d7c5a823c58\', \'multiverseId\': 391102}, \'multiverseid\': 391102}, {\'name\': \'摩滅したパワーストーン\', \'text\': \'摩滅したパワーストーンはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{2}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'パワーストーンの欠片ですら、その中に力だけでなく空間を持つ――脆い水晶の中に閉じ込められた広大な空間だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391439&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4927abf0-f6f3-428f-910c-474f0c1999ff\', \'multiverseId\': 391439}, \'multiverseid\': 391439}, {\'name\': \'受损的魔力石\', \'text\': \'受损的魔力石须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{2}到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'再小的魔力石碎片中都包含着无穷能量与广袤空间～即集于这脆弱水晶中的无数维度。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2d04deb-700e-4a22-9027-994c84994f9e\', \'multiverseId\': 390091}, \'multiverseid\': 390091}]', '[{\'name\': \'Adarkarwalküre\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit\\n{T}: Wenn eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die nicht die Adarkarwalküre ist, in diesem Zug stirbt, bringe diese Karte unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Verschneite Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': \'Anstatt die Gestorbenen in das Land der Toten zu eskortieren, erweckt sie sie wieder zum Leben, Kämpfen und erneutem Sterben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390097&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'962e4f06-357c-450d-bac1-f40bf766cb26\', \'multiverseId\': 390097}, \'multiverseid\': 390097}, {\'name\': \'Valkiria de Adarkar\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vigilancia.\\n{T}: Cuando la criatura objetivo que no sea la Valkiria de Adarkar muera este turno, regresa esa carta al campo de batalla bajo tu control.\', \'type\': \'Criatura nevada — Ángel\', \'flavor\': \'Ella no escolta a los muertos al más allá, sino que los resucita para que luchen y mueran de nuevo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391445&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff787700-d536-4a1e-afd2-1081cd5f535f\', \'multiverseId\': 391445}, \'multiverseid\': 391445}, {\'name\': "Valkyrie d\'Adarkar", \'text\': "Vol, vigilance\\n{T} : Quand une créature ciblée autre que la Valkyrie d\'Adarkar meurt ce tour-ci, renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature neigeuse : ange\', \'flavor\': "Elle n\'escorte pas les morts dans l\'après-vie ; elle les ressuscite pour combattre et mourir à nouveau.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390434&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b28d7685-e3da-4fc6-bcac-6a370366c092\', \'multiverseId\': 390434}, \'multiverseid\': 390434}, {\'name\': "Valchiria dell\'Adarkar", \'text\': "Volare, cautela\\n{T}: Quando una creatura bersaglio diversa dalla Valchiria dell\'Adarkar muore in questo turno, rimetti quella carta sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo.", \'type\': \'Creatura Neve — Angelo\', \'flavor\': "Non accompagna i morti nell\'oltretomba, ma li risuscita per farli combattere e morire ancora.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a954fc81-6455-4526-9363-be5210161e62\', \'multiverseId\': 390771}, \'multiverseid\': 390771}, {\'name\': \'アダーカーの戦乙女\', \'text\': \'飛行、警戒\\n{T}：アダーカーの戦乙女以外のクリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターンにそれが死亡したとき、そのカードをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'氷雪クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': \'彼女は死者を天国へと導くことはしない。蘇らせて戦わせ、再び死へと導くのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb0bf44a-6e43-43ca-8ba2-25eb13da8817\', \'multiverseId\': 391108}, \'multiverseid\': 391108}, {\'name\': \'阿达卡女武神\', \'text\': \'飞行，警戒\\n{T}：本回合中，当阿达卡女武神以外的目标生物死去时，将该牌在你的操控下移回战场。\', \'type\': \'雪境生物～天使\', \'flavor\': \'她的使命并非护送亡者通往来生，而是令他们起身赴战、再度丧命。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389760&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59c8c82d-7c88-4f83-88f8-3585ba4edbb1\', \'multiverseId\': 389760}, \'multiverseid\': 389760}]', '[{\'name\': \'An die Front schicken\', \'text\': \'Bringe X 1/1 weiße Soldat-Kreaturenspielsteine ins Spiel, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturen im Spiel ist.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Wie eine Heuschreckenplage werden wir über euch herfallen, um unser Land von euch zu befreien!" —Hirov, Kommandant der Tausend Schwerter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390157&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be8b7ea9-cd1d-4095-b577-6df03989bf01\', \'multiverseId\': 390157}, \'multiverseid\': 390157}, {\'name\': \'Despliegue al frente\', \'text\': \'Pon en el campo de batalla X fichas de criatura Soldado blancas 1/1, donde X es la cantidad de criaturas en el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Caeremos sobre ustedes como una plaga de langostas para expulsarles de nuestras tierras!" —Hirov, comandante de las Mil espadas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9c2b483-30fd-458f-bd5f-17bba7b32921\', \'multiverseId\': 391505}, \'multiverseid\': 391505}, {\'name\': \'Déploiement au front\', \'text\': \'Mettez sur le champ de bataille X jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat, X étant le nombre de créatures sur le champ de bataille.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Nous fondrons sur vous comme une nuée de sauterelles pour purifier nos terres de votre présence ! » —Hirov, commandant des Mille épées\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390494&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf28d8b7-75df-4294-a27f-d62a7a0cd863\', \'multiverseId\': 390494}, \'multiverseid\': 390494}, {\'name\': \'Schieramento al Fronte\', \'text\': \'Metti sul campo di battaglia X pedine creatura Soldato 1/1 bianche, dove X è il numero di creature sul campo di battaglia.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Ci avventeremo su di voi come uno sciame di locuste per sradicarvi dalle nostre terre!" —Hirov, comandante delle Mille Spade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390831&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ba43599-5e93-48f3-814d-d3c01bcfcbf7\', \'multiverseId\': 390831}, \'multiverseid\': 390831}, {\'name\': \'前線への配備\', \'text\': \'白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークンをＸ体戦場に出す。Ｘは戦場に出ているクリーチャーの総数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「我々はイナゴの群れのごとく襲いかかり、必ずや貴様らを我らの土地から駆逐する！」 ――千本剣の司令官、ヒーロフ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9373d1a-d356-41fe-bbb9-c7724b0b7ead\', \'multiverseId\': 391168}, \'multiverseid\': 391168}, {\'name\': \'整装上阵\', \'text\': \'将X个1/1白色士兵衍生生物放进战场，X为战场上的生物数量。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「我们的士兵将如驱之不尽的蝗虫一般倾泻战场，直至将你赶出我们的领地！」 ～千刃团指挥官希洛夫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389820&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d3c4e84-3d8a-43a1-90f2-08cb9bb9af5a\', \'multiverseId\': 389820}, \'multiverseid\': 389820}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anführer der Käferreiter\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Anführer der Käferreiter ins Spiel kommt, bringe zwei 1/1 rote Goblin-Kreaturenspielsteine ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Sie richten sie ab, reiten auf ihnen und essen sie hinterher: Nur wenige andere militärische Erfindungen der Goblins können mit den Käfern mithalten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390113&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6030fcd8-f8af-415f-a4c3-8c3e45dc3a58\', \'multiverseId\': 390113}, \'multiverseid\': 390113}, {\'name\': \'Jefe lomo de escarabajo\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Jefe lomo de escarabajo entre al campo de batalla, pon dos fichas de criatura Trasgo rojas 1/1 en el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'Ya sea entrenados, domados o cenados, pocas innovaciones militares de los trasgos eran mejores que los bichos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f588994-c4cf-45a4-84df-c38075317626\', \'multiverseId\': 391461}, \'multiverseid\': 391461}, {\'name\': \'Chef Scarapace\', \'text\': \'Quand le Chef Scarapace arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez sur le champ de bataille deux jetons de créature 1/1 rouge Gobelin.\', \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "Qu\'il soit dressé, chevauché ou mangé, nulle innovation gobeline ne pourrait rivaliser avec le cancrelat.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390450&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d6e6ac5-53cc-40bf-9a11-fb0527ed712a\', \'multiverseId\': 390450}, \'multiverseid\': 390450}, {\'name\': \'Capo Cavalcascarabei\', \'text\': \'Quando il Capo Cavalcascarabei entra nel campo di battaglia, metti sul campo di battaglia due pedine creatura Goblin 1/1 rosse.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Goblin\', \'flavor\': "Che sia addestrato, cavalcato o mangiato, ben poche innovazioni militari dei goblin hanno eguagliato l\'insetto.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390787&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'764fe4b0-cbae-48c5-8447-232cdd6a0bc1\', \'multiverseId\': 390787}, \'multiverseid\': 390787}, {\'name\': \'甲虫背の酋長\', \'text\': \'甲虫背の酋長が戦場に出たとき、赤の１/１のゴブリン・クリーチャー・トークンを２体戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'訓練されようが、乗られようが、食われようが、虫ほど画期的なゴブリンの軍事革新はほとんど無い。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef61af5a-8b46-4ab7-8990-ec4e01da8732\', \'multiverseId\': 391124}, \'multiverseid\': 391124}, {\'name\': \'虫背酋长\', \'text\': \'当虫背酋长进战场时，将两个1/1红色鬼怪衍生生物放进战场。\', \'type\': \'生物～鬼怪／战士\', \'flavor\': \'不论是从训练、骑乘还是风味来说，甲虫都堪称鬼怪军事创新一绝。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d63ca77-6d9b-4939-8465-3467daa51d61\', \'multiverseId\': 389776}, \'multiverseid\': 389776}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anthrazitmedaillon\', \'text\': \'Schwarze Zaubersprüche, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390242&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfe84187-a66e-4dff-bf3b-64695671f304\', \'multiverseId\': 390242}, \'multiverseid\': 390242}, {\'name\': \'Medallón de azabache\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar los hechizos negros.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7c222c2-d093-4939-bf20-b1ba3ed8efa1\', \'multiverseId\': 391590}, \'multiverseid\': 391590}, {\'name\': \'Médaillon de jais\', \'text\': \'Les sorts noirs que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390579&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20b7ec91-d24a-460f-92ad-b63380a02e97\', \'multiverseId\': 390579}, \'multiverseid\': 390579}, {\'name\': "Medaglione d\'Ambra Nera", \'text\': \'Le magie nere che lanci costano {1} in meno per essere lanciate.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390916&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd6fe66a-4400-4054-a273-a094d2ebfb03\', \'multiverseId\': 390916}, \'multiverseid\': 390916}, {\'name\': \'黒玉の大メダル\', \'text\': \'あなたが唱える黒の呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77ed6599-51f2-4b31-9459-b3e08ddb9f11\', \'multiverseId\': 391253}, \'multiverseid\': 391253}, {\'name\': \'黑玉徽章\', \'text\': \'你施放的黑色咒语减少{1}来施放。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01345984-b311-4fc1-a593-2811f1bb03e3\', \'multiverseId\': 389905}, \'multiverseid\': 389905}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arkaner Leuchtturm\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}.\\n{1}, {T}: Bis zum Ende des Zuges verlieren Kreaturen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, Fluchsicherheit und Verhülltheit und können Fluchsicherheit und Verhülltheit weder haben noch erhalten.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390104&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9d09209-b194-461f-bba2-4998bc562373\', \'multiverseId\': 390104}, \'multiverseid\': 390104}, {\'name\': \'Faro arcano\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná.\\n{1}, {T}: Hasta el final del turno, las criaturas que controlan tus oponentes pierden las habilidades de antimaleficio y velo y no pueden tener las habilidades de antimaleficio o velo.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391452&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'516185af-ccc1-474d-82b6-60ac1711f3ac\', \'multiverseId\': 391452}, \'multiverseid\': 391452}, {\'name\': \'Phare hermétique\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve.\\n{1}, {T} : Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, les créatures que vos adversaires contrôlent perdent la défense talismanique et le linceul et ne peuvent pas avoir la défense talismanique ou le linceul.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390441&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'435f47b7-bd50-49e3-8d21-24621b98ee5a\', \'multiverseId\': 390441}, \'multiverseid\': 390441}, {\'name\': \'Faro Arcano\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana.\\n{1}, {T}: Fino alla fine del turno, le creature controllate dai tuoi avversari perdono anti-malocchio e velo e non possono avere anti-malocchio o velo.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0d7087c-8c5b-4eab-b288-af9fc1ea5724\', \'multiverseId\': 390778}, \'multiverseid\': 390778}, {\'name\': \'秘儀の灯台\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}：ターン終了時まで、あなたの対戦相手がコントロールするクリーチャーは呪禁と被覆を失うとともに、呪禁や被覆を持つことができない。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37541b59-c57d-4383-bc33-762efa0b829b\', \'multiverseId\': 391115}, \'multiverseid\': 391115}, {\'name\': \'玄秘灯塔\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{1}到你的法术力池中。\\n{1}，{T}：直到回合结束，由对手操控的生物失去辟邪与帷幕异能，且不能具有辟邪或帷幕异能。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'334a0676-c55f-4c28-a726-438749cecc74\', \'multiverseId\': 389767}, \'multiverseid\': 389767}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufräumender Schwebgardist\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Aufräumende Schwebgardist ins Spiel kommt, kannst du bis zu zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drohne\', \'flavor\': \'Sie tauchen nur in Notlagen auf, und Notlagen dauern nie lange.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390223&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'788bfc22-72c4-4849-831f-f50b402e7700\', \'multiverseId\': 390223}, \'multiverseid\': 390223}, {\'name\': \'Barredores aeroguarda\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando los Barredores aeroguarda entren al campo de batalla, puedes regresar hasta dos criaturas objetivo a las manos de sus propietarios.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano\', \'flavor\': \'Solo aparecen en caso de emergencia, y las emergencias nunca duran mucho.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'022cc7bc-4e07-418c-8dfe-609194f9e493\', \'multiverseId\': 391571}, \'multiverseid\': 391571}, {\'name\': \'Balayeurs aérogardes\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand les Balayeurs aérogardes arrivent sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez renvoyer jusqu\'à deux créatures ciblées dans la main de leurs propriétaires.", \'type\': \'Créature : drone\', \'flavor\': "Ils n\'apparaissent qu\'en cas d\'urgence, et celles-ci ne durent jamais longtemps.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390560&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9086cf5e-b187-467d-a423-bdbdabb4a0f9\', \'multiverseId\': 390560}, \'multiverseid\': 390560}, {\'name\': \'Spazzatori Aerocustodi\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando gli Spazzatori Aerocustodi entrano nel campo di battaglia, puoi far tornare fino a due creature bersaglio in mano ai rispettivi proprietari.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Parassita\', \'flavor\': \'Appaiono solo in casi di emergenza e le emergenze non durano mai a lungo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b877d01-1d27-4596-a600-15d4c5f2e774\', \'multiverseId\': 390897}, \'multiverseid\': 390897}, {\'name\': \'空護りの掃討者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n空護りの掃討者が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャーを最大２体まで対象とする。あなたはそれらをオーナーの手札に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドローン\', \'flavor\': \'彼らは緊急のときのみ現れるが、その緊急事態も長くは続かない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0667848d-40c7-4155-8b23-630df70b76d0\', \'multiverseId\': 391234}, \'multiverseid\': 391234}, {\'name\': \'空卫扫荡队\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当空卫扫荡队进战场时，你可以将至多两个目标生物移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～奴兽\', \'flavor\': \'他们只在紧急状况现身，而紧急状况从不会持续太久。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4f979d2-e91f-4800-9c2f-7e5c22276995\', \'multiverseId\': 389886}, \'multiverseid\': 389886}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufseher der Verdammten\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Aufseher der Verdammten ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Kreatur deiner Wahl zerstören.\\nImmer wenn eine Nichtspielsteinkreatur stirbt, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, bringe einen 2/2 schwarzen Zombie-Kreaturenspielstein getappt ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390296&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcd68a8a-9a87-493e-9cb1-6a1fc676c377\', \'multiverseId\': 390296}, \'multiverseid\': 390296}, {\'name\': \'Caporal de los condenados\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Caporal de los condenados entre al campo de batalla, puedes destruir la criatura objetivo.\\nSiempre que una criatura que no sea ficha que controla un oponente muera, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Zombie negra 2/2 girada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391644&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81cb65a1-df20-4e0e-9b79-1aa93e84d6c9\', \'multiverseId\': 391644}, \'multiverseid\': 391644}, {\'name\': \'Brigadier des damnés\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Brigadier des damnés arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez détruire une créature ciblée.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature non-jeton qu\'un adversaire contrôle meurt, mettez sur le champ de bataille, engagé, un jeton de créature 2/2 noire Zombie.", \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390633&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8217e12f-b5e9-417d-849e-cc575c6ca7fa\', \'multiverseId\': 390633}, \'multiverseid\': 390633}, {\'name\': \'Sorvegliante dei Dannati\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando il Sorvegliante dei Dannati entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi distruggere una creatura bersaglio.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura non pedina controllata da un avversario muore, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Zombie 2/2 nera TAPpata.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e338486-ba09-4c16-8f65-f83f1da915ef\', \'multiverseId\': 390970}, \'multiverseid\': 390970}, {\'name\': \'忌むべき者の監視者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n忌むべき者の監視者が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはそれを破壊してもよい。\\n対戦相手がコントロールするトークンでないクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークンを１体タップ状態で戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'195311c6-c727-4e0b-9f1e-364ac2851b93\', \'multiverseId\': 391307}, \'multiverseid\': 391307}, {\'name\': \'厄亡者督军\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当厄亡者督军进战场时，你可以消灭目标生物。\\n每当一个由对手操控且非衍生物的生物死去时，将一个2/2黑色灵俑衍生生物横置进战场。\', \'type\': \'生物～恶魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389959&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67d75e7a-6859-4bfc-89b0-4ec30cd1ef1f\', \'multiverseId\': 389959}, \'multiverseid\': 389959}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufstieg des Bändigers\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur angreift, die du kontrollierst, kannst du eine Quest-Marke auf den Aufstieg des Bändigers legen.\\nSolange auf dem Aufstieg des Bändigers sieben oder mehr Quest-Marken liegen, erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, +5/+5.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390112&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c59437c1-f131-484a-88f3-8b7a7812853b\', \'multiverseId\': 390112}, \'multiverseid\': 390112}, {\'name\': \'Ascenso del domador\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura que controlas ataque, puedes poner un contador de búsqueda sobre el Ascenso del domador.\\nMientras el Ascenso del domador tenga siete o más contadores de búsqueda sobre él, las criaturas que controlas obtienen +5/+5.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59948346-ba9f-4f51-90da-b9867e9450e9\', \'multiverseId\': 391460}, \'multiverseid\': 391460}, {\'name\': \'Ascension du maître des bêtes\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez attaque, vous pouvez mettre un marqueur « quête » sur l\'Ascension du maître des bêtes.\\nTant que l\'Ascension du maître des bêtes a au moins sept marqueurs « quête » sur elle, les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +5/+5.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390449&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ce4d913-bc8a-4aa0-9e38-a0642b7218b7\', \'multiverseId\': 390449}, \'multiverseid\': 390449}, {\'name\': \'Ascensione del Domatore\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta una creatura che controlli attacca, puoi mettere un segnalino ricerca sull\'Ascensione del Domatore.\\nFintanto che l\'Ascensione del Domatore ha sette o più segnalini ricerca, le creature che controlli prendono +5/+5.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390786&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d9a1b6b-d251-462e-9ef8-05819ba18ae4\', \'multiverseId\': 390786}, \'multiverseid\': 390786}, {\'name\': \'獣使いの昇天\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーが１体攻撃するたび、あなたは獣使いの昇天の上に探索カウンターを１個置いてもよい。\\n獣使いの昇天の上に７個以上の探索カウンターが置かれているかぎり、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは＋５/＋５の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb23488e-f8be-4f31-98a8-745b9cf7eadd\', \'multiverseId\': 391123}, \'multiverseid\': 391123}, {\'name\': \'兽侯腾扬\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控的生物攻击时，你可以在兽侯腾扬上放置一个探索指示物。\\n只要兽侯腾扬上有七个或更多探索指示物，由你操控的生物便得+5/+5。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0b77f83-cf05-4d38-a324-3697177584e1\', \'multiverseId\': 389775}, \'multiverseid\': 389775}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auge der Pilger\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn das Auge der Pilger ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen, auf deine Hand nehmen und dann deine Bibliothek mischen.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Thopter\', \'flavor\': \'Die Kor schicken ihre Thopter vor, um zu schauen, ob das Land gerade gute Laune hat.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390306&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c562811-7721-416a-9ad7-4f3c69f3dec8\', \'multiverseId\': 390306}, \'multiverseid\': 390306}, {\'name\': \'Ojo del peregrino\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Ojo del peregrino entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, mostrarla, ponerla en tu mano y luego barajar tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Tóptero\', \'flavor\': \'Los kor envían a sus tópteros cometa para ver si la tierra está de humor para una visita.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3341c4c-9c28-43ac-8ee5-1b8e6681b079\', \'multiverseId\': 391654}, \'multiverseid\': 391654}, {\'name\': \'Œil du pèlerin\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Œil du pèlerin arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, la révéler, la mettre dans votre main et mélanger ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : mécanoptère\', \'flavor\': "Les kor envoient leurs voiles mécanoptères en éclaireur pour déterminer si la terre est d\'humeur accueillante.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390643&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64ea36be-d66c-4770-8f9f-55527b8c66a4\', \'multiverseId\': 390643}, \'multiverseid\': 390643}, {\'name\': \'Occhio del Pellegrino\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando l\'Occhio del Pellegrino entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, rivelarla, aggiungerla alla tua mano e rimescolare il tuo grimorio.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Tottero\', \'flavor\': \'I kor spediscono sempre i loro alianti totteri per verificare se la terra è di buonumore o meno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390980&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55eb4428-3550-4a0b-9ccd-5dafe1786eae\', \'multiverseId\': 390980}, \'multiverseid\': 390980}, {\'name\': \'巡礼者の目\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n巡礼者の目が戦場に出たとき、あなたはあなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カードを１枚探してもよい。そうしたなら、それを公開してあなたの手札に加え、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 飛行機械\', \'flavor\': \'コーは飛行凧を送り込んで、地が歓迎しているかどうかを見る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d49d6bed-4312-4124-8888-3397b671629d\', \'multiverseId\': 391317}, \'multiverseid\': 391317}, {\'name\': \'朝圣客之眼\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当朝圣客之眼进战场时，你可以从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，展示该牌，并将它置于你手上，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～振翼机\', \'flavor\': \'寇族派出振翼机升空，打量这块大地是否有意愿接纳他们。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6add5a5e-2950-477e-851d-a93539ef520e\', \'multiverseId\': 389969}, \'multiverseid\': 389969}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auge des Ur-Golems\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {2}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Ur-Golems beherrschten einst die Welt. Selbst heute bewahren sie noch eine tiefe Verbindung zu ihr.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390408&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01934e16-d8a0-4423-a3fc-960855b7949c\', \'multiverseId\': 390408}, \'multiverseid\': 390408}, {\'name\': \'Ojo de ur-gólem\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {2} a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Los ur-gólems dominaron el plano en otro tiempo. Incluso hoy mantienen una profunda conexión con él.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391756&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c794452a-64bd-40f5-8966-7dd06ee81d10\', \'multiverseId\': 391756}, \'multiverseid\': 391756}, {\'name\': "Œil de l\'Ur-Golem", \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {2} à votre réserve.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Ce plan était naguère dominé par les Ur-golems. Encore aujourd\'hui, le lien n\'a pas été rompu.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390745&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6354db91-75b6-43d2-bf35-a903292227f0\', \'multiverseId\': 390745}, \'multiverseid\': 390745}, {\'name\': "Occhio dell\'Ur-Golem", \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {2} alla tua riserva di mana.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Gli Ur-golem che un tempo dominavano il piano mantengono tuttora un legame profondo con esso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391082&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c0a1048-1ca7-4521-95b4-eedc5f910c85\', \'multiverseId\': 391082}, \'multiverseid\': 391082}, {\'name\': \'ウル＝ゴーレムの目\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{2}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ウル＝ゴーレムはかつて次元全体を支配していた。今もなお、そこと深い繋がりを保っている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a39de6c2-b9e0-426d-8dbc-60cf3661c893\', \'multiverseId\': 391419}, \'multiverseid\': 391419}, {\'name\': \'古魔像之眼\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{2}到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'古魔像曾经掌管此时空。就算现在，他们也还与其息息相通。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bfa22b6-b987-4b7f-88be-395f9271ee4b\', \'multiverseId\': 390071}, \'multiverseid\': 390071}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aus den Knochen lesen\', \'text\': \'Hellsicht 2, ziehe dann zwei Karten. Du verlierst 2 Lebenspunkte. (Betrachte für Hellsicht 2 die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek und lege dann eine beliebige Anzahl davon unter deine Bibliothek und den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben darauf.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Der Tod kennt ein paar Tricks, die die Lebenden noch nicht gelernt haben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390323&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c1d7d1f-5361-458a-a0d5-f090224c0f47\', \'multiverseId\': 390323}, \'multiverseid\': 390323}, {\'name\': \'Lectura de huesos\', \'text\': \'Adivina 2, luego roba dos cartas. Pierdes 2 vidas. (Para adivinar 2, mira las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, luego pon cualquier número de ellas en el fondo de tu biblioteca y el resto en la parte superior en cualquier orden.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los muertos saben lecciones que los vivos no han aprendido.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391671&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33e497e6-aaa7-4485-bbc0-774fe000a065\', \'multiverseId\': 391671}, \'multiverseid\': 391671}, {\'name\': \'Lire dans les os\', \'text\': "Regard 2, puis piochez deux cartes. Vous perdez 2 points de vie. (Pour appliquer regard 2, regardez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles au-dessous de votre bibliothèque et le reste au-dessus, dans n\'importe quel ordre.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Les morts connaissent les leçons que les vivants n\'ont jamais apprises.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390660&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8541b2a0-f109-48d0-8e52-abc7d759bc85\', \'multiverseId\': 390660}, \'multiverseid\': 390660}, {\'name\': \'Leggere le Ossa\', \'text\': \'Profetizza 2, poi pesca due carte. Perdi 2 punti vita. (Per profetizzare 2, guarda le prime due carte del tuo grimorio, poi mettine un qualsiasi numero in fondo al tuo grimorio e le altre in cima in qualsiasi ordine.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'I morti conoscono lezioni che i vivi non hanno ancora imparato.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1f9a17b-3766-4a96-8d99-21230fa05d04\', \'multiverseId\': 390997}, \'multiverseid\': 390997}, {\'name\': \'骨読み\', \'text\': \'占術２を行い、その後カードを２枚引く。あなたは２点のライフを失う。（占術２を行うには、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から２枚のカードを見て、そのうちの望む枚数のカードを望む順番であなたのライブラリーの一番下に置き、残りを望む順番で一番上に置く。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'死んだことでしか学べないこともある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'053d123a-1374-4d7d-90c0-5eb8090b27a4\', \'multiverseId\': 391334}, \'multiverseid\': 391334}, {\'name\': \'解读骨卦\', \'text\': \'占卜2，然后抓两张牌。你失去2点生命。（占卜2的流程是检视你牌库顶的两张牌，然后将其中任意数量的牌以任意顺序置于你牌库底，其余则以任意顺序置于你牌库顶。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'逝者晓得生者尚未领悟的教训。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b76a210b-6e22-4b73-89e1-ce11dccae524\', \'multiverseId\': 389986}, \'multiverseid\': 389986}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausschlachten\', \'text\': \'Bestimme zwei Kreaturenkarten deiner Wahl in deinem Friedhof. Opfere eine Kreatur. Falls du dies tust, bringe diese zwei bestimmten Karten getappt ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Der Priester stieß Xantcha zu Boden. „Es ist defekt. Wir müssen es entsorgen!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390410&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39a71f4d-fbe6-4d83-8f7f-6fbe98d457de\', \'multiverseId\': 390410}, \'multiverseid\': 390410}, {\'name\': \'Victimar\', \'text\': \'Elige dos cartas de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio. Sacrifica una criatura. Si lo haces, regresa las cartas elegidas al campo de batalla giradas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'El sacerdote lanzó a Xantcha al suelo. "Es defectuosa. Debemos desecharla".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391758&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42448419-01b0-4107-989a-10caf5f588c8\', \'multiverseId\': 391758}, \'multiverseid\': 391758}, {\'name\': \'Brimades\', \'text\': \'Choisissez deux cartes de créature ciblées dans votre cimetière. Sacrifiez une créature. Si vous faites ainsi, renvoyez, engagées, les cartes choisies sur le champ de bataille.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Le prêtre jeta Xantcha à terre. « Cette machine est défectueuse. Mettons-la à la casse. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390747&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3b08b9d-50d9-499a-80b2-e25658bd9a45\', \'multiverseId\': 390747}, \'multiverseid\': 390747}, {\'name\': \'Vessare\', \'text\': \'Scegli due carte creatura bersaglio nel tuo cimitero. Sacrifica una creatura. Se lo fai, rimetti sul campo di battaglia TAPpate le carte scelte.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Il sacerdote gettò Xantcha a terra. "È difettosa. Dobbiamo buttarla."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b92956f4-0356-47c8-94a5-c8cb8e03924b\', \'multiverseId\': 391084}, \'multiverseid\': 391084}, {\'name\': \'犠牲\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード２枚を対象とする。クリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる。そうしたなら、それらの対象としたカードをタップ状態で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'僧侶はザンチャを地面に投げつけた。「これは欠陥品だ。スクラップにすべきだな」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ad1a5cd-aa9a-4481-be10-95f8cf1401da\', \'multiverseId\': 391421}, \'multiverseid\': 391421}, {\'name\': \'生体活祭\', \'text\': \'选择两张目标在你坟墓场中的生物牌。牺牲一个生物。如果你如此作，则将所选择的牌横置移回战场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'牧师将珊迦摔到地上：「它是瑕疵品，我们必须拆了它。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e99f2b8-ec3b-44a7-bb7e-b084d115da17\', \'multiverseId\': 390073}, \'multiverseid\': 390073}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausschließen\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Kreaturenzauber deiner Wahl.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Im Moment passt\\\'s mir grad ganz schlecht." —Teferi\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390184&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a289ef8c-e596-4a6d-8232-d7b4819f16af\', \'multiverseId\': 390184}, \'multiverseid\': 390184}, {\'name\': \'Excluir\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo de criatura.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ahora no tengo tiempo para ti". —Teferi\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2c8d646-49c7-4d05-91df-3f7c055e440c\', \'multiverseId\': 391532}, \'multiverseid\': 391532}, {\'name\': \'Exclusion\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez le sort de créature ciblé.\\nPiochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Je n\'ai pas le temps pour cela. » —Téfeiri", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390521&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10d3415b-6417-4263-8201-14b34707a7f4\', \'multiverseId\': 390521}, \'multiverseid\': 390521}, {\'name\': \'Escludere\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia creatura bersaglio.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Non ho tempo per te in questo momento." —Teferi\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390858&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0b45237-2bbc-443a-a5d9-9df64d9c607f\', \'multiverseId\': 390858}, \'multiverseid\': 390858}, {\'name\': \'除外\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー・呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。\\nカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「今忙しいんだ。」 ――テフェリー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'110247c5-6c7b-4cbc-b7f2-2aea6bd835b0\', \'multiverseId\': 391195}, \'multiverseid\': 391195}, {\'name\': \'排拒\', \'text\': \'反击目标生物咒语。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「现在没空和你闲耗。」 ～泰菲力\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389847&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b38983f5-d8ca-4ea4-ac5b-622d0483d6e6\', \'multiverseId\': 389847}, \'multiverseid\': 389847}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azurmagier\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir holen unsere Macht aus dem unendlichen Ozean des Verstandes, wo alles Mögliche erdacht werden kann." —Credo der Azurmagier\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390109&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18c0f679-c12d-4082-81f0-279e5c220313\', \'multiverseId\': 390109}, \'multiverseid\': 390109}, {\'name\': \'Maga de azur\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Obtenemos nuestro poder del océano infinito de la mente, donde todo tipo de cosas pueden ser concebidas." —Credo de azur\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391457&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62d97452-a9e4-4f51-bf0d-f58280ce24d3\', \'multiverseId\': 391457}, \'multiverseid\': 391457}, {\'name\': "Mage de l\'azur", \'text\': \'{3}{U} : Piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Nous tirons notre pouvoir de l\'océan infini de l\'esprit, où tout peut être conçu. » —Crédo de l\'azur", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390446&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18ca6e53-8ec5-4230-b46c-48c4dfeabe3c\', \'multiverseId\': 390446}, \'multiverseid\': 390446}, {\'name\': \'Maga Azzurra\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Traiamo il nostro potere dall\\\'infinito oceano della mente, dove ogni genere di cosa può essere concepita." —Dottrina Azzurra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c47cb744-371c-42e3-b632-f1383bc83dc3\', \'multiverseId\': 390783}, \'multiverseid\': 390783}, {\'name\': \'蒼穹の魔道士\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}：カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「我々はあらゆる考えが成される精神の無限の海より力を引き出す。」 ――蒼穹の教義\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43f85eed-20b0-4a51-bad0-da6050f41827\', \'multiverseId\': 391120}, \'multiverseid\': 391120}, {\'name\': \'碧蓝法师\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「我们自心灵的无垠大海获取力量，万物秩序均构想自该处。」 ～碧蓝信条\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'672db832-5be5-4fe5-832f-e4c8a992caae\', \'multiverseId\': 389772}, \'multiverseid\': 389772}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beherrschender Wille\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl übernimmt bis zum Ende des Zuges die Kontrolle über bis zu drei nichtangreifende Kreaturen deiner Wahl. Enttappe diese Kreaturen. Sie blocken in diesem Zug, falls möglich.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390162&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'211e1a22-26e6-4b24-b683-13dabd482561\', \'multiverseId\': 390162}, \'multiverseid\': 390162}, {\'name\': \'Voluntad dominante\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo gana el control de hasta tres criaturas objetivo que no sean atacantes hasta el final del turno. Endereza esas criaturas. Bloquean este turno si pueden.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e30c9d9a-0eca-4823-bf01-e68b41d3d497\', \'multiverseId\': 391510}, \'multiverseid\': 391510}, {\'name\': \'Volonté dominatrice\', \'text\': "Le joueur ciblé acquiert le contrôle de jusqu\'à trois créatures non-attaquantes ciblées jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Dégagez ces créatures. Elles bloquent ce tour-ci si possible.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390499&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eef81893-9c0b-4446-9be7-7c2731cd9b3c\', \'multiverseId\': 390499}, \'multiverseid\': 390499}, {\'name\': \'Volontà Opprimente\', \'text\': \'Scegli fino a tre creature non attaccanti bersaglio. Un giocatore bersaglio prende il controllo di quelle creature fino alla fine del turno. STAPpa quelle creature. Bloccano in questo turno, se possono farlo.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390836&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f7ed21e-07ea-4d04-aa01-56e0662736c0\', \'multiverseId\': 390836}, \'multiverseid\': 390836}, {\'name\': \'支配的な意志\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人と、攻撃していないクリーチャー最大３体までを対象とする。ターン終了時まで、そのプレイヤーはそれらのクリーチャーのコントロールを得る。それらのクリーチャーをアンタップする。このターン、それらは可能ならブロックする。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'506c51bb-7053-45ba-bdf9-ec7297cd0f23\', \'multiverseId\': 391173}, \'multiverseid\': 391173}, {\'name\': \'意志霸揽\', \'text\': \'目标牌手获得至多三个目标非进行攻击之生物的操控权直到回合结束。重置这些生物。它们本回合若能进行阻挡，则必须如此作。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f837e5d4-4257-4bc5-8afb-0692c17e2b32\', \'multiverseId\': 389825}, \'multiverseid\': 389825}]', '[{\'name\': \'Belagerungsbehemoth\', \'text\': \'Fluchsicher\\nSolange der Belagerungsbehemoth angreift, kannst du jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, ihren Kampfschaden zuweisen lassen, als ob sie nicht geblockt worden wäre.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'„Haltet die Stellung, haltet die Ste—" —General Srok, letzte Worte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390344&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf027c66-0d0a-43cd-ac57-f35164c54872\', \'multiverseId\': 390344}, \'multiverseid\': 390344}, {\'name\': \'Behemot de asedio\', \'text\': \'Antimaleficio.\\nMientras el Behemot de asedio esté atacando, por cada criatura que controlas, puedes hacer que esa criatura asigne su daño de combate como si no hubiera sido bloqueada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Mantengan la formación! ¡Mantengan la for...!" —General Srok, últimas palabras\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c9e64ba-91d3-48b0-8a63-45b79d10ed97\', \'multiverseId\': 391692}, \'multiverseid\': 391692}, {\'name\': \'Béhémoth de siège\', \'text\': "Défense talismanique\\nTant que le Béhémoth de siège attaque, pour chaque créature que vous contrôlez, vous pouvez faire que cette créature attribue ses blessures de combat comme si elle n\'était pas bloquée.", \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': \'« Tenez la position, tenez la p... » —Général Srok, derniers mots\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390681&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19633b32-8135-4c29-8a84-6d3cdf4a3414\', \'multiverseId\': 390681}, \'multiverseid\': 390681}, {\'name\': \'Behemoth da Assedio\', \'text\': \'Anti-malocchio\\nFintanto che il Behemoth da Assedio attacca, per ogni creatura che controlli, puoi far assegnare a quella creatura il suo danno da combattimento come se non fosse bloccata.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'"Serrate i ranghi, serrate i ra..." —Generale Srok, ultime parole\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e1d23f1-1e42-4df4-bcbb-e10a485c6d16\', \'multiverseId\': 391018}, \'multiverseid\': 391018}, {\'name\': \'包囲ビヒモス\', \'text\': \'呪禁\\n包囲ビヒモスが攻撃しているかぎり、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体につき、あなたはそのクリーチャーの戦闘ダメージを、それがブロックされなかったかのように割り振ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'「戦線を維持せよ、戦線を維…」 ――スラーク将軍、最後の言葉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56b71627-3b84-4e7e-80d1-2962b6d1d54a\', \'multiverseId\': 391355}, \'multiverseid\': 391355}, {\'name\': \'攻城贝西摩斯\', \'text\': \'辟邪\\n只要攻城贝西摩斯进行攻击，则对由你操控的每个生物而言，你可以让该生物视同未受阻挡地分配战斗伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物～野兽\', \'flavor\': \'「给我守住，给我守～」 ～斯拉可将军的遗言\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f905b45-ea58-4a94-8e9b-3a874b524179\', \'multiverseId\': 390007}, \'multiverseid\': 390007}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bewahrer des Waldes\', \'text\': \'Opfere ein Land: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges Verhülltheit. (Sie kann nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Er ist ins Herz des Waldes gereist. Dachtest du wirklich, du könntest Macht über ihn ausüben?" —Druide des Eichenstamms\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390383&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95fe4f81-ca22-4a43-b8c3-23411010a43e\', \'multiverseId\': 390383}, \'multiverseid\': 390383}, {\'name\': \'Protector silvestre\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar una tierra: La criatura objetivo que controlas gana la habilidad de velo hasta el final del turno. (No puede ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Ha estado en el corazón del bosque. ¿De verdad esperabas tener algún poder sobre él?" —Druida vainaroble\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf4a9749-8ad0-4aec-8fc0-48362e2aef82\', \'multiverseId\': 391731}, \'multiverseid\': 391731}, {\'name\': \'Protecteur sylvestre\', \'text\': "Sacrifiez un terrain : La créature ciblée que vous contrôlez acquiert le linceul jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Elle ne peut pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'« Il a été au cœur même de la forêt. Pensiez-vous vraiment avoir un quelconque pouvoir sur lui ? » —Druide Chênepeau\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390720&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acbb596a-728d-4c8a-9144-9b31a502805f\', \'multiverseId\': 390720}, \'multiverseid\': 390720}, {\'name\': \'Guardiano Silvestre\', \'text\': \'Sacrifica una terra: Una creatura bersaglio che controlli ha velo fino alla fine del turno. (Non può essere bersaglio di magie o abilità.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Ha visitato il cuore del bosco. Ti aspettavi davvero di avere potere su di lui?" —Druido Pellequercia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12b939aa-420b-4266-bd49-13cf20df805e\', \'multiverseId\': 391057}, \'multiverseid\': 391057}, {\'name\': \'森を護る者\', \'text\': \'土地を１つ生け贄に捧げる：あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは被覆を得る。（それは呪文や能力の対象にならない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「彼は森の核心部まで行ってきたのですよ。彼に本当に力を行使できると思っていたのですか？」 ――樫皮のドルイド\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391394&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dd98529-8307-415a-9965-27b69aecad19\', \'multiverseId\': 391394}, \'multiverseid\': 391394}, {\'name\': \'林间救护人\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个地：目标由你操控的生物获得帷幕异能直到回合结束。（它不能成为咒语或异能的目标。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「他就连树林腹地都能来去自如。你真以为能有办法对付他？」 ～橡隐德鲁伊\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acb4e984-e562-462f-a693-ac75866caf02\', \'multiverseId\': 390046}, \'multiverseid\': 390046}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blasphemische Tat\', \'text\': \'Die Blasphemische Tat kostet beim Wirken für jede Kreatur im Spiel {1} weniger.\\nDie Blasphemische Tat fügt jeder Kreatur 13 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Heilige Orte schützen nicht mehr vor dem Tod, und der Tod schützt auch nicht mehr vor allem." —Thalia, Katharerritterin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390117&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65a5a1ec-a5ae-4278-bfc9-be5228eccd93\', \'multiverseId\': 390117}, \'multiverseid\': 390117}, {\'name\': \'Acto blasfemo\', \'text\': \'Cuesta {1} menos lanzar el Acto blasfemo por cada criatura en el campo de batalla.\\nEl Acto blasfemo hace 13 puntos de daño a cada criatura.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Los lugares sagrados ya no son un santuario contra la muerte, y la muerte ya no es un santuario contra nada." —Thalia, caballero cátaro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391465&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b3bae0b-8a67-446c-9316-a7be09d109bb\', \'multiverseId\': 391465}, \'multiverseid\': 391465}, {\'name\': \'Acte blasphématoire\', \'text\': "L\'Acte blasphématoire coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque créature sur le champ de bataille.\\nL\'Acte blasphématoire inflige 13 blessures à chaque créature.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Les lieux sacrés ne sont plus un sanctuaire contre la mort, et la mort n\'est plus un sanctuaire du tout. » —Thalia, chevalière cathare", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390454&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'646e59d3-7f30-48db-a51a-7e396e4557d0\', \'multiverseId\': 390454}, \'multiverseid\': 390454}, {\'name\': \'Atto Blasfemo\', \'text\': "L\'Atto Blasfemo costa {1} in meno per essere lanciato per ogni creatura sul campo di battaglia.\\nL\'Atto Blasfemo infligge 13 danni a ogni creatura.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"I luoghi sacri non offrono più rifugio dalla morte e la morte non offre più rifugio da nulla." —Thalia, Cavaliera Catara\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'934dc379-180b-42b3-920d-5df9b011a940\', \'multiverseId\': 390791}, \'multiverseid\': 390791}, {\'name\': \'冒涜の行動\', \'text\': \'冒涜の行動を唱えるためのコストは、戦場に出ているクリーチャー１体につき{1}少なくなる。\\n冒涜の行動は各クリーチャーにそれぞれ13点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「聖なる地は、すでに死からの安住の地ではありません。そして死は、すでにあらゆるものにとっての安住の地ではありません。」 ――聖戦騎士サリア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b688a6f0-6ce0-42f0-8f67-d7112b76e985\', \'multiverseId\': 391128}, \'multiverseid\': 391128}, {\'name\': \'渎神行径\', \'text\': \'战场上每有一个生物，渎神行径便减少{1}来施放。\\n渎神行径对每个生物各造成13点伤害。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「圣地不再免于死亡沾惹，死亡也不再免于任何沾惹。」 ～护教军骑士莎利雅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ebd8ce0-789a-4307-bc11-9972043d4f04\', \'multiverseId\': 389780}, \'multiverseid\': 389780}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutgabendämon\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments zieht ein Spieler deiner Wahl eine Karte und verliert 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': \'Er genießt die Hingabe seiner Skirsdag-Popanzen und deren Glaube, dass sie dadurch Unsterblichkeit erlangen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390118&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a55f0d9a-309d-49dd-a86f-c9df3b22a845\', \'multiverseId\': 390118}, \'multiverseid\': 390118}, {\'name\': \'Demonio regalo de sangre\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, el jugador objetivo roba una carta y pierde 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': \'Él disfruta de la devoción de sus marionetas Skirsdag y de que crean que eso les garantizará la inmortalidad.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb559d15-cc9a-4d2b-b62b-cf0da2bbe438\', \'multiverseId\': 391466}, \'multiverseid\': 391466}, {\'name\': "Démon d\'offresang", \'text\': \'Vol\\nAu début de votre entretien, le joueur ciblé pioche une carte et perd 1 point de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': "Il se délecte de la dévotion de ses marionnettes de Skirsdag et de leur conviction qu\'elle leur apportera l\'immortalité.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390455&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7915f87-2147-4400-a8ba-24932ecf3a53\', \'multiverseId\': 390455}, \'multiverseid\': 390455}, {\'name\': \'Demone del Dono di Sangue\', \'text\': "Volare\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, un giocatore bersaglio pesca una carta e perde 1 punto vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': "Apprezza molto la devozione dei suoi burattini Skirsdag e la loro convinzione che farà loro guadagnare l\'immortalità.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'042efa12-a906-4020-aa3f-7daa78ce4fd7\', \'multiverseId\': 390792}, \'multiverseid\': 390792}, {\'name\': \'血の贈与の悪魔\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカードを１枚引き、１点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': \'彼はスカースダグの傀儡の献身と、それにより不死になるという誤った信仰を嗜好する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9b5329d-11d2-4755-8e50-2e08b6f2adcc\', \'multiverseId\': 391129}, \'multiverseid\': 391129}, {\'name\': \'血礼恶魔\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n在你的维持开始时，目标牌手抓一张牌且失去1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～恶魔\', \'flavor\': \'手下的史革达傀儡为他作出奉献，相信这能为自己带来永生；这让他非常受用。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389781&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b51118d-b827-49dd-8003-c69e4f8f5f6c\', \'multiverseId\': 389781}, \'multiverseid\': 389781}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutige Ausbeute\', \'text\': \'Bringe einen X/X schwarzen Schrecken-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturen ist, die in diesem Zug gestorben sind.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Reste sind das Beste." —Derecht, Fleischzerleger\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390365&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62a64d70-dde1-483f-acd5-d0666888fce0\', \'multiverseId\': 390365}, \'multiverseid\': 390365}, {\'name\': \'Botín de sangre\', \'text\': \'Pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Horror negra X/X, donde X es la cantidad de criaturas que murieron este turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Siempre hay restos". —Derekt, troceador de carne\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'857ed445-99a6-45f7-a6e4-91d225976352\', \'multiverseId\': 391713}, \'multiverseid\': 391713}, {\'name\': \'Butin de sang\', \'text\': \'Mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature X/X noire Horreur, X étant le nombre de créatures qui sont mortes ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Il y a toujours des restes. » —Derecht, tailleur de chair\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390702&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbfd42c1-9f6c-461a-9102-729299c229ac\', \'multiverseId\': 390702}, \'multiverseid\': 390702}, {\'name\': \'Spoglie di Sangue\', \'text\': \'Metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Orrore X/X nera, dove X è il numero di creature che sono morte in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Restano sempre degli avanzi." —Derecht, intagliatore di carne\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cebadcd-41f6-4ad8-a4dc-a134245fa7df\', \'multiverseId\': 391039}, \'multiverseid\': 391039}, {\'name\': \'血の戦利品\', \'text\': \'黒のＸ/Ｘのホラー・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。Ｘはこのターンに死亡したクリーチャーの総数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「余りものならいつでもある。」 ――肉裂き魔、デレクト\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02d9cb12-a6b0-4949-a386-6b921aa5a861\', \'multiverseId\': 391376}, \'multiverseid\': 391376}, {\'name\': \'集血化生\', \'text\': \'将一个X/X黑色惊惧兽衍生生物放进战场，X为于本回合中死去的生物数量。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「总是有剩下的东西。」 ～命雕师德雷切\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e108575-6031-4bd1-93d0-e14cf59e5d74\', \'multiverseId\': 390028}, \'multiverseid\': 390028}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bogardanischer Höllendrache\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nFliegend\\nWenn der Bogardanische Höllendrache ins Spiel kommt, fügt er 5 Schadenspunkte zu, deren Aufteilung auf eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen und/oder Spielern deiner Wahl du bestimmst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390119&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e001e3a2-8141-4824-92af-39f2b8dc1d58\', \'multiverseId\': 390119}, \'multiverseid\': 390119}, {\'name\': \'Engendro de Bogardan\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nVuela.\\nCuando el Engendro de Bogardan entre al campo de batalla, hace 5 puntos de daño divididos como elijas entre cualquier cantidad de criaturas y/o jugadores objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391467&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95d3bf86-70a3-46de-8858-9c90441c0279\', \'multiverseId\': 391467}, \'multiverseid\': 391467}, {\'name\': \'Escouflenfer du Bogardân\', \'text\': "Flash\\nVol\\nQuand l\'Escouflenfer du Bogardân arrive sur le champ de bataille, il inflige 5 blessures réparties comme vous le voulez entre n\'importe quel nombre de cibles, créatures et/ou joueurs.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390456&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'258531bf-4d71-418b-b4a5-7bcb23087654\', \'multiverseId\': 390456}, \'multiverseid\': 390456}, {\'name\': \'Nibbio Infernale di Bogardan\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nVolare\\nQuando il Nibbio Infernale di Bogardan entra nel campo di battaglia, infligge 5 danni divisi a tua scelta tra un qualsiasi numero di creature e/o giocatori bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12f3803e-d197-4db9-ad8f-706cc21dac24\', \'multiverseId\': 390793}, \'multiverseid\': 390793}, {\'name\': \'ボガーダンのヘルカイト\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n飛行\\nボガーダンのヘルカイトが戦場に出たとき、望む数のクリーチャーやプレイヤーを対象とする。ボガーダンのヘルカイトは、それらに５点のダメージをあなたの望むように分割して与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0649384a-f8bb-4ef0-b4ba-b50638643d8e\', \'multiverseId\': 391130}, \'multiverseid\': 391130}, {\'name\': \'博卡登残虐者\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n飞行\\n当博卡登残虐者进战场时，它对任意数量的目标生物和／或牌手造成共5点伤害，你可以任意分配。\', \'type\': \'生物～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d2d9db0-52c2-418c-ab04-353a77d55afa\', \'multiverseId\': 389782}, \'multiverseid\': 389782}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bojukamoor\', \'text\': \'Das Bojukamoor kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Bojukamoor ins Spiel kommt, schicke alle Karten aus dem Friedhof eines Spielers deiner Wahl ins Exil.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390120&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'054b49c6-1a8c-4d52-8601-f2b392052e7d\', \'multiverseId\': 390120}, \'multiverseid\': 390120}, {\'name\': \'Ciénaga de Bojuka\', \'text\': \'La Ciénaga de Bojuka entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Ciénaga de Bojuka entre al campo de batalla, exilia todas las cartas del cementerio del jugador objetivo.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391468&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46646762-d75a-4090-9c68-1f36a0a86db7\', \'multiverseId\': 391468}, \'multiverseid\': 391468}, {\'name\': \'Marécage de Bojuka\', \'text\': \'Le Marécage de Bojuka arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Marécage de Bojuka arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez toutes les cartes du cimetière du joueur ciblé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} à votre réserve.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390457&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff2936cf-a52e-4fcc-9b38-8b0385b0852a\', \'multiverseId\': 390457}, \'multiverseid\': 390457}, {\'name\': \'Acquitrino di Bojuka\', \'text\': "L\'Acquitrino di Bojuka entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando l\'Acquitrino di Bojuka entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia tutte le carte dal cimitero di un giocatore bersaglio.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} alla tua riserva di mana.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cee8f552-7a84-491b-b5f6-c19bb5db7e4b\', \'multiverseId\': 390794}, \'multiverseid\': 390794}, {\'name\': \'ボジューカの沼\', \'text\': \'ボジューカの沼はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nボジューカの沼が戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーの墓地にあるすべてのカードを追放する。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab4e0f86-62c7-4b69-a773-39a1e0b170f0\', \'multiverseId\': 391131}, \'multiverseid\': 391131}, {\'name\': \'泊卒卡腐沼\', \'text\': \'泊卒卡腐沼须横置进战场。\\n当泊卒卡腐沼进战场时，放逐目标牌手坟墓场中的所有牌。\\n{T}：加{B}到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'294fe651-62f6-4a70-8271-c4fb564c9ce7\', \'multiverseId\': 389783}, \'multiverseid\': 389783}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bosh der Eisengolem\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\n{3}{R}, opfere ein Artefakt: Bosh der Eisengolem fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl Schadenspunkte in Höhe der umgewandelten Manakosten des geopferten Artefakts zu.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Artefaktkreatur — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'Während Glissa nach der Wahrheit über Memnarch sucht, will Bosh die tief in seinem Gedächtnis vergrabenen Geheimnisse erforschen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390122&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e54a435b-f1f4-4c95-9c62-723c238bce15\', \'multiverseId\': 390122}, \'multiverseid\': 390122}, {\'name\': \'Bosh, gólem de hierro\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\n{3}{R}, sacrificar un artefacto: Bosh, gólem de hierro hace una cantidad de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo igual al coste de maná convertido del artefacto sacrificado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto legendaria — Gólem\', \'flavor\': \'Mientras Glissa busca la verdad sobre Memnarch, Bosh trata de desenterrar los secretos de su pasado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391470&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd34605e-c2d2-450f-8ac1-af6904089aca\', \'multiverseId\': 391470}, \'multiverseid\': 391470}, {\'name\': \'Bosh, golem de fer\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\n{3}{R}, sacrifiez un artefact : Bosh, golem de fer inflige à une cible, créature ou joueur, un nombre de blessures égal au coût converti de mana de l\'artefact sacrifié.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact légendaire : golem\', \'flavor\': \'Alors que Glissa cherche à savoir la vérité sur Memnarch, Bosh cherche à déchiffrer les secrets enfouis au fond de sa mémoire.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390459&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6c7a412-e08d-4f2d-8ab4-94b5e0ef27da\', \'multiverseId\': 390459}, \'multiverseid\': 390459}, {\'name\': \'Bosh, Golem di Ferro\', \'text\': "Travolgere\\n{3}{R}, Sacrifica un artefatto: Bosh, Golem di Ferro infligge a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio danno pari al costo di mana convertito dell\'artefatto sacrificato.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto Leggendaria — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'Mentre Glissa cerca la verità su Memnarch, Bosh cerca di far riemergere i segreti sepolti negli abissi del suo passato.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f393642-6368-4501-b857-51b226f88604\', \'multiverseId\': 390796}, \'multiverseid\': 390796}, {\'name\': \'鉄のゴーレム、ボッシュ\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n{3}{R}, アーティファクトを１つ生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。鉄のゴーレム、ボッシュはそれに、その生け贄に捧げられたアーティファクトの点数で見たマナ・コストに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム\', \'flavor\': \'グリッサがメムナークに関する真実を探すのと同じように、ボッシュも自分の記憶の奥深く埋もれた秘密を探そうとしている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abcd1594-fe66-473b-be70-4176ef22124f\', \'multiverseId\': 391133}, \'multiverseid\': 391133}, {\'name\': \'铁魔像霸西\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n{3}{R}，牺牲一个神器：铁魔像霸西对目标生物或牌手造成伤害，其数量等同于所牺牲神器的总法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器生物～魔像\', \'flavor\': \'当格莉莎四处打探关于蒙纳坷的事，霸西也自脑海深处翻拣长埋的记忆。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e266d93-8d9a-4e79-8107-1f530630d376\', \'multiverseId\': 389785}, \'multiverseid\': 389785}]', '[{\'name\': \'Boshafte Heimsuchung\', \'text\': \'Morbide — Wenn du die Boshafte Heimsuchung wirkst und falls in diesem Zug eine Kreatur gestorben ist, kannst du die Boshafte Heimsuchung kopieren und ein neues Ziel für die Kopie bestimmen.\\nZerstöre eine nichtschwarze Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Nur die Reinen werden von diesem Elend heimgesucht." —Byro, Seuchenarzt\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390261&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'019fe97a-58fa-4778-a019-c85fee90e832\', \'multiverseId\': 390261}, \'multiverseid\': 390261}, {\'name\': \'Aflicción maliciosa\', \'text\': \'Necrario — Cuando lances la Aflicción maliciosa, si una criatura murió este turno, puedes copiar la Aflicción maliciosa y puedes elegir un nuevo objetivo para la copia.\\nDestruye la criatura objetivo que no sea negra.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Tal aflicción parece afectar a los puros". —Byro, médico de la plaga\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9da8a36c-4e67-4036-b7f7-d4d797095f38\', \'multiverseId\': 391609}, \'multiverseid\': 391609}, {\'name\': \'Affliction malveillante\', \'text\': "Morbidité — Quand vous lancez l\'Affliction malveillante, si une créature est morte ce tour-ci, vous pouvez copier l\'Affliction malveillante et choisir une nouvelle cible pour la copie.\\nDétruisez la créature non-noire ciblée.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Cette affliction se propage essentiellement chez les purs. » —Byro, pestologue\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390598&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e01edb7d-d0dd-4643-97cd-996be58aa8c3\', \'multiverseId\': 390598}, \'multiverseid\': 390598}, {\'name\': \'Afflizione Malefica\', \'text\': "Morboso — Quando lanci l\'Afflizione Malefica, se è morta una creatura in questo turno, puoi copiare l\'Afflizione Malefica e puoi scegliere un nuovo bersaglio per la copia.\\nDistruggi una creatura non nera bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Una tale afflizione sembra ricercare i puri." —Byro, medico della pestilenza\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390935&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'184a21df-0a61-4533-8f22-43a783567636\', \'multiverseId\': 390935}, \'multiverseid\': 390935}, {\'name\': \'悪意の苦悶\', \'text\': \'陰鬱 ― あなたが悪意の苦悶を唱えたとき、このターンにクリーチャーが死亡していた場合、あなたは悪意の苦悶をコピーしてもよい。あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\\n黒でないクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「この類の苦悶は、清浄を探し求めているように見受けられる。」 ――疫病医師、バイロ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'241a02a0-28b8-4007-b75a-58d41de92b30\', \'multiverseId\': 391272}, \'multiverseid\': 391272}, {\'name\': \'恶毒折磨\', \'text\': \'丧心～当你施放恶毒折磨时，若本回合有生物死去，则你可以复制恶毒折磨，且可以为该复制品选择新的目标。\\n消灭目标非黑色的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「此类折磨之目的似乎是找出至纯生灵。」 ～瘟疫医士拜洛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4865b05f-1623-4b35-aba7-de5d580ab36b\', \'multiverseId\': 389924}, \'multiverseid\': 389924}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brandrodung\', \'text\': \'Opfere ein Land als zusätzliche Kosten, um die Brandrodung zu wirken.\\nDurchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten und bringe diese ins Spiel. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Kein Fleck der Erde ist wirklich unfruchtbar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390219&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb6196d7-6e62-4ce0-9b0d-73ee6e3a3f50\', \'multiverseId\': 390219}, \'multiverseid\': 390219}, {\'name\': \'Gradar\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar Gradar, sacrifica una tierra.\\nBusca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica y ponlas en el campo de batalla. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'En la naturaleza no hay lugares del todo yermos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93941cd8-b7a9-4c34-b072-e0db965849d3\', \'multiverseId\': 391567}, \'multiverseid\': 391567}, {\'name\': \'Hersage\', \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour jouer le Hersage, sacrifiez un terrain.\\nCherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base et mettez-les sur le champ de bataille. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'La nature ne renonce jamais.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390556&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d07bc501-8889-4c39-b294-2682c3771c46\', \'multiverseId\': 390556}, \'multiverseid\': 390556}, {\'name\': \'Erpice\', \'text\': "Come costo addizionale per lanciare l\'Erpice, sacrifica una terra.\\nPassa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base e mettile sul campo di battaglia. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'In natura nessun luogo è realmente spoglio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a46d0c5-a4f0-4898-aa8f-d15cb0a0a65f\', \'multiverseId\': 390893}, \'multiverseid\': 390893}, {\'name\': \'砕土\', \'text\': \'砕土を唱えるための追加コストとして、土地を１つ生け贄に捧げる。\\nあなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カードを最大２枚まで探し、それらを戦場に出す。その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'自然の中には、真の意味で不毛の地などはないのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08e2d6af-5bf3-4c1f-a931-80595b852fc6\', \'multiverseId\': 391230}, \'multiverseid\': 391230}, {\'name\': \'整地\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个地，以作为施放整地的额外费用。\\n从你的牌库中搜寻至多两张基本地牌，并将它们放进战场。然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'大自然中没有永恒的不毛之地。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10f703b6-8f05-4b26-aef4-988b6a4ad168\', \'multiverseId\': 389882}, \'multiverseid\': 389882}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brosche des Wandersmanns\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, opfere die Brosche des Wandersmanns: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte und bringe diese Karte getappt ins Spiel. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Sie ist wie der Wald hinterm Horizont, wie der Berg, der noch bezwungen werden will, wie das neue Land hinter dem endlosen Meer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390415&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9305d7a8-3852-4031-bfff-565194ed29c0\', \'multiverseId\': 390415}, \'multiverseid\': 390415}, {\'name\': \'Baratija del caminante\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, sacrificar la Baratija del caminante: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica y pon esa carta en el campo de batalla girada. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Es el bosque más allá del horizonte, la montaña que espera ser escalada, la nueva tierra detrás del mar interminable.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'680622dd-e029-4f3c-81d5-fc41b5c71ea8\', \'multiverseId\': 391763}, \'multiverseid\': 391763}, {\'name\': \'Babiole du voyageur\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, sacrifiez la Babiole du voyageur : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base et mettez cette carte sur le champ de bataille engagée. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "C\'est la forêt au-delà de l\'horizon, la montagne encore vierge, la nouvelle terre au-delà de la mer éternelle.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390752&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bdf2b4f-9a9c-438e-a0eb-44d9389fe87e\', \'multiverseId\': 390752}, \'multiverseid\': 390752}, {\'name\': \'Ninnolo del Viaggiatore\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, Sacrifica il Ninnolo del Viaggiatore: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base e mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "È la foresta oltre l\'orizzonte, la montagna che attende di essere scalata, la nuova terra dall\'altra parte del mare infinito.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d80b8840-fcbc-44d1-a2b5-ba8fd0d1932f\', \'multiverseId\': 391089}, \'multiverseid\': 391089}, {\'name\': \'旅人のガラクタ\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, 旅人のガラクタを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カードを１枚探し、それをタップ状態で戦場に出す。その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'それは地平線の彼方の森であり、登るものを待つ山であり、終わりなき海の向こうの見果てぬ地である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8070f5db-ae18-415a-b98c-eefb30919d9f\', \'multiverseId\': 391426}, \'multiverseid\': 391426}, {\'name\': \'旅人饰品\', \'text\': \'{2}，{T}，牺牲旅人饰品：从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，并将之横置进战场。然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'这是地平线远处的树林，尚待征服的山脉，无尽汪洋彼端的新大地。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd2438df-debd-4a54-aae7-10913f0f3a16\', \'multiverseId\': 390078}, \'multiverseid\': 390078}]', '[{\'name\': \'Calums Zauberbuch\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Ziehe eine Karte und wirf dann eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Die meisten Bücher liefern einfach nur Wissen. Dieses hier erwartet welches zurück.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390240&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47fb24a3-3b30-408b-8ef5-2522c4b650c9\', \'multiverseId\': 390240}, \'multiverseid\': 390240}, {\'name\': \'Volumen de Jalum\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Roba una carta, luego descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'La mayoría de libros solo aportan conocimientos. Este espera algunos de ellos a cambio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdd1cc94-e39b-494d-84a3-bac16013cd40\', \'multiverseId\': 391588}, \'multiverseid\': 391588}, {\'name\': \'Grimoire de Jalum\', \'text\': "{2}, {T} : Piochez une carte, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'La plupart des livres vous apportent la connaissance. Celui-ci attend que vous rendiez la pareille.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390577&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae130baf-2864-41df-907c-99829d8ce2b0\', \'multiverseId\': 390577}, \'multiverseid\': 390577}, {\'name\': \'Tomo di Jalum\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Pesca una carta, poi scarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'La maggior parte dei libri offre conoscenze. Questo si aspetta anche qualcosa in cambio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390914&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca93d3c6-ff9f-4445-96ae-1df78f0f6b44\', \'multiverseId\': 390914}, \'multiverseid\': 390914}, {\'name\': \'ジェイラム秘本\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}：カードを１枚引き、その後カードを１枚捨てる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'大抵の書物は単に知識を伝えてくれるもんだ。この本ときたらお返しを期待するんだよ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b76379ba-a70a-433e-9ab2-1320c6e24b37\', \'multiverseId\': 391251}, \'multiverseid\': 391251}, {\'name\': \'贾伦的钜著\', \'text\': \'{2}，{T}：抓一张牌，然后弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'大部分的书只是传达知识，但这一本还期待些回馈。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f8a8f48-f2d6-4e22-a915-7456ab0570a6\', \'multiverseId\': 389903}, \'multiverseid\': 389903}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chaosschleife\', \'text\': \'Der Besitzer einer bleibenden Karte deiner Wahl mischt diese in seine Bibliothek und zeigt dann die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek offen vor. Falls es eine bleibende Karte ist, bringt er sie ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390136&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8335619-5dea-4b66-ac3f-7ce345d05691\', \'multiverseId\': 390136}, \'multiverseid\': 390136}, {\'name\': \'Distorsión caótica\', \'text\': \'El propietario del permanente objetivo lo baraja en su biblioteca y luego muestra la primera carta de su biblioteca. Si es una carta de permanente, la pone en el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c7c8bcc-865a-4690-9f8c-56749a995930\', \'multiverseId\': 391484}, \'multiverseid\': 391484}, {\'name\': \'Distorsion chaotique\', \'text\': "Le propriétaire du permanent ciblé le mélange à sa bibliothèque et révèle ensuite la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque. Si c\'est une carte de permanent, il la met sur le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390473&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df4f3b76-8845-42e2-84b5-932b224a5414\', \'multiverseId\': 390473}, \'multiverseid\': 390473}, {\'name\': \'Distorsione Caotica\', \'text\': \'Il proprietario di un permanente bersaglio lo rimescola nel suo grimorio, poi rivela la prima carta del suo grimorio. Se è una carta permanente, la mette sul campo di battaglia.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3962be4f-0598-4d96-8291-023b01c1b691\', \'multiverseId\': 390810}, \'multiverseid\': 390810}, {\'name\': \'混沌のねじれ\', \'text\': \'パーマネント１つを対象とする。それのオーナーはそれを自分のライブラリーに加えて切り直し、その後自分のライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開する。それがパーマネント・カードであるなら、そのプレイヤーはそれを戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7907a59f-7975-461a-8558-d9bc56c45c8a\', \'multiverseId\': 391147}, \'multiverseid\': 391147}, {\'name\': \'混沌歪曲\', \'text\': \'目标永久物的拥有者将它洗入其牌库，然后展示其牌库顶牌。如果该牌为永久物牌，则该牌手将之放进战场。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389799&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd07b525-4c7f-4190-8330-9e5265e02587\', \'multiverseId\': 389799}, \'multiverseid\': 389799}]', "[{'name': 'Dampfender Krater', 'text': 'Der Dampfende Krater kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {R}.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390354&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ac2dfbaf-2961-4484-bb52-e2f53e2bdb7f', 'multiverseId': 390354}, 'multiverseid': 390354}, {'name': 'Cráter ardiente', 'text': 'El Cráter ardiente entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {R} a tu reserva de maná.\\nCiclo {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391702&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1ab766a6-8008-4bea-a2c7-a888470b79fa', 'multiverseId': 391702}, 'multiverseid': 391702}, {'name': 'Cratère fumant', 'text': 'Le Cratère fumant arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} à votre réserve.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390691&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '432b3457-a605-4435-8f7f-9eb3a0905b69', 'multiverseId': 390691}, 'multiverseid': 390691}, {'name': 'Cratere Fumante', 'text': 'Il Cratere Fumante entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} alla tua riserva di mana.\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391028&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '44759e5d-3dd1-4b75-9d15-aa0e8d2e4b54', 'multiverseId': 391028}, 'multiverseid': 391028}, {'name': '薄煙の火口', 'text': '薄煙の火口はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{R}を加える。\\nサイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391365&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e7e02411-5cd6-40e5-9683-ae3b1cc83a66', 'multiverseId': 391365}, 'multiverseid': 391365}, {'name': '闷燃火山口', 'text': '闷燃火山口须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{R}到你的法术力池中。\\n循环{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390017&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5812ee02-174c-4952-b06a-fda85b84e39f', 'multiverseId': 390017}, 'multiverseid': 390017}]", '[{\'name\': \'Daretti der Schrottkundige\', \'text\': \'+2: Wirf bis zu zwei Karten ab und ziehe dann entsprechend viele Karten.\\n−2: Opfere ein Artefakt. Falls du dies tust, bringe eine Artefaktkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\\n−10: Du erhältst ein Emblem mit „Immer wenn ein Artefakt aus dem Spiel auf deinen Friedhof gelegt wird, bringe seine Karte zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments ins Spiel zurück."\\nDaretti der Schrottkundige kann dein Kommandeur sein.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Daretti\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390152&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8aafe61e-c905-4357-b3eb-850e40a9d1be\', \'multiverseId\': 390152}, \'multiverseid\': 390152}, {\'name\': \'Daretti, sabio de la chatarra\', \'text\': \'+2: Descarta hasta dos cartas, luego roba esa misma cantidad de cartas.\\n−2: Sacrifica un artefacto. Si lo haces, regresa la carta de artefacto objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\\n−10: Obtienes un emblema con "Siempre que un artefacto vaya a tu cementerio desde el campo de batalla, regresa esa carta al campo de batalla al comienzo del próximo paso final".\\nDaretti, sabio de la chatarra puede ser tu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Daretti\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9d418e5-4938-4cf5-855a-73f971d204dc\', \'multiverseId\': 391500}, \'multiverseid\': 391500}, {\'name\': \'Daretti, savant ferrailleur\', \'text\': "+2 : Défaussez-vous de jusqu\'à deux cartes, puis piochez autant de cartes.\\n−2 : Sacrifiez un artefact. Si vous faites ainsi, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille une carte d\'artefact ciblée depuis votre cimetière.\\n−10 : Vous gagnez un emblème avec « À chaque fois qu\'un artefact est mis dans votre cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille au début de la prochaine étape de fin. »\\nDaretti, savant ferrailleur peut être votre commandant.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker : Daretti\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390489&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec85db7d-30a3-4e3f-8184-a330ddce7171\', \'multiverseId\': 390489}, \'multiverseid\': 390489}, {\'name\': \'Daretti, Esperto di Rottami\', \'text\': \'+2: Scarta fino a due carte, poi pesca altrettante carte.\\n-2: Sacrifica un artefatto. Se lo fai, rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta artefatto bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\\n-10: Ottieni un emblema con "Ogniqualvolta un artefatto viene messo nel tuo cimitero dal campo di battaglia, rimetti quella carta sul campo di battaglia all\\\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale".\\nDaretti, Esperto di Rottami può essere il tuo comandante.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Daretti\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390826&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'764391b7-797a-4053-978f-5437452f02e4\', \'multiverseId\': 390826}, \'multiverseid\': 390826}, {\'name\': \'屑鉄の学者、ダレッティ\', \'text\': \'＋２：カードを最大２枚まで捨て、その後その枚数に等しい枚数のカードを引く。\\n－２：アーティファクトを１つ生け贄に捧げる。そうしたなら、あなたの墓地にあるアーティファクト・カード１枚を対象とし、それを戦場に戻す。\\n－10：あなたは「アーティファクトが１つ戦場からあなたの墓地に置かれるたび、次の終了ステップの開始時に、そのカードを戦場に戻す。」を持つ紋章を得る。\\n屑鉄の学者、ダレッティは統率者として使用できる。\', \'type\': \'プレインズウォーカー — ダレッティ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f01eb3ba-3a88-421d-8b61-4b6bb0ca9530\', \'multiverseId\': 391163}, \'multiverseid\': 391163}, {\'name\': \'拆解学究达雷迪\', \'text\': \'+2：弃至多两张牌，然后抓等量的牌。\\n−2：牺牲一个神器。如果你如此作，则将目标神器牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\\n−10：你获得具有「每当任一神器从战场进入你的坟墓场，在下一个结束步骤开始时，将该牌移回战场」的徽记。\\n拆解学究达雷迪可用作指挥官。\', \'type\': \'鹏洛客～达雷迪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389815&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d037ada7-b2f7-40fc-934f-030c41065102\', \'multiverseId\': 389815}, \'multiverseid\': 389815}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dauernacht-Schatten\', \'text\': \'{B}: Der Dauernacht-Schatten erhält +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nUnverwüstlich (Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt und keine +1/+1-Marke auf ihr lag, bringe sie mit einer +1/+1-Marke unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schatten\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390182&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'693cedbf-afd9-4d95-b5dc-bde88e637b16\', \'multiverseId\': 390182}, \'multiverseid\': 390182}, {\'name\': \'Sombra de la noche eterna\', \'text\': \'{B}: La Sombra de la noche eterna obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\\nResiliencia. (Cuando esta criatura muera, si no tenía contadores +1/+1 sobre ella, regrésala al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario con un contador +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sombra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e97260f6-6357-40b3-976e-8ef66dcea91f\', \'multiverseId\': 391530}, \'multiverseid\': 391530}, {\'name\': \'Ombre de la nuit pérenne\', \'text\': "{B} : L\'Ombre de la nuit pérenne gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nSurvivance (Quand cette créature meurt, si elle n\'avait pas de marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle, renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.)", \'type\': \'Créature : ombre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390519&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e46ffa67-d5c8-454a-8d41-e418a411de0a\', \'multiverseId\': 390519}, \'multiverseid\': 390519}, {\'name\': \'Ombra della Notte Eterna\', \'text\': "{B}: L\'Ombra della Notte Eterna prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\\nImmortale (Quando questa creatura muore, se non aveva segnalini +1/+1, rimettila sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario con un segnalino +1/+1.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Ombra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe7a52bb-587e-4b01-984b-3c3d4c2eab0f\', \'multiverseId\': 390856}, \'multiverseid\': 390856}, {\'name\': \'常夜の影\', \'text\': \'{B}：ターン終了時まで、常夜の影は＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n不死（このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれていなかった場合、これを＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態でオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — シェイド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e333ff0-0443-4101-8332-1a86bd4f7592\', \'multiverseId\': 391193}, \'multiverseid\': 391193}, {\'name\': \'永夜阴魂\', \'text\': \'{B}：永夜阴魂得+1/+1直到回合结束。\\n不息（当此生物死去时，若其上没有+1/+1指示物，则将它在其拥有者的操控下移回战场，且其上有一个+1/+1指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物～阴魂\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5d9deba-de6b-410a-9c38-5d26ae19e411\', \'multiverseId\': 389845}, \'multiverseid\': 389845}]', "[{'name': 'Dekret der Gerechtigkeit', 'text': 'Bringe X 4/4 weiße Engel-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit ins Spiel.\\nUmwandlung {2}{W} ({2}{W}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\\nWenn du das Dekret der Gerechtigkeit umwandelst, kannst du {X} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, bringe X 1/1 weiße Soldat-Kreaturenspielsteine ins Spiel.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390154&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fa6c1530-b916-456f-8dab-c3d7e4ac814e', 'multiverseId': 390154}, 'multiverseid': 390154}, {'name': 'Decreto de justicia', 'text': 'Pon en el campo de batalla X fichas de criatura Ángel blancas 4/4 con la habilidad de volar.\\nCiclo {2}{W}. ({2}{W}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\\nCuando actives la habilidad de ciclo del Decreto de justicia, puedes pagar {X}. Si lo haces, pon en el campo de batalla X fichas de criatura Soldado blancas 1/1.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391502&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0309cc27-eb97-4888-9f2a-94c784962957', 'multiverseId': 391502}, 'multiverseid': 391502}, {'name': 'Décret de justice', 'text': 'Mettez sur le champ de bataille X jetons de créature 4/4 blanche Ange avec le vol.\\nRecyclage {2}{W} ({2}{W}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\\nQuand vous recyclez le Décret de justice, vous pouvez payer {X}. Si vous faites ainsi, mettez sur le champ de bataille X jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390491&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5f637514-a2e8-4c90-b5bd-b4c990b4980f', 'multiverseId': 390491}, 'multiverseid': 390491}, {'name': 'Decreto della Giustizia', 'text': 'Metti sul campo di battaglia X pedine creatura Angelo 4/4 bianche con volare.\\nCiclo {2}{W} ({2}{W}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\\nQuando cicli il Decreto della Giustizia, puoi pagare {X}. Se lo fai, metti sul campo di battaglia X pedine creatura Soldato 1/1 bianche.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390828&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1321a205-484b-4bab-9416-d2fe72a0933e', 'multiverseId': 390828}, 'multiverseid': 390828}, {'name': '正義の命令', 'text': '飛行を持つ白の４/４の天使・クリーチャー・トークンをＸ体戦場に出す。\\nサイクリング{2}{W}（{2}{W}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\\nあなたが正義の命令をサイクリングしたとき、あなたは{X}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークンをＸ体戦場に出す。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391165&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fde630ea-0147-41d1-bf6b-698294a4e338', 'multiverseId': 391165}, 'multiverseid': 391165}, {'name': '正义的宣判', 'text': '将X个4/4白色，具飞行异能的天使衍生生物放进战场。\\n循环{2}{W}（{2}{W}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\\n当你循环正义的宣判时，你可以支付{X}。若你如此作，则将X个1/1白色士兵衍生生物放进战场。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389817&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1cc69260-03ba-4262-bfd8-2e3bde2060b7', 'multiverseId': 389817}, 'multiverseid': 389817}]", '[{\'name\': \'Den Elementen trotzen\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eine Farbe. Weiße Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten bis zum Ende des Zuges Schutz vor der bestimmten Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Glaube mir, deine verlorenen Finger und Zehen sind nichts im Vergleich zum verlorenen Schatz von Sejiri." —Zahr Gada, Expeditionsführer aus Halimar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390124&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79fb6f8d-e690-4a83-b3f9-9e6a9312b4c3\', \'multiverseId\': 390124}, \'multiverseid\': 390124}, {\'name\': \'Resistir los elementos\', \'text\': \'Elige un color. Las criaturas blancas que controlas ganan protección contra el color elegido hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Créeme, tus dedos perdidos no son nada comparados con los tesoros perdidos de Sejiri." —Zahr Gada, líder de expedición de Halimar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391472&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6a4e850-157c-42f5-85fc-f61d916ea3ed\', \'multiverseId\': 391472}, \'multiverseid\': 391472}, {\'name\': \'Braver les éléments\', \'text\': "Choisissez une couleur. Les créatures blanches que vous contrôlez acquièrent la protection contre la couleur choisie jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Crois-moi, les doigts et les orteils que tu as perdus ne sont rien comparés aux trésors perdus de Seijiri. » —Zahr Gada, chef de l\'expédition d\'Halimar", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390461&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c275746-c148-43d6-ba96-65930d25db53\', \'multiverseId\': 390461}, \'multiverseid\': 390461}, {\'name\': \'Sfidare gli Elementi\', \'text\': \'Scegli un colore. Le creature bianche che controlli hanno protezione dal colore scelto fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Credimi, le dita che hai perso non sono nulla in confronto ai tesori smarriti di Sejiri." —Zahr Gada, capo spedizione di Halimar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b436a194-f889-40da-a543-bec72a50ca05\', \'multiverseId\': 390798}, \'multiverseid\': 390798}, {\'name\': \'精霊への挑戦\', \'text\': \'色を１色選ぶ。ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールする白のクリーチャーはプロテクション（その選ばれた色）を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「本当だとも。お前が失った指や爪先と、セジーリの失われた宝物とじゃ、全然比較にならないんだ。」 ――ハリマー探検隊長、ザール・ガーダ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f704487b-157a-4d5b-8fea-8fb5f082c6a2\', \'multiverseId\': 391135}, \'multiverseid\': 391135}, {\'name\': \'不惧酷境\', \'text\': \'选择一种颜色。由你操控的白色生物获得反该色保护异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「相信我，你失落的手指与脚趾远比不上塞基黎失落的宝藏。」 ～哈利玛探险队长萨格达\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389787&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4a38ba3-112e-4d88-9726-c32a1e45a4b4\', \'multiverseId\': 389787}, \'multiverseid\': 389787}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Tod des Narren\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nWenn die verzauberte Kreatur stirbt, bringe ihre Karte unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel zurück.\\nWenn der Tod des Narren aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, bringe den Tod des Narren auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390197&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b28b09ae-f0b2-40b1-a451-6b94fa8dea5c\', \'multiverseId\': 390197}, \'multiverseid\': 390197}, {\'name\': \'Fallecimiento del necio\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nCuando la criatura encantada muera, regresa esa carta al campo de batalla bajo tu control.\\nCuando el Fallecimiento del necio vaya a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, regresa el Fallecimiento del necio a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'620c14ca-7fae-41a1-ab43-e2c1d070fb74\', \'multiverseId\': 391545}, \'multiverseid\': 391545}, {\'name\': "Décès de l\'imbécile", \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nQuand la créature enchantée meurt, renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle.\\nQuand le Décès de l\'imbécile est mis dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, renvoyez le Décès de l\'imbécile dans la main de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390534&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c968b8a2-97ba-44c0-8e6c-6fde1929ac40\', \'multiverseId\': 390534}, \'multiverseid\': 390534}, {\'name\': \'Dipartita dello Sciocco\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nQuando la creatura incantata muore, rimetti quella carta sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo.\\nQuando la Dipartita dello Sciocco viene messa in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia, fai tornare la Dipartita dello Sciocco in mano al suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390871&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ec42c14-aa95-4886-a5e7-4271f9f0f7c6\', \'multiverseId\': 390871}, \'multiverseid\': 390871}, {\'name\': \'愚か者の死\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーが死亡したとき、そのカードをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\\n愚か者の死が戦場からいずれかの墓地に置かれたとき、愚か者の死をオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a8e6b20-717d-4128-9011-cf6a356b1d01\', \'multiverseId\': 391208}, \'multiverseid\': 391208}, {\'name\': \'假死\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n当所结附的生物死去时，将该牌在你的操控下移回战场。\\n当假死从战场进入坟墓场时，将假死移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'058d1d27-24a7-412b-9c3b-87536ef758ea\', \'multiverseId\': 389860}, \'multiverseid\': 389860}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Mächtigen stürzen\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Kreaturen, deren Stärke größer ist als die Stärke einer Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Es hat die Richtigen getroffen." —Junkerin Imalia, Retterin von Thiswick\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390190&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cf0c4d1-520b-4e5e-bc16-3335084c88ab\', \'multiverseId\': 390190}, \'multiverseid\': 390190}, {\'name\': \'Tumbar a los poderosos\', \'text\': \'Destruye todas las criaturas con una fuerza mayor que la fuerza de la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Se lo han buscado". —Escudera Imalia, salvadora de Tiswick\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c641377d-a541-45f8-9fdb-7285c8fa7f5a\', \'multiverseId\': 391538}, \'multiverseid\': 391538}, {\'name\': \'Anéantir les puissants\', \'text\': \'Détruisez toute les créatures de force supérieure à la force de la créature ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Ils ne l\'ont pas volé. » —Écuyère Imalia, libératrice de Thiswick", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390527&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'832bb459-2270-48b0-9d5e-3e1adefbc5b8\', \'multiverseId\': 390527}, \'multiverseid\': 390527}, {\'name\': \'Distruggere i Potenti\', \'text\': \'Distruggi tutte le creature con forza superiore alla forza di una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Se la sono cercata." —Scudiera Imalia, salvatrice di Thiswick\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'785fbf70-23f1-419a-8bde-c345f31adc41\', \'multiverseId\': 390864}, \'multiverseid\': 390864}, {\'name\': \'強者破り\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それのパワーより大きいパワーを持つクリーチャーをすべて破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「当然の報いよ。」 ――ティースウィークの救世主、従者イマリア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391201&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dbabd61-25f5-423d-8584-244c99ab5d32\', \'multiverseId\': 391201}, \'multiverseid\': 391201}, {\'name\': \'以弱制强\', \'text\': \'消灭所有力量大于目标生物的生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「他们罪有应得。」 ～蒂维克救星，扈从伊玛利亚\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4234a60-bcae-4340-bac8-e6ae578133c4\', \'multiverseId\': 389853}, \'multiverseid\': 389853}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Toten erwecken\', \'text\': \'Wirke Die Toten erwecken nur während des Kampfes im Zug eines Gegners.\\nBringe X Kreaturenkarten deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Opfere diese Kreaturen zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390412&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac61c7a3-de6c-4229-9d5c-c7bdb5595a61\', \'multiverseId\': 390412}, \'multiverseid\': 390412}, {\'name\': \'Despertar a los muertos\', \'text\': \'Lanza Despertar a los muertos solo durante el combate en el turno de un oponente.\\nRegresa X cartas de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Sacrifica esas criaturas al comienzo del próximo paso final.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391760&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94973e61-37ae-4bae-b74a-4b0b2c59540d\', \'multiverseId\': 391760}, \'multiverseid\': 391760}, {\'name\': \'Éveil des morts\', \'text\': "Ne lancez l\'Éveil des morts que pendant le combat pendant le tour d\'un adversaire.\\nRenvoyez sur le champ de bataille X cartes de créature ciblées depuis votre cimetière. Sacrifiez ces créatures au début de la prochaine étape de fin.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390749&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d452bec-cafe-464d-bd6d-5f78b6a5e898\', \'multiverseId\': 390749}, \'multiverseid\': 390749}, {\'name\': \'Risvegliare i Morti\', \'text\': "Lancia Risvegliare i Morti solo durante il combattimento nel turno di un avversario.\\nRimetti sul campo di battaglia X carte creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero. Sacrifica quelle creature all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b764e7f2-c9ab-420f-8814-ab75883dd890\', \'multiverseId\': 391086}, \'multiverseid\': 391086}, {\'name\': \'死者起こし\', \'text\': \'死者起こしは対戦相手のターンの戦闘中にのみ唱えられる。\\nあなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カードＸ枚を対象とし、それらを戦場に戻す。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それらのクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391423&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0e9d93c-ec86-47b8-9b98-96c57254e076\', \'multiverseId\': 391423}, \'multiverseid\': 391423}, {\'name\': \'唤醒亡者\', \'text\': \'只能于对手回合的战斗中施放唤醒亡者。\\n将X张目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。在下一个结束步骤开始时，牺牲这些生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57770dbd-d9d2-4b45-9a8f-c395fd72b219\', \'multiverseId\': 390075}, \'multiverseid\': 390075}]', '[{\'name\': \'Donnernder Baloth\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nLeutnant — Solange du deinen Kommandeur kontrollierst, erhält der Donnernde Baloth +2/+2 und andere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+2 und verursachen Trampelschaden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn du ihn hörst, ist es bereits zu spät.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390393&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9361c3d-facd-4fd9-b9a3-5d823cd551f0\', \'multiverseId\': 390393}, \'multiverseid\': 390393}, {\'name\': \'Báloth estruendoso\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nTeniente — Mientras controles a tu comandante, el Báloth estruendoso obtiene +2/+2 y las otras criaturas que controlas obtienen +2/+2 y tienen la habilidad de arrollar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Si lo oyes, es demasiado tarde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391741&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e34fe9d5-6737-42a8-8599-86b35be3d4e5\', \'multiverseId\': 391741}, \'multiverseid\': 391741}, {\'name\': \'Baloth piédetonnerre\', \'text\': \'Piétinement\\nLieutenant — Tant que vous contrôlez votre commandant, le Baloth piédetonnerre gagne +2/+2 et les autres créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+2 et ont le piétinement.\', \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': "Quand vous l\'entendez, c\'est qu\'il est trop tard.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390730&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a0dbefe-26d0-444c-9a7b-6a2201fa476e\', \'multiverseId\': 390730}, \'multiverseid\': 390730}, {\'name\': \'Baloth Zampatonante\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nTenente — Fintanto che controlli il tuo comandante, il Baloth Zampatonante prende +2/+2 e le altre creature che controlli prendono +2/+2 e hanno travolgere.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Se lo senti arrivare, è troppo tardi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ecca1db-30dc-4fdb-8d43-813ab08a595c\', \'multiverseId\': 391067}, \'multiverseid\': 391067}, {\'name\': \'雷足のベイロス\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n副官 ― あなたがあなたの統率者をコントロールしているかぎり、雷足のベイロスは＋２/＋２の修整を受け、あなたがコントロールする他のクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受けるとともにトランプルを持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'それが聞こえた時は、すでに手遅れだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a15ba30-4ed3-456a-b5c3-88e6a6994ac6\', \'multiverseId\': 391404}, \'multiverseid\': 391404}, {\'name\': \'雷蹄巴洛西\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n副官～只要你操控你的指挥官，雷蹄巴洛西便得+2/+2，且由你操控的其他生物得+2/+2且具有践踏异能。\', \'type\': \'生物～野兽\', \'flavor\': \'等你听到，就已经太迟了。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3c55500-8675-4431-a29d-74f37ee0313e\', \'multiverseId\': 390056}, \'multiverseid\': 390056}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dorf der Flammensippe\', \'text\': \'Sowie das Dorf der Flammensippe ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Elementarwesen-Karte aus deiner Hand offen vorzeigen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt das Dorf der Flammensippe getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {R}.\\n{R}, {T}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390192&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c0eaa61-d245-4574-b9a1-ab951ebac0c9\', \'multiverseId\': 390192}, \'multiverseid\': 390192}, {\'name\': \'Aldea de llameantes\', \'text\': \'En cuanto la Aldea de llameantes entre al campo de batalla, puedes mostrar una carta de Elemental de tu mano. Si no lo haces, la Aldea de llameantes entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {R} a tu reserva de maná.\\n{R}, {T}: La criatura objetivo gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2f0c4e9-2757-48d4-bf64-5ee2352c1ff8\', \'multiverseId\': 391540}, \'multiverseid\': 391540}, {\'name\': \'Village sangpyre\', \'text\': "Au moment où le Village sangpyre arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez révéler une carte d\'élémental de votre main. Si vous ne le faites pas, le Village sangpyre arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} à votre réserve.\\n{R}, {T} : La créature ciblée acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390529&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'782a86b2-230d-44bd-85e3-f35ecdab6e19\', \'multiverseId\': 390529}, \'multiverseid\': 390529}, {\'name\': \'Villaggio degli Igniferi\', \'text\': \'Mentre il Villaggio degli Igniferi entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi rivelare una carta Elementale dalla tua mano. Se non lo fai, il Villaggio degli Igniferi entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} alla tua riserva di mana.\\n{R}, {T}: Una creatura bersaglio ha rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390866&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b638af1-e0ef-4b86-b7ed-5d6727675e2f\', \'multiverseId\': 390866}, \'multiverseid\': 390866}, {\'name\': \'炎族の村\', \'text\': \'炎族の村が戦場に出るに際し、あなたは自分の手札からエレメンタル・カードを１枚公開してもよい。そうしないなら、炎族の村はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{R}を加える。\\n{R}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34d0d0cb-3029-410d-aba2-ff6cbb8a4e68\', \'multiverseId\': 391203}, \'multiverseid\': 391203}, {\'name\': \'炎身村落\', \'text\': \'于炎身村落进战场时，你可以从你手上展示一张元素牌。如果你未如此作，则炎身村落须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{R}到你的法术力池中。\\n{R}，{T}：目标生物获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389855&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09f34017-a649-48e4-ad25-1a527702c9dc\', \'multiverseId\': 389855}, \'multiverseid\': 389855}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dornenforst-Bogenschütze\', \'text\': \'Reichweite (Diese Kreatur kann fliegende Kreaturen blocken.)\\nTodesberührung (Eine beliebige Menge Schadenspunkte, die sie einer Kreatur zufügt, sind ausreichend, um diese zu zerstören.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Bogenschütze\', \'flavor\': \'Ihre Pfeilspitzen sind aus Basiliskenaugen und die Schäfte mit Cocatriskenfedern gefiedert.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390391&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e861027-1cef-433d-8307-a639bf11bbdd\', \'multiverseId\': 390391}, \'multiverseid\': 390391}, {\'name\': \'Arquero de Arboleda espinosa\', \'text\': \'Alcance. (Esta criatura puede bloquear a criaturas con la habilidad de volar.)\\nToque mortal. (Cualquier cantidad de daño que esta carta haga a una criatura es suficiente para destruirla.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arquero elfo\', \'flavor\': \'Sus flechas están adornadas con ojos de basilisco y plumas de cocatriz.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391739&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2cf708a-fe36-40c0-adfa-fed7ed132e79\', \'multiverseId\': 391739}, \'multiverseid\': 391739}, {\'name\': \'Archer de Sylvépine\', \'text\': "Portée (Cette créature peut bloquer les créatures avec le vol.)\\nContact mortel (Le nombre de blessures que cette créature inflige à une créature, quel qu\'il soit, est suffisant pour la détruire.)", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et archer\', \'flavor\': "Leurs flèches ont été trempées dans l\'humeur aqueuse des yeux de basilic et empennées avec des plumes de cocatrix.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390728&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39487632-1896-404a-95d2-701258ca3643\', \'multiverseId\': 390728}, \'multiverseid\': 390728}, {\'name\': \'Arciere della Foresta Spinata\', \'text\': \'Raggiungere (Questa creatura può bloccare le creature con volare.)\\nTocco letale (Qualsiasi danno che questa creatura infligge a una creatura è sufficiente a distruggerla.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Arciere Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'Le punte delle loro frecce sono occhi di basilisco e le alette piume di coccatrice.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd588698-9c90-4817-9990-26fb704db574\', \'multiverseId\': 391065}, \'multiverseid\': 391065}, {\'name\': \'ソーンウィールドの射手\', \'text\': \'到達（このクリーチャーは飛行を持つクリーチャーをブロックできる。）\\n接死（これが何らかのダメージをクリーチャーに与えたら、それだけで破壊する。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・射手\', \'flavor\': \'彼らの鏃にはバジリスクの眼が、矢羽にはコカトリスの翼が用いられている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88b5e864-3858-4ef5-b091-47d6837f0710\', \'multiverseId\': 391402}, \'multiverseid\': 391402}, {\'name\': \'荆林箭手\', \'text\': \'延势（此生物能阻挡具飞行异能的生物。）\\n死触（它对生物造成的任何数量伤害都足以消灭后者。）\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／弓箭手\', \'flavor\': \'他们以蜥怪眼作箭尖，石化鸡蛇之羽为翎。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390054&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad47ffb3-11cf-439f-91aa-5dd80e772684\', \'multiverseId\': 390054}, \'multiverseid\': 390054}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dornenwolfelementar\', \'text\': \'Multibonus {G} (Du kannst zusätzlich beliebig oft {G} bezahlen, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst.)\\nWenn das Dornenwolfelementar ins Spiel kommt, bringe für jedes Mal, dass seine Bonuskosten bezahlt wurden, einen 2/2 grünen Wolf-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390424&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85eac4e0-9ec6-403b-be53-8e8f42543885\', \'multiverseId\': 390424}, \'multiverseid\': 390424}, {\'name\': \'Elemental lobo de brezo\', \'text\': \'Multiestímulo {G}. (Puedes pagar {G} adicional tantas veces como quieras al lanzar este hechizo.)\\nCuando el Elemental lobo de brezo entre al campo de batalla, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Lobo verde 2/2 por cada vez que fue estimulado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd3134b1-efdd-4f91-8052-ad543cd61b46\', \'multiverseId\': 391772}, \'multiverseid\': 391772}, {\'name\': \'Élémental de bruyère au loup\', \'text\': "Multikick {G} (Vous pouvez payer {G} supplémentaire autant de fois que vous le souhaitez au moment où vous lancez ce sort.)\\nQuand l\'Élémental de bruyère au loup arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 2/2 verte Loup pour chaque fois qu\'il a été kické.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390761&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f33b67d7-3246-4e60-afa3-26d24441a279\', \'multiverseId\': 390761}, \'multiverseid\': 390761}, {\'name\': \'Elementale Rovo dei Lupi\', \'text\': "Multipotenziamento {G} (Puoi pagare {G} addizionale un qualsiasi numero di volte mentre lanci questa magia.)\\nQuando l\'Elementale Rovo dei Lupi entra nel campo di battaglia, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Lupo 2/2 verde per ogni volta che è stato potenziato.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad2928ed-88cc-4458-a0f0-4d1e7f186ec6\', \'multiverseId\': 391098}, \'multiverseid\': 391098}, {\'name\': \'狼茨の精霊\', \'text\': \'多重キッカー{G}（あなたはこの呪文を唱えるに際し、追加で{G}を望む回数支払ってもよい。）\\n狼茨の精霊が戦場に出たとき、これがキッカーされた１回につき、緑の２/２の狼・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c5043b4-4358-4590-a9c6-9eadc3fdc4b3\', \'multiverseId\': 391435}, \'multiverseid\': 391435}, {\'name\': \'狼荆元素\', \'text\': \'多重增幅{G}（你施放此咒语时可以任意次数地额外支付{G}。）\\n当狼荆元素进战场时，它每增幅过一次，便将一个2/2绿色的狼衍生生物放进战场。\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66df5732-70ad-4762-b472-e9dad5ef86e9\', \'multiverseId\': 390087}, \'multiverseid\': 390087}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drana, Bluthäuptling der Kalastria\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{X}{B}{B}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -0/-X bis zum Ende des Zuges, und Drana, Bluthäuptling der Kalastria, erhält +X/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Vampir, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Falls unsere ehemaligen Meister uns wieder zwingen wollen, vor ihnen zu knien, werden wir ihnen unseren Widerstand in ihre Membranen einritzen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390164&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bdcef66-8886-4bd8-b876-37403736d1f6\', \'multiverseId\': 390164}, \'multiverseid\': 390164}, {\'name\': \'Drana, jefe de sangre Kalastria\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{X}{B}{B}: La criatura objetivo obtiene -0/-X hasta el final del turno y Drana, jefe de sangre Kalastria obtiene +X/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Chamán vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Si nuestros antiguos amos quieren que nos arrodillemos nuevamente, sentirán nuestro desafío clavado en sus membranas."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75268930-5cb6-4200-8a34-6d584bfb3b21\', \'multiverseId\': 391512}, \'multiverseid\': 391512}, {\'name\': \'Drana, chef de sang des Kalastria\', \'text\': "Vol\\n{X}{B}{B} : La créature ciblée gagne -0/-X jusqu\'à la fin du tour et Drana, chef de sang des Kalastria gagne +X/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : vampire et shamane\', \'flavor\': "« Si nos anciens maîtres veulent nous voir à nouveau prosternés à leurs pieds, c\'est notre défiance qu\'ils verront déchirer leurs membranes. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390501&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aadf5ae6-99ff-432f-92f7-b04781a08e3e\', \'multiverseId\': 390501}, \'multiverseid\': 390501}, {\'name\': \'Drana, Capo Sanguinario Kalastria\', \'text\': \'Volare\\n{X}{B}{B}: Una creatura bersaglio prende -0/-X fino alla fine del turno e Drana, Capo Sanguinario Kalastria prende +X/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Sciamano Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Se i nostri precedenti padroni ci faranno inginocchiare di nuovo, sentiranno il nostro disprezzo fustigare le loro membrane."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390838&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55b87c48-2382-4614-a48c-6cfe531ae90e\', \'multiverseId\': 390838}, \'multiverseid\': 390838}, {\'name\': \'カラストリアの血の長、ドラーナ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{X}{B}{B}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－０/－Ｘの修整を受ける。ターン終了時まで、カラストリアの血の長、ドラーナは＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 吸血鬼・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「かつての我らの支配者が我らを再びひざまずかせようとするなら、我らの反逆の傷をその皮膚に感じることになるだろう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a3c80ff-0e77-438a-89ba-328f40abb0b4\', \'multiverseId\': 391175}, \'multiverseid\': 391175}, {\'name\': \'卡列奇血侯哲娜\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{X}{B}{B}：目标生物得-0/-X直到回合结束，且卡列奇血侯哲娜得+X/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～吸血鬼／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「如果过去的主人要我们再度降服，就让他们尝尝被反抗力刺透的滋味。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cc9e600-41e9-493e-8bf6-c01d6e84a7a8\', \'multiverseId\': 389827}, \'multiverseid\': 389827}]', "[{'name': 'Dschungelbecken', 'text': 'Das Dschungelbecken kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Dschungelbecken ins Spiel kommt, opfere es, falls du nicht einen ungetappten Wald, den du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurückbringst.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}{G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390244&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0400f0c9-9d0b-4671-ae51-abed1e81c09e', 'multiverseId': 390244}, 'multiverseid': 390244}, {'name': 'Cuenca selvática', 'text': 'La Cuenca selvática entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Cuenca selvática entre al campo de batalla, sacrifícala a menos que regreses un bosque enderezado que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {1}{G} a tu reserva de maná.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391592&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6b836bc7-ef30-41a4-9e8e-487b33167776', 'multiverseId': 391592}, 'multiverseid': 391592}, {'name': 'Jungle épaisse', 'text': 'La Jungle épaisse arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Jungle épaisse arrive sur le champ de bataille, sacrifiez-la à moins de renvoyer une forêt dégagée que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {1}{G} à votre réserve.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390581&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6c62bd94-f956-4812-909d-9e08340f92bb', 'multiverseId': 390581}, 'multiverseid': 390581}, {'name': 'Bacino di Giungla', 'text': 'Il Bacino di Giungla entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Bacino di Giungla entra nel campo di battaglia, sacrificalo a meno che tu non faccia tornare una Foresta STAPpata che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {1}{G} alla tua riserva di mana.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390918&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82cc5a94-3b1b-423e-9661-7b5ebc390c6c', 'multiverseId': 390918}, 'multiverseid': 390918}, {'name': 'ジャングルの盆地', 'text': 'ジャングルの盆地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nジャングルの盆地が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールするアンタップ状態の森１つをオーナーの手札に戻さないかぎり、これを生け贄に捧げる。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391255&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1bc13eb8-6739-4510-a2c6-62b81355d677', 'multiverseId': 391255}, 'multiverseid': 391255}, {'name': '丛林水潭', 'text': '丛林水潭须横置进战场。\\n当丛林水潭进战场时，除非你将一个由你操控且未横置的树林移回其拥有者手上，否则牺牲之。\\n{T}：加{1}{G}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389907&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '773f6d9b-8fa8-4beb-aff0-4bb42374f582', 'multiverseId': 389907}, 'multiverseid': 389907}]", '[{\'name\': \'Dämon der unsäglichen Pein\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nLeutnant — Solange du deinen Kommandeur kontrollierst, erhält der Dämon der unsäglichen Pein +2/+2 und hat „Immer wenn der Dämon der unsäglichen Pein einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, opfert dieser Spieler eine Kreatur."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390156&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b74eb6a-490e-4182-90e2-558a3d476a1a\', \'multiverseId\': 390156}, \'multiverseid\': 390156}, {\'name\': \'Demonio de las agonías quejumbrosas\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nTeniente — Mientras controles a tu comandante, el Demonio de las agonías quejumbrosas obtiene +2/+2 y tiene "Siempre que el Demonio de las agonías quejumbrosas haga daño de combate a un jugador, ese jugador sacrifica una criatura".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391504&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5696b7fe-5016-45c3-a65d-759dee1d60c1\', \'multiverseId\': 391504}, \'multiverseid\': 391504}, {\'name\': "Démon des cris d\'agonie", \'text\': "Vol\\nLieutenant — Tant que vous contrôlez votre commandant, le Démon des cris d\'agonie gagne +2/+2 et a « À chaque fois que le Démon des cris d\'agonie inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, ce joueur sacrifie une créature. »", \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390493&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e3b889c-a567-4446-a325-9c3c6665c8d9\', \'multiverseId\': 390493}, \'multiverseid\': 390493}, {\'name\': \'Demone dei Lamenti Agonizzanti\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nTenente — Fintanto che controlli il tuo comandante, il Demone dei Lamenti Agonizzanti prende +2/+2 e ha "Ogniqualvolta il Demone dei Lamenti Agonizzanti infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, quel giocatore sacrifica una creatura".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390830&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f231b54-7be6-4516-a6b1-2ba29a6d3ab4\', \'multiverseId\': 390830}, \'multiverseid\': 390830}, {\'name\': \'苦悶嘆きの悪魔\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n副官 ― あなたがあなたの統率者をコントロールしているかぎり、苦悶嘆きの悪魔は＋２/＋２の修整を受けるとともに「苦悶嘆きの悪魔がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーはクリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75be1cfc-1489-4dea-b631-c26211f6052f\', \'multiverseId\': 391167}, \'multiverseid\': 391167}, {\'name\': \'悲嚎恶魔\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n副官～只要你操控你的指挥官，悲嚎恶魔便得+2/+2且具有「每当悲嚎恶魔对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，该牌手牺牲一个生物。」\', \'type\': \'生物～恶魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389819&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'473817de-7fa6-47bd-98c3-4a008d4a89af\', \'multiverseId\': 389819}, \'multiverseid\': 389819}]', "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390307&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '63767f03-ca1d-4f05-83e9-793614a5473a', 'multiverseId': 390307}, 'multiverseid': 390307}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391655&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ca321ed3-784c-4167-b95d-56b729ca8ec4', 'multiverseId': 391655}, 'multiverseid': 391655}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390644&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eb8167b1-ad00-4b12-83c0-198861ff4c19', 'multiverseId': 390644}, 'multiverseid': 390644}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390981&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ebdf74e0-b6bb-4e2a-84b3-44a865b6f746', 'multiverseId': 390981}, 'multiverseid': 390981}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391318&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7dc4fbcf-4e63-4bf8-8657-1392cb90a0ea', 'multiverseId': 391318}, 'multiverseid': 391318}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389970&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1dfa7910-056d-44de-a3be-dcacc4595531', 'multiverseId': 389970}, 'multiverseid': 389970}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390308&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3b7cfcec-9fb2-433c-9794-52f0aea1a160', 'multiverseId': 390308}, 'multiverseid': 390308}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391656&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '955afc33-52eb-487f-8b33-f1ae563676fe', 'multiverseId': 391656}, 'multiverseid': 391656}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390645&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd2a121c6-e53a-474d-b0bc-0188a6d5166e', 'multiverseId': 390645}, 'multiverseid': 390645}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390982&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b3cd5b5a-2efe-427e-969f-059fbf777103', 'multiverseId': 390982}, 'multiverseid': 390982}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391319&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cc8b0f6c-70c4-43c6-b3a9-01305d2024af', 'multiverseId': 391319}, 'multiverseid': 391319}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389971&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '220ee925-2aa1-4116-a849-fe4892744667', 'multiverseId': 389971}, 'multiverseid': 389971}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390309&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4831740c-d46c-43f2-8765-71b5c037f0cb', 'multiverseId': 390309}, 'multiverseid': 390309}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391657&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e7880f10-17f6-4d70-94e9-49ba1e21325d', 'multiverseId': 391657}, 'multiverseid': 391657}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390646&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0e7d5bdc-e18b-4dc8-a43e-1d83a80865eb', 'multiverseId': 390646}, 'multiverseid': 390646}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390983&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '151333bc-662f-4640-af7a-67d9aa092d16', 'multiverseId': 390983}, 'multiverseid': 390983}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391320&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '03d286f0-ad2a-4d65-bcd2-2e3d77bfe70f', 'multiverseId': 391320}, 'multiverseid': 391320}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389972&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1c622b01-c3f9-4bab-967e-7901d9c3bc49', 'multiverseId': 389972}, 'multiverseid': 389972}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390310&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f2074c41-dfb9-4d3f-bf67-0121d2f5f833', 'multiverseId': 390310}, 'multiverseid': 390310}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391658&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f8d17f71-765d-4e4b-8eb5-db4412a4d5c1', 'multiverseId': 391658}, 'multiverseid': 391658}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390647&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '665b299b-830c-4044-8414-82399b776e4e', 'multiverseId': 390647}, 'multiverseid': 390647}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390984&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b768420f-1d30-484f-9ef4-4bc96be1cb4c', 'multiverseId': 390984}, 'multiverseid': 390984}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391321&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f76c883d-aa97-446f-8218-599db617699a', 'multiverseId': 391321}, 'multiverseid': 391321}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389973&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '79169a49-d199-434f-9c2f-6649cb8efb08', 'multiverseId': 389973}, 'multiverseid': 389973}]", '[{\'name\': \'Eingesperrte Sonne\', \'text\': \'Sowie die Eingesperrte Sonne ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eine Farbe.\\nKreaturen der bestimmten Farbe, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\nImmer wenn eine Fähigkeit eines Landes deinen Manavorrat um ein oder mehr Mana der bestimmten Farbe erhöht, erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um ein zusätzliches Mana dieser Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390131&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'140d38d3-75e3-4e6b-9305-255b10c23556\', \'multiverseId\': 390131}, \'multiverseid\': 390131}, {\'name\': \'Sol enjaulado\', \'text\': \'En cuanto el Sol enjaulado entre al campo de batalla, elige un color.\\nLas criaturas que controlas del color elegido obtienen +1/+1.\\nSiempre que la habilidad de una tierra agregue uno o más manás del color elegido a tu reserva de maná, agrega un maná adicional de ese color a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391479&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4d99af7-feda-4fe7-9500-d7d373fd20e9\', \'multiverseId\': 391479}, \'multiverseid\': 391479}, {\'name\': \'Soleil emprisonné\', \'text\': "Au moment où le Soleil emprisonné arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez une couleur.\\nLes créatures que vous contrôlez de la couleur choisie gagnent +1/+1.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une capacité d\'un terrain ajoute au moins un mana de la couleur choisie à votre réserve, ajoutez un mana supplémentaire de cette couleur à votre réserve.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390468&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b825cf31-18ef-45a3-a901-43524ae0e8c4\', \'multiverseId\': 390468}, \'multiverseid\': 390468}, {\'name\': \'Sole Ingabbiato\', \'text\': "Mentre il Sole Ingabbiato entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un colore.\\nLe creature che controlli del colore scelto prendono +1/+1.\\nOgniqualvolta un\'abilità di una terra aggiunge uno o più mana del colore scelto alla tua riserva di mana, aggiungi un mana addizionale di quel colore alla tua riserva di mana.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390805&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6969daf-45b6-4440-89ca-6e6ebf2207d0\', \'multiverseId\': 390805}, \'multiverseid\': 390805}, {\'name\': \'かごの中の太陽\', \'text\': \'かごの中の太陽が戦場に出るに際し、色を１色選ぶ。\\nあなたがコントロールするその選ばれた色のクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n土地の能力によりあなたのマナ・プールにその選ばれた色のマナが１点以上加えられるたび、あなたのマナ・プールにその色のマナを追加で１点加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5447980e-0920-462d-9a0c-2b7d8535ff41\', \'multiverseId\': 391142}, \'multiverseid\': 391142}, {\'name\': \'遭囚太阳\', \'text\': \'于遭囚太阳进战场时，选择一种颜色。\\n由你操控的该色生物得+1/+1。\\n每当一个地的异能加一点或更多该色的法术力到你的法术力池时，多加一点该色的法术力到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8815274-c3f9-44c8-aad4-eddff7e570d0\', \'multiverseId\': 389794}, \'multiverseid\': 389794}]', '[{\'name\': \'Einhaltgebietende Priesterin\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nFalls eine Nichtspielsteinkreatur ins Spiel kommen würde und sie nicht gewirkt wurde, schicke sie stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'Mancher Schutz bedarf etwas Geschick.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390144&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffbb92fa-3e75-4f77-9a64-d1e3ac8dcb49\', \'multiverseId\': 390144}, \'multiverseid\': 390144}, {\'name\': \'Sacerdotisa de la mesura\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nSi una criatura que no sea ficha fuera a entrar al campo de batalla y no fue lanzada, en vez de eso, exíliala.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'Cierta clase de protección requiere algo de sutileza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44575aa2-78a9-42da-9204-93cec34d6d84\', \'multiverseId\': 391492}, \'multiverseid\': 391492}, {\'name\': \'Prêtresse du confinement\', \'text\': "Flash\\nSi une créature non-jeton devait arriver sur le champ de bataille et qu\'elle n\'a pas été lancée, exilez-la à la place.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': \'Certaines protections nécessitent un brin de finesse.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390481&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36ff6681-f6ba-4f6d-93d1-659874191f8e\', \'multiverseId\': 390481}, \'multiverseid\': 390481}, {\'name\': \'Sacerdotessa del Contenimento\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nSe una creatura non pedina sta per entrare nel campo di battaglia e non è stata lanciata, invece esiliala.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Alcune protezioni richiedono una certa dose di tatto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41ad0824-f922-40c4-98a4-5f41bd4ee2e7\', \'multiverseId\': 390818}, \'multiverseid\': 390818}, {\'name\': \'封じ込める僧侶\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\nトークンでないクリーチャーが唱えられずに戦場に出るなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'防御によっては、多少技巧が必要となることもあります。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad83b41c-8c29-42c2-9dff-569e405b2f9c\', \'multiverseId\': 391155}, \'multiverseid\': 391155}, {\'name\': \'围护僧侣\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n如果某非衍生物的生物将进战场，且未有牌手施放之，则改为将它放逐。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'有些保护需要无微不至。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39428300-0f67-46ae-a231-f6945b10e1ec\', \'multiverseId\': 389807}, \'multiverseid\': 389807}]', "[{'name': 'Einsame Sandbank', 'text': 'Die Einsame Sandbank kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {U}.\\nUmwandlung {U} ({U}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390254&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '99f7630f-f03c-476c-b8a5-61f4b836a56f', 'multiverseId': 390254}, 'multiverseid': 390254}, {'name': 'Banco de arena solitario', 'text': 'El Banco de arena solitario entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} a tu reserva de maná.\\nCiclo {U}. ({U}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391602&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e503d0ea-e6a8-4f87-8f6e-54968756d0d8', 'multiverseId': 391602}, 'multiverseid': 391602}, {'name': 'Banc de sable isolé', 'text': 'Le Banc de sable isolé arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} à votre réserve.\\nRecyclage {U} ({U}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390591&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '426cb800-b79b-41b2-89d6-ed82000cac68', 'multiverseId': 390591}, 'multiverseid': 390591}, {'name': 'Secca Solitaria', 'text': 'La Secca Solitaria entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} alla tua riserva di mana.\\nCiclo {U} ({U}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390928&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9b1f4869-401d-4f64-a1af-be7445a96f87', 'multiverseId': 390928}, 'multiverseid': 390928}, {'name': '孤立した砂州', 'text': '孤立した砂州はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{U}を加える。\\nサイクリング{U}（{U}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391265&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '09b905c0-eb99-46df-9650-8c3392bfc8ff', 'multiverseId': 391265}, 'multiverseid': 391265}, {'name': '孤绝沙洲', 'text': '孤绝沙洲须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{U}到你的法术力池中。\\n循环{U}（{U}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389917&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f7c84481-6749-451a-a14a-0e7d6e8dd8fe', 'multiverseId': 389917}, 'multiverseid': 389917}]", "[{'name': 'Einsichtiger Seher', 'text': 'Morph — Bringe zwei Inseln, die du kontrollierst, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück. (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur wirken. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)\\nWenn der Einsichtige Seher aufgedeckt wird, ziehe zwei Karten.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Illusion', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390188&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a3c75e49-b4f8-40de-a8b0-a81757f1a93b', 'multiverseId': 390188}, 'multiverseid': 390188}, {'name': 'Vidente profundizador', 'text': 'Metamorfosis—Regresa dos islas que controlas a la mano de su propietario. (Puedes lanzar esta carta boca abajo como una criatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento pagando su coste de metamorfosis.)\\nCuando el Vidente profundizador se ponga boca arriba, roba dos cartas.', 'type': 'Criatura — Ilusión', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391536&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '641b402c-0fb0-4994-834c-fffd539668b3', 'multiverseId': 391536}, 'multiverseid': 391536}, {'name': 'Voyante des fonds marins', 'text': 'Mue — Renvoyez deux îles que vous contrôlez dans la main de leur propriétaire. (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la à tout moment pour son coût de mue.)\\nQuand la Voyante des fonds marins est retournée face visible, piochez deux cartes.', 'type': 'Créature : illusion', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390525&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0ae0c937-ce57-4198-826b-b63434a1123e', 'multiverseId': 390525}, 'multiverseid': 390525}, {'name': 'Veggente delle Profondità', 'text': 'Metamorfosi—Fai tornare due Isole che controlli in mano ai rispettivi proprietari. (Puoi lanciare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)\\nQuando il Veggente delle Profondità viene girato a faccia in su, pesca due carte.', 'type': 'Creatura — Illusione', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390862&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cd95f83d-9e6b-45ee-b16b-df549c5fcd60', 'multiverseId': 390862}, 'multiverseid': 390862}, {'name': '水深の予見者', 'text': '変異 ― あなたがコントロールする島を２つオーナーの手札に戻す。（あなたはこのカードを、{3}で２/２クリーチャーとして裏向きに唱えてもよい。これの変異コストで、これをいつでも表向きにしてよい。）\\n水深の予見者が表向きになったとき、カードを２枚引く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — イリュージョン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391199&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bb36b327-77a2-478e-8ba6-25eda5c19ea3', 'multiverseId': 391199}, 'multiverseid': 391199}, {'name': '深测预言师', 'text': '变身～将两个由你操控的海岛移回其拥有者手上。（你可牌面朝下地施放此牌并支付{3}，将其当成2/2生物。可随时支付其变身费用使其翻回正面。）\\n当深测预言师翻回正面时，抓两张牌。', 'type': '生物～虚影', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389851&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '742f42d9-9f83-472f-8629-b683ba2d3a1d', 'multiverseId': 389851}, 'multiverseid': 389851}]", "[{'name': 'Elfen-Himmelfeger', 'text': '{4}{G}, opfere eine Kreatur: Zerstöre eine fliegende Kreatur deiner Wahl.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Elf, Krieger', 'flavor': 'Die Turmspitzen von Ravnica unterscheiden sich kaum von den hohen Bäumen anderer Welten. Die Elfen kümmern sich genauso um sie.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390174&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3f4d963b-3daf-4f24-be31-aba7b765edbc', 'multiverseId': 390174}, 'multiverseid': 390174}, {'name': 'Barrecielos élfico', 'text': '{4}{G}, sacrificar una criatura: Destruye la criatura objetivo con la habilidad de volar.', 'type': 'Criatura — Guerrero elfo', 'flavor': 'Las torres de Rávnica no son distintas de los altos árboles de otros planos. Los elfos se mueven por ellas y las protegen del mismo modo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391522&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7db52ce0-3ae9-441b-b820-f96394bb33c6', 'multiverseId': 391522}, 'multiverseid': 391522}, {'name': 'Fouilleciel elfe', 'text': '{4}{G}, sacrifiez une créature : Détruisez la créature avec le vol ciblée.', 'type': 'Créature : elfe et guerrier', 'flavor': 'Les tours de Ravnica ne sont guère différentes des grands arbres des autres plans. Les elfes les escaladent et les protègent tout autant.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390511&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b7724778-eb4f-4826-8f5b-0b5f39ca9e37', 'multiverseId': 390511}, 'multiverseid': 390511}, {'name': 'Spazzacielo Elfico', 'text': '{4}{G}, Sacrifica una creatura: Distruggi una creatura bersaglio con volare.', 'type': 'Creatura — Guerriero Elfo', 'flavor': 'Le spire di Ravnica non sono poi diverse dagli alti alberi degli altri piani. Gli elfi le attraversano e le proteggono allo stesso modo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390848&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '33f1d666-ef42-4069-805a-519daa808237', 'multiverseId': 390848}, 'multiverseid': 390848}, {'name': 'エルフの空掃き', 'text': '{4}{G}, クリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる：飛行を持つクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エルフ・戦士', 'flavor': 'ラヴニカの尖塔は他の次元の高い樹となんら変わりはない。それをエルフが操り、守ることすら同じだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391185&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aa3a0a8c-cf3c-4dfc-a082-e6c451ecdf5b', 'multiverseId': 391185}, 'multiverseid': 391185}, {'name': '荡空妖精', 'text': '{4}{G}，牺牲一个生物：消灭目标具飞行异能的生物。', 'type': '生物～妖精／战士', 'flavor': '拉尼卡的高塔就如其他时空的高大树木一般，需要妖精来引导与照护。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389837&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b301b99f-3eaf-4eca-a44b-a32fbde4b908', 'multiverseId': 389837}, 'multiverseid': 389837}]", '[{\'name\': \'Elfen-Mystiker\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {G}.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Leben wächst überall. Mein Volk findet nur die Stellen, an denen es am stärksten wächst." —Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390173&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f920e01-6d97-47df-a056-bbd70bcaae26\', \'multiverseId\': 390173}, \'multiverseid\': 390173}, {\'name\': \'Místico élfico\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {G} a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"La vida crece en todas partes. Mi gente solamente encuentra aquellos lugares en los que crece con más fuerza". —Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ac0dd4a-e219-494c-b8f4-0f98c8918986\', \'multiverseId\': 391521}, \'multiverseid\': 391521}, {\'name\': \'Mystique elfe\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {G} à votre réserve.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': \'« La vie est partout. Mes congénères ont simplement le don de trouver les endroits où elle prospère le plus. » —Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390510&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cde7346b-1f8d-48e9-9982-c520667db54b\', \'multiverseId\': 390510}, \'multiverseid\': 390510}, {\'name\': \'Elfo Mistico\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {G} alla tua riserva di mana.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"La vita cresce ovunque. La mia gente si limita a trovare i luoghi dove cresce più forte." —Nissa Revane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390847&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f975c5b9-f28c-4774-82f2-51ac7ee8ac6a\', \'multiverseId\': 390847}, \'multiverseid\': 390847}, {\'name\': \'エルフの神秘家\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{G}を加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「生命はどこにでも栄える。私の一族はただそれが最も力強く育つ場所を見つけるだけよ。」 ――ニッサ・レヴェイン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cf7807e-0589-4795-8ba2-2d3ffc164263\', \'multiverseId\': 391184}, \'multiverseid\': 391184}, {\'name\': \'妖精秘教徒\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{G}到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「生命在各处成长。我的族人只是在寻找成长最旺的地方。」 ～妮莎瑞文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389836&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66a3050b-3b98-4d97-8406-c604f575eb72\', \'multiverseId\': 389836}, \'multiverseid\': 389836}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elfenschar\', \'text\': \'Fluchsicher\\nStärke und Widerstandskraft der Elfenschar sind gleich der Anzahl an grünen bleibenden Karten, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Licht der Schönheit beschützt unseren Weg durch die Dunkelheit."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390169&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cd89f76-9277-4b2c-ae06-771229642a8c\', \'multiverseId\': 390169}, \'multiverseid\': 390169}, {\'name\': \'Gentío de elfos\', \'text\': \'Antimaleficio.\\nTanto la fuerza como la resistencia del Gentío de elfos son iguales a la cantidad de permanentes verdes que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"La luz de la belleza protege nuestros viajes en la oscuridad".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391517&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d05fc10-b7e3-439c-9275-b435c6c6f9bd\', \'multiverseId\': 391517}, \'multiverseid\': 391517}, {\'name\': "Troupe d\'elfes", \'text\': "Défense talismanique\\nLa force et l\'endurance de la Troupe d\'elfes sont chacune égales au nombre de permanents verts que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe\', \'flavor\': \'« La lumière de la beauté protègent nos voyages dans les ténèbres. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390506&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08e8cb06-e0cc-495c-b7b2-d5477c9d8b4e\', \'multiverseId\': 390506}, \'multiverseid\': 390506}, {\'name\': \'Folla di Elfi\', \'text\': \'Anti-malocchio\\nLa forza e la costituzione della Folla di Elfi sono pari al numero di permanenti verdi che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"La luce della bellezza protegge il nostro viaggio attraverso l\\\'oscurità."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e92dee49-9bd4-46cb-b5bd-272900edd58c\', \'multiverseId\': 390843}, \'multiverseid\': 390843}, {\'name\': \'エルフの集団\', \'text\': \'呪禁\\nエルフの集団のパワーとタフネスは、それぞれあなたがコントロールする緑のパーマネントの総数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ\', \'flavor\': \'「美の光は、闇の中を進む私たちを守ってくれます。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df345551-f482-4a24-ace8-102ca9d3789c\', \'multiverseId\': 391180}, \'multiverseid\': 391180}, {\'name\': \'妖精齐群\', \'text\': \'辟邪\\n妖精齐群的力量和防御力各等同于由你操控的绿色永久物之数量。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精\', \'flavor\': \'「美之光芒保佑我们穿越黑暗。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389832&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'568dbb59-4306-4340-bcf0-964dd595490f\', \'multiverseId\': 389832}, \'multiverseid\': 389832}]', "[{'name': 'Elfischer Erzdruide', 'text': 'Andere Elf-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat für jeden Elfen, den du kontrollierst, um {G}.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Elf, Druide', 'flavor': 'Er kennt den Namen jedes Elfen, der in den letzten vier Jahrhunderten geboren wurde. Bedeutender ist, dass alle seinen kennen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390172&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2b9488ac-03eb-4b06-b326-0a04102c778f', 'multiverseId': 390172}, 'multiverseid': 390172}, {'name': 'Archidruida élfico', 'text': 'Las otras criaturas Elfo que controlas obtienen +1/+1.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} a tu reserva de maná por cada Elfo que controlas.', 'type': 'Criatura — Druida elfo', 'flavor': 'Sabe el nombre de todos los elfos nacidos en los últimos cuatro siglos. Más importante aún, todos conocen el suyo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391520&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '713f8268-9a89-4a74-af56-77aa139fe517', 'multiverseId': 391520}, 'multiverseid': 391520}, {'name': 'Archidruide elfe', 'text': 'Les autres créatures Elfe que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} à votre réserve pour chaque elfe que vous contrôlez.', 'type': 'Créature : elfe et druide', 'flavor': 'Il connaît le nom de chaque elfe né durant les quatre derniers siècles. Mais plus important, tous connaissent le sien.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390509&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '045a4cbf-1586-4187-9239-348ece965f88', 'multiverseId': 390509}, 'multiverseid': 390509}, {'name': 'Arcidruido Elfico', 'text': 'Le altre creature Elfo che controlli prendono +1/+1.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} alla tua riserva di mana per ogni Elfo che controlli.', 'type': 'Creatura — Druido Elfo', 'flavor': 'Conosce il nome di tutti gli elfi nati negli ultimi quattro secoli. Ma ancora più importante, loro conoscono il suo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390846&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9a462aa5-8a21-4035-a4af-951c9f713aa8', 'multiverseId': 390846}, 'multiverseid': 390846}, {'name': 'エルフの大ドルイド', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールする他のエルフ・クリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n{T}：あなたがコントロールするエルフ１体につき、あなたのマナ・プールに{G}を加える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド', 'flavor': '彼は、ここ四世紀中に生まれた全てのエルフの名を知っている。そしてさらに重要なのは、その誰もが彼を知っていることだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391183&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1cad9389-d908-4dd4-a83f-75fb8920d6e3', 'multiverseId': 391183}, 'multiverseid': 391183}, {'name': '妖精高位德鲁伊', 'text': '由你操控的其他妖精生物得+1/+1。\\n{T}：你每操控一个妖精，便加{G}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '生物～妖精／德鲁伊', 'flavor': '他能说出在过去四个世纪中诞生的每个妖精名字。更重要的是，他们全都认识他。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389835&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1bf635c3-98aa-4ac4-9f4a-def69c412dba', 'multiverseId': 389835}, 'multiverseid': 389835}]", '[{\'name\': \'Elfischer Visionär\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Elfische Visionär ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Aus dem kleinsten Setzling sprießen und erblühen die größten Bäume. Mögen die Samen deines Geistes ebenso fruchtbar sein."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390175&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52bd46ef-06bc-44ef-993e-a0821a534aa1\', \'multiverseId\': 390175}, \'multiverseid\': 390175}, {\'name\': \'Visionaria élfica\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Visionaria élfica entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"A partir de un brote diminuto crecen y florecen los árboles más grandes. Que las semillas de tu mente sean igual de fructíferas."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ee10d99-b1ae-40a7-b71a-60f34cfc2005\', \'multiverseId\': 391523}, \'multiverseid\': 391523}, {\'name\': \'Visionnaire elfe\', \'text\': \'Quand la Visionnaire elfe arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et shamane\', \'flavor\': "« D\'une graine minuscule peut naître un arbre immense et florissant. Puissent les graines de ton esprit être aussi prolifiques. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390512&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9a8d631-6a01-4c56-8027-7e770f8c5b80\', \'multiverseId\': 390512}, \'multiverseid\': 390512}, {\'name\': \'Elfa Visionaria\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Elfa Visionaria entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Da un piccolo germoglio, crescono e fioriscono gli alberi più grandi. Possano i semi della tua mente rivelarsi fertili in egual misura."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16bde80e-7c3c-4ef1-bc1a-47daee7839c1\', \'multiverseId\': 390849}, \'multiverseid\': 390849}, {\'name\': \'エルフの幻想家\', \'text\': \'エルフの幻想家が戦場に出たとき、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「この上なく立派な木々も、小さな芽から成長し、生い繁ります。あなたの精神が宿す種も等しく実りますように。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aba133dc-7530-498b-a380-490a20268b6b\', \'multiverseId\': 391186}, \'multiverseid\': 391186}, {\'name\': \'妖精幻视师\', \'text\': \'当妖精幻视师进战场时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「最大的树木也是从一颗小芽开始生长茂盛。愿你心中的种子也如这般硕果累累。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389838&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7f42f7e-8072-4dd4-a3a9-47c251dae760\', \'multiverseId\': 389838}, \'multiverseid\': 389838}]', '[{\'name\': \'Emeria, die Himmelsruine\', \'text\': \'Emeria, die Himmelsruine, kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nFalls du zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments sieben oder mehr Ebenen kontrollierst, kannst du eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurückbringen.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {W}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390177&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74bae857-ee67-4c9f-a46b-9eb5d576fd3d\', \'multiverseId\': 390177}, \'multiverseid\': 390177}, {\'name\': \'Emeria, la Ruina Celeste\', \'text\': \'Emeria, la Ruina Celeste entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si controlas siete o más llanuras, puedes regresar al campo de batalla la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'392340e7-0ea8-48e8-a8d5-abc24ce1327b\', \'multiverseId\': 391525}, \'multiverseid\': 391525}, {\'name\': \'Éméria, la Ruine Céleste\', \'text\': \'Éméria, la Ruine Céleste arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nAu début de votre entretien, si vous contrôlez au moins sept plaines, vous pouvez renvoyer sur le champ de bataille une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} à votre réserve.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390514&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec72493d-5ede-4b11-8325-0074b5f74074\', \'multiverseId\': 390514}, \'multiverseid\': 390514}, {\'name\': \'Emeria, la Rovina del Cielo\', \'text\': "Emeria, la Rovina del Cielo entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se controlli sette o più Pianure, puoi rimettere sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} alla tua riserva di mana.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390851&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d7dac32-6c8d-48dd-87bd-4cb1d8d73b6d\', \'multiverseId\': 390851}, \'multiverseid\': 390851}, {\'name\': \'空の遺跡、エメリア\', \'text\': \'空の遺跡、エメリアはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたが７つ以上の平地をコントロールしている場合、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それを戦場に戻してもよい。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{W}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'670af78c-f1a8-4add-b20f-844392a6d79f\', \'multiverseId\': 391188}, \'multiverseid\': 391188}, {\'name\': \'天空遗迹伊美黎\', \'text\': \'天空遗迹伊美黎须横置进战场。\\n在你的维持开始时，若你操控七个或更多平原，你可以将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\\n{T}：加{W}到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc904bff-9fe8-4251-9140-b3fc095fbae9\', \'multiverseId\': 389840}, \'multiverseid\': 389840}]', '[{\'name\': \'Engel der Stunde der Not\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nFliegend\\nWenn der Engel der Stunde der Not ins Spiel kommt und falls du ihn aus deiner Hand gewirkt hast, schicke alle angreifenden Kreaturen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': \'Sie schlug ein wie ein Meteorit und kein Feind konnte der Druckwelle aus heiliger Rache standhalten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390101&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b6d87ed-0728-4a68-908f-f64fd93bd1c3\', \'multiverseId\': 390101}, \'multiverseid\': 390101}, {\'name\': \'Ángel de la hora funesta\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nVuela.\\nCuando el Ángel de la hora funesta entre al campo de batalla, si lo lanzaste desde tu mano, exilia todas las criaturas atacantes.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': \'Llegó como un meteorito y el enemigo fue arrasado por una onda de venganza sagrada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391449&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9642e754-1b57-44ff-9fd3-e8a3276e9f6d\', \'multiverseId\': 391449}, \'multiverseid\': 391449}, {\'name\': "Ange de l\'heure sinistre", \'text\': "Flash\\nVol\\nQuand l\'Ange de l\'heure sinistre arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous l\'avez lancé depuis votre main, exilez toutes les créatures attaquantes.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': "Elle arriva, telle une météorite, et l\'ennemi tomba sous l\'effet d\'une onde de choc de vengeance sacrée.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390438&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9297627-4556-40e8-a970-a4a488f4e529\', \'multiverseId\': 390438}, \'multiverseid\': 390438}, {\'name\': \'Angelo delle Avversità\', \'text\': "Lampo\\nVolare\\nQuando l\'Angelo delle Avversità entra nel campo di battaglia, se lo hai lanciato dalla tua mano, esilia tutte le creature attaccanti.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': "Giunse come una meteora e i suoi nemici caddero, travolti dall\'onda d\'urto della vendetta divina.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad5a8e2e-15f3-4931-8464-dcdb205c2c22\', \'multiverseId\': 390775}, \'multiverseid\': 390775}, {\'name\': \'凶時の天使\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n飛行\\n凶時の天使が戦場に出たとき、あなたがこれを手札から唱えていた場合、すべての攻撃クリーチャーを追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': \'彼女は流星のように現れ、敵は聖なる復讐の衝撃波の前に倒れた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85498c9a-a1f2-4ba7-a8bc-8560fdf1379c\', \'multiverseId\': 391112}, \'multiverseid\': 391112}, {\'name\': \'厄时天使\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n飞行\\n当厄时天使进战场时，若你从你手上施放之，则放逐所有进行攻击的生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～天使\', \'flavor\': \'她如流星般突现战场，随之降临的复仇圣击将敌人湮没殆尽。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cc4cc67-94c7-4851-9682-c1ae894d6f8b\', \'multiverseId\': 389764}, \'multiverseid\': 389764}]', '[{\'name\': \'Entlegene Insel\', \'text\': \'Die Entlegene Insel kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {U}.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390328&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'744c4427-01d5-49af-872f-f06303a38fe6\', \'multiverseId\': 390328}, \'multiverseid\': 390328}, {\'name\': \'Isla remota\', \'text\': \'La Isla remota entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} a tu reserva de maná.\\nCiclo {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37cf0621-2ccf-443c-bf73-5643f83ea9e4\', \'multiverseId\': 391676}, \'multiverseid\': 391676}, {\'name\': \'Île lointaine\', \'text\': "L\'Île lointaine arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} à votre réserve.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390665&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9187c802-09b4-49a4-b060-b72cb36e633e\', \'multiverseId\': 390665}, \'multiverseid\': 390665}, {\'name\': \'Isola Sperduta\', \'text\': "L\'Isola Sperduta entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} alla tua riserva di mana.\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9a49c77-65e7-44c8-8f4e-e124ce3a6e9d\', \'multiverseId\': 391002}, \'multiverseid\': 391002}, {\'name\': \'離れ島\', \'text\': \'離れ島はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{U}を加える。\\nサイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391339&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb9df01a-1e64-41d5-8cf1-b760d4d35e4b\', \'multiverseId\': 391339}, \'multiverseid\': 391339}, {\'name\': \'离岛\', \'text\': \'离岛须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{U}到你的法术力池中。\\n循环{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8e626b6-a286-40fd-9724-df023407a704\', \'multiverseId\': 389991}, \'multiverseid\': 389991}]', '[{\'name\': \'Epochenparasit\', \'text\': \'Der Epochenparasit kommt mit drei +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel, falls du ihn nicht aus deiner Hand gewirkt hast.\\nWenn der Epochenparasit stirbt, schicke ihn mit drei Zeitmarken ins Exil, und er erhält Aussetzen. (Entferne zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments eine Zeitmarke von ihm. Wenn die letzte Zeitmarke entfernt wird, wirke die Karte, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Sie hat Eile.)\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390178&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fc9597c-e8ab-489b-8680-b582a4bdf785\', \'multiverseId\': 390178}, \'multiverseid\': 390178}, {\'name\': \'Epocrásito\', \'text\': \'El Epocrásito entra al campo de batalla con tres contadores +1/+1 sobre él si no lo lanzaste de tu mano.\\nCuando el Epocrásito muera, exílialo con tres contadores de tiempo sobre él y el Epocrásito gana la habilidad de suspender. (Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, remueve un contador de tiempo. Cuando remuevas el último, lanza esta carta sin pagar su coste de maná. Tiene la habilidad de prisa.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391526&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4d922db-36a4-49a2-a606-91d8978923c9\', \'multiverseId\': 391526}, \'multiverseid\': 391526}, {\'name\': \'Épokrasite\', \'text\': "L\'Épokrasite arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur lui, trois marqueurs +1/+1 si vous ne l\'avez pas lancé depuis votre main.\\nQuand l\'Épokrasite meurt, exilez-le avec, sur lui, trois marqueurs « temps » et il acquiert la suspension. (Au début de votre entretien, retirez un marqueur « temps ». Quand le dernier marqueur est retiré, lancez cette carte sans payer son coût de mana. Elle a la célérité.)", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390515&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f390ffc0-601f-4283-bd74-91cce7e632ec\', \'multiverseId\': 390515}, \'multiverseid\': 390515}, {\'name\': \'Epocrassita\', \'text\': "L\'Epocrassita entra nel campo di battaglia con tre segnalini +1/+1 se non l\'hai lanciata dalla tua mano.\\nQuando l\'Epocrassita muore, esiliala con tre segnalini tempo su di essa e ha sospendere. (All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, rimuovi un segnalino tempo. Quando l\'ultimo viene rimosso, lancia questa carta senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Ha rapidità.)", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbf700e4-e9fc-44ff-a39c-4151364ed0ed\', \'multiverseId\': 390852}, \'multiverseid\': 390852}, {\'name\': \'時代寄生機\', \'text\': \'時代寄生機は、あなたがこれをあなたの手札から唱えていないなら、＋１/＋１カウンターが３個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n時代寄生機が死亡したとき、これを時間カウンターが３個置かれた状態で追放する。これは待機を得る。（あなたのアップキープの開始時に、時間カウンターを１個取り除く。最後の１個を取り除いたとき、このカードをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱える。これは速攻を持つ。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391189&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82e4bdf4-4cb1-404d-a381-b412ccc1000f\', \'multiverseId\': 391189}, \'multiverseid\': 391189}, {\'name\': \'时代寄生虫\', \'text\': \'如果你并非从你手上施放时代寄生虫，则它进战场时上面有三个+1/+1指示物。\\n当时代寄生虫死去时，将它放逐并在其上放置三个计时指示物，且其获得延缓异能。（在你的维持开始时，从其上移去一个计时指示物。当移去最后一个时，则施放此牌且不需支付其法术力费用。它具有敏捷异能。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物～组构体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389841&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08ab9d66-eace-4185-842a-e38db27270bd\', \'multiverseId\': 389841}, \'multiverseid\': 389841}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erbitterte Fehde\', \'text\': \'Sowie die Erbitterte Fehde ins Spiel kommt, bestimme zwei Spieler.\\nFalls eine Quelle, die einer der bestimmten Spieler kontrolliert, dem anderen bestimmten Spieler oder einer bleibenden Karte, die dieser Spieler kontrolliert, Schaden zufügen würde, fügt sie diesem Spieler oder dieser bleibenden Karte stattdessen doppelt so viele Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390115&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44c3b5ae-04c2-4032-9573-6e94925178cb\', \'multiverseId\': 390115}, \'multiverseid\': 390115}, {\'name\': \'Feudo de amargura\', \'text\': \'En cuanto el Feudo de amargura entre al campo de batalla, elige dos jugadores.\\nSi una fuente que controla uno de los jugadores elegidos fuera a hacer daño al otro jugador elegido o a un permanente que controla ese jugador, en vez de eso, esa fuente hace el doble de ese daño a ese jugador o permanente.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391463&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bec39aef-2740-4c87-a0ac-8967e82418a4\', \'multiverseId\': 391463}, \'multiverseid\': 391463}, {\'name\': \'Âpre querelle\', \'text\': "Au moment où l\'Âpre querelle arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez deux joueurs.\\nSi une source contrôlée par l\'un des joueurs choisis devait infliger des blessures à l\'autre joueur choisi ou à un permanent que ce joueur contrôle, cette source inflige le double de ces blessures à ce joueur ou à ce permanent à la place.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390452&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'071f7d9d-dc75-4a96-8ffb-fccc0b9766ac\', \'multiverseId\': 390452}, \'multiverseid\': 390452}, {\'name\': \'Faida Accanita\', \'text\': "Mentre la Faida Accanita entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli due giocatori.\\nSe una fonte controllata da uno dei giocatori scelti sta per infliggere danno all\'altro giocatore scelto o a un permanente controllato da quel giocatore, quella fonte infligge invece il doppio di quel danno a quel giocatore o permanente.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97a83563-65ab-45c6-b4a4-953eeb57572d\', \'multiverseId\': 390789}, \'multiverseid\': 390789}, {\'name\': \'苦々しい抗争\', \'text\': \'苦々しい抗争が戦場に出るに際し、プレイヤーを２人選ぶ。\\n選ばれたいずれかのプレイヤーがコントロールする発生源がもう１人の選ばれたプレイヤーまたはそのプレイヤーがコントロールするパーマネントにダメージを与えるなら、代わりにその発生源はそのプレイヤーまたはパーマネントにその点数の２倍のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de76c7b1-c9e5-4d94-b9fc-20f85348ee7b\', \'multiverseId\': 391126}, \'multiverseid\': 391126}, {\'name\': \'苦涩世仇\', \'text\': \'于苦涩世仇进战场时，选择两位牌手。\\n如果由其中一位牌手操控的某个来源将对其中另一位牌手或由他操控的某个永久物造成伤害，则改为该来源对后者牌手或永久物造成两倍的伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94124dcb-2810-4d70-8c84-551662407a80\', \'multiverseId\': 389778}, \'multiverseid\': 389778}]', "[{'name': 'Erhabenes Scheinbild', 'text': 'Wenn das Erhabene Scheinbild ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, diese getappt ins Spiel bringen und danach deine Bibliothek mischen.\\nWenn das Erhabene Scheinbild stirbt, kannst du eine Karte ziehen.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390356&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8e319b2c-ff4f-4531-9b8d-8b70dc3ac70f', 'multiverseId': 390356}, 'multiverseid': 390356}, {'name': 'Simulacro solemne', 'text': 'Cuando el Simulacro solemne entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, poner esa carta en el campo de batalla girada y luego barajar tu biblioteca.\\nCuando el Simulacro solemne muera, puedes robar una carta.', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Gólem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391704&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3763b0e2-7e4d-42a2-bc81-50368eef2993', 'multiverseId': 391704}, 'multiverseid': 391704}, {'name': 'Simulacre solennel', 'text': 'Quand le Simulacre solennel arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher une carte de terrain de base dans votre bibliothèque, la mettre sur le champ de bataille engagée et mélanger ensuite votre bibliothèque.\\nQuand le Simulacre solennel meurt, vous pouvez piocher une carte.', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390693&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fa9e0612-3827-483e-81df-10bed48b4756', 'multiverseId': 390693}, 'multiverseid': 390693}, {'name': 'Simulacro Solenne', 'text': 'Quando il Simulacro Solenne entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, metterla sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescolare il tuo grimorio.\\nQuando il Simulacro Solenne muore, puoi pescare una carta.', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391030&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '750a5248-5eec-435d-b96e-4e63034f911a', 'multiverseId': 391030}, 'multiverseid': 391030}, {'name': '真面目な身代わり', 'text': '真面目な身代わりが戦場に出たとき、あなたはあなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カードを１枚探してもよい。そうしたなら、それをタップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\\n真面目な身代わりが死亡したとき、あなたはカードを１枚引いてもよい。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391367&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cf1b8884-58c5-47c8-a099-34587c12b3d8', 'multiverseId': 391367}, 'multiverseid': 391367}, {'name': '黯色幻影', 'text': '当黯色幻影进战场时，你可以从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将之横置进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\\n当黯色幻影死去时，你可以抓一张牌。', 'type': '神器生物～魔像', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390019&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '61183971-87fc-4619-8920-99f303739910', 'multiverseId': 390019}, 'multiverseid': 390019}]", '[{\'name\': \'Erinnerungsmaske\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du zwei Karten ziehen. Falls du dies tust, wirf eine Karte ab.\\nAusrüsten {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390265&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'048585a0-f89a-4b23-ad95-4193bc631bb9\', \'multiverseId\': 390265}, \'multiverseid\': 390265}, {\'name\': \'Máscara de la memoria\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la criatura equipada haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes robar dos cartas. Si lo haces, descarta una carta.\\nEquipar {1}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3a3052e-36f4-4385-adf0-4400d651052b\', \'multiverseId\': 391613}, \'multiverseid\': 391613}, {\'name\': \'Masque de la mémoire\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que la créature équipée inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez piocher deux cartes. Si vous faites ainsi, défaussez-vous d\'une carte.\\nÉquipement {1}", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390602&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2f57d03-388f-4095-9288-471bc39f5806\', \'multiverseId\': 390602}, \'multiverseid\': 390602}, {\'name\': \'Maschera della Memoria\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, puoi pescare due carte. Se lo fai, scarta una carta.\\nEquipaggiare {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e56389b-a7fa-4131-a267-d8cfa6d47fed\', \'multiverseId\': 390939}, \'multiverseid\': 390939}, {\'name\': \'記憶の仮面\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたはカードを２枚引いてもよい。そうしたなら、カードを１枚捨てる。\\n装備{1}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72192894-9160-46c3-b6af-47313d136bed\', \'multiverseId\': 391276}, \'multiverseid\': 391276}, {\'name\': \'记忆面具\', \'text\': \'每当佩带此武具的生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，你可以抓两张牌。若你如此作，则弃一张牌。\\n佩带{1}\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389928&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c2c313c-e146-4fde-ba3d-3aa763a8e93f\', \'multiverseId\': 389928}, \'multiverseid\': 389928}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ezuri, Anführer der Renegaten\', \'text\': \'{G}: Regeneriere einen anderen Elfen deiner Wahl.\\n{2}{G}{G}{G}: Bis zum Ende des Zuges erhalten Elf-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, +3/+3 und verursachen Trampelschaden.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Auf den berüchtigten Ezuri ist das höchste Kopfgeld ausgesetzt, das die Vedalken je für einen Gesetzlosen geboten haben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390185&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ee04988-08d5-44b3-b8f5-9fccce32479e\', \'multiverseId\': 390185}, \'multiverseid\': 390185}, {\'name\': \'Ezuri, líder renegado\', \'text\': \'{G}: Regenera otro Elfo objetivo.\\n{2}{G}{G}{G}: Las criaturas Elfo que controlas obtienen +3/+3 y ganan la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Guerrero elfo\', \'flavor\': \'El infame Ezuri tiene el honor de llevar sobre sus hombros la mayor recompensa que los vedalken ofrecieron jamás por un renegado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04121e76-9863-475b-8990-6d1771b417e1\', \'multiverseId\': 391533}, \'multiverseid\': 391533}, {\'name\': \'Ezuri, chef renégat\', \'text\': "{G} : Régénérez un autre elfe ciblé.\\n{2}{G}{G}{G} : Les créatures Elfe que vous contrôlez gagnent +3/+3 et acquièrent le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : elfe et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'La capture du célèbre Ezuri rapporterait la plus forte récompense jamais attribuée pour un hors-la-loi par les vedalkens.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390522&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11804e50-d448-4006-8e8c-95a9890f577a\', \'multiverseId\': 390522}, \'multiverseid\': 390522}, {\'name\': \'Ezuri, Capo Rinnegato\', \'text\': \'{G}: Rigenera un altro Elfo bersaglio.\\n{2}{G}{G}{G}: Le creature Elfo che controlli prendono +3/+3 e hanno travolgere fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Guerriero Elfo\', \'flavor\': "L\'infame Ezuri esige la più alta taglia che i vedalken abbiano mai messo su un fuorilegge.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390859&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'345c2be7-d570-4761-a6ca-4df1305cec17\', \'multiverseId\': 390859}, \'multiverseid\': 390859}, {\'name\': \'背教の主導者、エズーリ\', \'text\': \'{G}：他のエルフ１体を対象とし、それを再生する。\\n{2}{G}{G}{G}：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールするエルフ・クリーチャーは＋３/＋３の修整を受けるとともにトランプルを得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'悪名高きエズーリにかけられた賞金は、ヴィダルケンがこれまでにお尋ね者にかけた中でも最高のものだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76605010-7556-4bf3-aee6-1109b7478a7c\', \'multiverseId\': 391196}, \'multiverseid\': 391196}, {\'name\': \'叛军领袖伊祖黎\', \'text\': \'{G}：重生另一个目标妖精。\\n{2}{G}{G}{G}：直到回合结束，由你操控的妖精生物得+3/+3且获得践踏异能。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～妖精／战士\', \'flavor\': \'维多肯为恶名昭彰的伊祖黎所悬赏之金额，是他们为亡命徒所出的最高价。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389848&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f1d5c10-3e49-4558-9988-cfe6c21cd39d\', \'multiverseId\': 389848}, \'multiverseid\': 389848}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feldon vom Dritten Pfad\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}, {T}: Bringe einen Spielstein ins Spiel, der eine Kopie einer Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl in deinem Friedhof ist, außer dass er zusätzlich zu seinen anderen Typen auch ein Artefakt ist. Er erhält Eile. Opfere ihn zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'„Sie wird zu mir zurückkehren."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390189&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'224b0feb-c444-4fb4-be9e-0babe5c1b0e9\', \'multiverseId\': 390189}, \'multiverseid\': 390189}, {\'name\': \'Feldon del tercer camino\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}, {T}: Pon en el campo de batalla una ficha que es una copia de la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio, excepto que es un artefacto además de sus otros tipos. Gana la habilidad de prisa. Sacrifícala al comienzo del próximo paso final.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Ella regresará a mí".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'996a23ca-cbca-409b-8823-36f25b4448cd\', \'multiverseId\': 391537}, \'multiverseid\': 391537}, {\'name\': \'Feldonn de la Troisième Voie\', \'text\': "{2}{R}, {T} : Mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton qui est une copie d\'une carte de créature ciblée dans votre cimetière, excepté que c\'est un artefact en plus de ses autres types. Il acquiert la célérité. Sacrifiez-le au début de la prochaine étape de fin.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': \'« Elle me reviendra. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390526&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f5d73b6-f6d5-4d57-b2b9-178489882478\', \'multiverseId\': 390526}, \'multiverseid\': 390526}, {\'name\': \'Feldon del Terzo Cammino\', \'text\': "{2}{R}, {T}: Metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina che è una copia di una carta creatura bersaglio nel tuo cimitero, tranne che è un artefatto in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi. Ha rapidità. Sacrificala all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"La riporterò al mio fianco."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390863&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49695343-3f37-4c36-aa9b-41e60c8797a9\', \'multiverseId\': 390863}, \'multiverseid\': 390863}, {\'name\': \'第三の道のフェルドン\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}, {T}：あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それの他のタイプに加えてアーティファクトであることを除き、それのコピーであるトークンを１体戦場に出す。それは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それを生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'「彼女は私の元に戻ってくるさ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c2b2e77-5cf9-4218-b567-170e06f1ac52\', \'multiverseId\': 391200}, \'multiverseid\': 391200}, {\'name\': \'蹊径会的费顿\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}，{T}：将一个衍生物放进战场，此衍生物为目标在你坟墓场中生物牌的复制品，但它额外具有神器此类别。它获得敏捷异能。在下一个结束步骤开始时，将它牺牲。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'「她会再度回到我身边。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81b576d1-2887-4b4f-9819-93ce546eb45c\', \'multiverseId\': 389852}, \'multiverseid\': 389852}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flammenzungen-Kavu\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Flammenzungen-Kavu ins Spiel kommt, fügt er einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Kavu\', \'flavor\': \'„Für unterbelichtete dickhäutige Mutanten mit wilden Genen können sie verdammt gut zielen." —Sisay, Kapitän der Wetterlicht\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390193&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afa0f0d9-86a7-4302-9f91-fd56001a7ede\', \'multiverseId\': 390193}, \'multiverseid\': 390193}, {\'name\': \'Kavu lengua de fuego\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Kavu lengua de fuego entre al campo de batalla, hace 4 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Kavu\', \'flavor\': \'"Para ser mutantes genéticos tontos y torpes, tienen muy buena puntería." —Sisay, capitana del Vientoligero\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bbe8a80-1069-42c5-9526-755209b4d477\', \'multiverseId\': 391541}, \'multiverseid\': 391541}, {\'name\': \'Kavru languefeu\', \'text\': \'Quand le Kavru languefeu arrive sur le champ de bataille, il inflige 4 blessures à la créature ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Créature : kavru\', \'flavor\': "« Pour des mutants au crâne épais et à l\'esprit étroit, ils visent particulièrement bien. » —Sissay, capitaine de l\'Aquilon", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390530&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73f06e17-1654-49f9-af3f-cf76df48b4cf\', \'multiverseId\': 390530}, \'multiverseid\': 390530}, {\'name\': \'Kavu Lingua Fiammeggiante\', \'text\': \'Quando il Kavu Lingua Fiammeggiante entra nel campo di battaglia, infligge 4 danni a una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Kavu\', \'flavor\': \'"Per essere dei mutanti genetici stupidi e ottusi, hanno una mira piuttosto buona." —Sisay, capitano della Cavalcavento\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a047499c-8191-4401-8cb6-ee31f13cbd4d\', \'multiverseId\': 390867}, \'multiverseid\': 390867}, {\'name\': \'火炎舌のカヴー\', \'text\': \'火炎舌のカヴーが戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。火炎舌のカヴーはそれに４点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — カヴー\', \'flavor\': \'「鈍くて愚かな遺伝子変異体の割には、狙いを定めるのが結構うまいわね。」 ――ウェザーライトの艦長、シッセイ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e08cc93d-b715-4247-b1ca-3c202d33a217\', \'multiverseId\': 391204}, \'multiverseid\': 391204}, {\'name\': \'焰舌卡甫\', \'text\': \'当焰舌卡甫进战场时，它对目标生物造成4点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物～卡甫\', \'flavor\': \'「虽然是笨笨呆呆的突变种，但是它们却瞄得非常准。」 ～晴空号船长西赛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b1d3b32-6038-49bb-9b78-282040d01c4c\', \'multiverseId\': 389856}, \'multiverseid\': 389856}]', "[{'name': 'Flaschengnome', 'text': 'Opfere die Flaschengnome: Du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Gnom', 'flavor': 'Verstärkungen … oder Erfrischungen?', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390123&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ab36a3b4-28d6-416d-a93a-bc5a47b1b43a', 'multiverseId': 390123}, 'multiverseid': 390123}, {'name': 'Gnomos frasco', 'text': 'Sacrificar los Gnomos frasco: Ganas 3 vidas.', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Gnomo', 'flavor': 'Refuerzos o... ¿refrescos?', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391471&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5ed6a617-5c9e-452e-9c42-89abef53ba44', 'multiverseId': 391471}, 'multiverseid': 391471}, {'name': 'Glob-gnomes', 'text': 'Sacrifiez les Glob-gnomes : Vous gagnez 3 points de vie.', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : gnome', 'flavor': 'Renforts... ou rafraîchissements ?', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390460&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6cb4f209-f274-488f-a98e-d780f3031081', 'multiverseId': 390460}, 'multiverseid': 390460}, {'name': 'Gnomi della Bottiglia', 'text': 'Sacrifica gli Gnomi della Bottiglia: Guadagni 3 punti vita.', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Gnomo', 'flavor': 'Rinforzi... o rinfreschi?', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390797&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '15ef09be-fa79-4f06-967c-8bf80c26067c', 'multiverseId': 390797}, 'multiverseid': 390797}, {'name': 'ボトルのノーム', 'text': 'ボトルのノームを生け贄に捧げる：あなたは３点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ノーム', 'flavor': '補強……それとも保養？', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391134&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8c04e1d4-bee1-4c44-b253-c78b5a577424', 'multiverseId': 391134}, 'multiverseid': 391134}, {'name': '瓶子侏儒', 'text': '牺牲瓶子侏儒：你获得3点生命。', 'type': '神器生物～地侏', 'flavor': '增援...或是点心？', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389786&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '03ad40dc-bc2f-4000-8a6d-b7ff7569757a', 'multiverseId': 389786}, 'multiverseid': 389786}]", '[{\'name\': \'Fleischzerleger\', \'text\': \'Einschüchtern\\n{1}{B}, opfere eine andere Kreatur: Lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf den Fleischzerleger.\\nWenn der Fleischzerleger stirbt, bringe einen X/X schwarzen Schrecken-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel, wobei X gleich der Stärke des Fleischzerlegers ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Kostprobe gefällig?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390194&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e787695a-ad86-4048-bef4-65685b03cf2a\', \'multiverseId\': 390194}, \'multiverseid\': 390194}, {\'name\': \'Troceador de carne\', \'text\': \'Intimidar.\\n{1}{B}, sacrificar otra criatura: Pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre el Troceador de carne.\\nCuando el Troceador de carne muera, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Horror negra X/X , donde X es la fuerza del Troceador de carne.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¿No quieres probarla?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7649893d-891a-4bc6-bcfa-613b0f261389\', \'multiverseId\': 391542}, \'multiverseid\': 391542}, {\'name\': \'Tailleur de chair\', \'text\': \'Intimidation\\n{1}{B}, sacrifiez une autre créature : Mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur le Tailleur de chair.\\nQuand le Tailleur de chair meurt, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature X/X noire Horreur, X étant la force du Tailleur de chair.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'« Juste une bouchée ? »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390531&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd5aa5c5-734c-4cf6-801b-4de05abee938\', \'multiverseId\': 390531}, \'multiverseid\': 390531}, {\'name\': \'Intagliatore di Carne\', \'text\': "Intimidire\\n{1}{B}, Sacrifica un\'altra creatura: Metti due segnalini +1/+1 sull\'Intagliatore di Carne.\\nQuando l\'Intagliatore di Carne muore, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Orrore X/X nera, dove X è la forza dell\'Intagliatore di Carne.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Vuoi assaggiare?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390868&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4a586f4-79a9-4ea7-a6af-234c1472b4e5\', \'multiverseId\': 390868}, \'multiverseid\': 390868}, {\'name\': \'肉裂き魔\', \'text\': \'威嚇\\n{1}{B}, 他のクリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる：肉裂き魔の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを２個置く。\\n肉裂き魔が死亡したとき、黒のＸ/Ｘのホラー・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。Ｘは肉裂き魔のパワーに等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「味見していいか？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0e6ff15-f8e3-425d-94cb-7295a2c6c7db\', \'multiverseId\': 391205}, \'multiverseid\': 391205}, {\'name\': \'命雕师\', \'text\': \'威吓\\n{1}{B}，牺牲另一个生物：在命雕师上放置两个+1/+1指示物。\\n当命雕师死去时，将一个X/X黑色惊惧兽衍生生物放进战场，X为命雕师的力量。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「来尝一口？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d0a323a-0b09-49a3-a68f-cb2420a9a7fe\', \'multiverseId\': 389857}, \'multiverseid\': 389857}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flimmerwisch\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Flimmerwisch ins Spiel kommt, schicke eine andere bleibende Karte deiner Wahl ins Exil. Bringe diese Karte zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Seine Flügel bringen nicht nur der Luft Unruhe.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390195&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b52a4b8d-9a0a-4e6e-85c7-63f1a852196b\', \'multiverseId\': 390195}, \'multiverseid\': 390195}, {\'name\': \'Efímero fluctuante\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Efímero fluctuante entre al campo de batalla, exilia otro permanente objetivo. Regresa esa carta al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario al comienzo del próximo paso final.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Sus alas agitan algo más que aire.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc408d16-7fc3-41e5-8f97-87ecd851d401\', \'multiverseId\': 391543}, \'multiverseid\': 391543}, {\'name\': \'Voloscille\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nQuand le Voloscille arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez un autre permanent ciblé. Renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire au début de la prochaine étape de fin.\', \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': "Les battements de ses ailes ne perturbent pas que l\'air.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390532&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c25ce886-8945-4c74-adee-9e9f79bbd6ee\', \'multiverseId\': 390532}, \'multiverseid\': 390532}, {\'name\': \'Guizzo Incorporeo\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando il Guizzo Incorporeo entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia un altro permanente bersaglio. Rimetti sul campo di battaglia quella carta sotto il controllo del suo proprietario all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': "Le sue ali turbano più dell\'aria.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390869&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61152d7e-1670-4c6d-a99b-f22bcf3295aa\', \'multiverseId\': 390869}, \'multiverseid\': 390869}, {\'name\': \'ちらつき鬼火\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nちらつき鬼火が戦場に出たとき、他のパーマネント１つを対象とし、それを追放する。次の終了ステップの開始時に、そのカードをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'その翼が遮るのは空気ばかりではない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00eef0f5-7bbf-41f1-becc-f1527fc382b5\', \'multiverseId\': 391206}, \'multiverseid\': 391206}, {\'name\': \'明灭翔灵\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当明灭翔灵进战场时，放逐另一个目标永久物。在下一个结束步骤开始时，将所放逐的牌在其拥有者的操控下移回战场。\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': \'其翅翼比所卷起的气流更扰乱人心。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389858&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eefec810-84f3-422c-ba06-982582ee3db0\', \'multiverseId\': 389858}, \'multiverseid\': 389858}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flinkfuß-Stiefel\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat Fluchsicherheit und Eile.\\nAusrüsten {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'„Es ist weise, sich kopfüber ins Gefecht zu stürzen … wenn man vorbereitet bist." —Kenjek, Hauptmann der Tausend Schwerter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390379&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b31612d-2a19-4394-893d-0fa824ae3c48\', \'multiverseId\': 390379}, \'multiverseid\': 390379}, {\'name\': \'Botas de pies ligeros\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada tiene antimaleficio y prisa.\\nEquipar {1}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'"Lanzarse de cabeza al combate demuestra una gran sabiduría... siempre que estés preparado". —Kenjek, capitana de las Mil espadas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391727&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e52e1dbd-c66e-4eca-bc5e-b1cb818e6f2f\', \'multiverseId\': 391727}, \'multiverseid\': 391727}, {\'name\': \'Bottes de piedagile\', \'text\': \'La créature équipée a la défense talismanique et la célérité.\\nÉquipement {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "« Foncer tête baissée dans la mêlée, c\'est très bien... à condition d\'y être préparé. » —Kenjek, capitaine des Mille épées", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390716&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e981ea3-f0ac-4eb8-826d-2dedf35a2448\', \'multiverseId\': 390716}, \'multiverseid\': 390716}, {\'name\': \'Stivali Piedelesto\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata ha anti-malocchio e rapidità.\\nEquipaggiare {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Lanciarsi a testa bassa nella battaglia è segno di grande saggezza... quando si è preparati." —Kenjek, capitano delle Mille Spade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391053&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27f2687e-fdcb-4619-9afd-419486391f44\', \'multiverseId\': 391053}, \'multiverseid\': 391053}, {\'name\': \'速足のブーツ\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは呪禁と速攻を持つ。\\n装備{1}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'戦闘に一直線に突入するのは非常に頭のいいやり方と言えるわ……ちゃんと準備していればの話だけどね。」 ――千本剣の隊長、ケンジェク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9451b1d9-660c-4c2a-b2b4-ac7938d51eb0\', \'multiverseId\': 391390}, \'multiverseid\': 391390}, {\'name\': \'疾行靴\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物具有辟邪与敏捷异能。\\n佩带{1}\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': \'「贸然参战乃是智者所为...如果你做好了准备的话。」 ～千刃团队长肯耶珂\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d55a4723-8ca9-4240-8765-b7263d6861f0\', \'multiverseId\': 390042}, \'multiverseid\': 390042}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flügelscherben\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl opfert eine angreifende Kreatur.\\nSturm (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, kopiere ihn einmal für jeden Zauberspruch, der in diesem Zug vor ihm gewirkt wurde.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390423&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec99e411-d1f4-4a2c-b435-ac187191de1b\', \'multiverseId\': 390423}, \'multiverseid\': 390423}, {\'name\': \'Fragmentos de ala\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo sacrifica una criatura atacante.\\nTormenta. (Cuando lances este hechizo, cópialo por cada hechizo lanzado antes que él en este turno.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'732a5e4e-2d96-40d1-8981-f4ea1f852cb6\', \'multiverseId\': 391771}, \'multiverseid\': 391771}, {\'name\': "Échardes d\'ailes", \'text\': \'Le joueur ciblé sacrifie une créature attaquante.\\nDéluge (Quand vous lancez ce sort, copiez-le pour chaque sort lancé avant lui ce tour-ci.)\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390760&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57c3d1f3-e4e0-4165-abb5-8b0bb51fae91\', \'multiverseId\': 390760}, \'multiverseid\': 390760}, {\'name\': "Frammenti d\'Ala", \'text\': \'Un giocatore bersaglio sacrifica una creatura attaccante.\\nTempesta (Quando lanci questa magia, copiala per ogni magia lanciata prima in questo turno.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a766f310-8d9b-4c19-91be-6e10702b54b7\', \'multiverseId\': 391097}, \'multiverseid\': 391097}, {\'name\': \'翼の破片\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは攻撃クリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる。\\nストーム（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、このターンにこれより前に唱えられた呪文１つにつきこれを１回コピーする。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a75eabd-d375-493d-a625-637552b6cedc\', \'multiverseId\': 391434}, \'multiverseid\': 391434}, {\'name\': \'翎羽飞射\', \'text\': \'目标牌手牺牲一个进行攻击的生物。\\n风暴（当你施放此咒语时，本回合于它之前每施放过一个咒语，便将此咒语复制一次。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a595199-6a4e-4d7f-b94f-8d6e7ffa1982\', \'multiverseId\': 390086}, \'multiverseid\': 390086}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flüssigmetallanstrich\', \'text\': \'{T}: Eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl wird zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einem Artefakt.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Sie werden sich schnell daran gewöhnen, eine Haut zu tragen, die nicht ihre eigene ist." —Elesh Norn, Hohe Zönobitin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390252&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c9f543e-e4e3-4602-bb8a-48e4a3d0cb0e\', \'multiverseId\': 390252}, \'multiverseid\': 390252}, {\'name\': \'Capa de metal líquido\', \'text\': \'{T}: El permanente objetivo se convierte en un artefacto además de sus otros tipos hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Pronto se acostumbrarán a llevar una piel que no es la propia." —Elesh Norn, Gran Cenobita\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391600&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce3b13a1-8d28-49eb-a093-9b8fa2bb18e2\', \'multiverseId\': 391600}, \'multiverseid\': 391600}, {\'name\': \'Revêtement de métal liquide\', \'text\': "{T} : Le permanent ciblé devient un artefact en plus de ses autres types jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Ils s\'habitueront bientôt à porter une peau qui n\'est pas la leur. » —Elesh Norn, Grand Cénobite", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390589&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58dff5b6-d620-4a92-be03-22260db7d843\', \'multiverseId\': 390589}, \'multiverseid\': 390589}, {\'name\': \'Rivestimento di Liquimetallo\', \'text\': \'{T}: Un permanente bersaglio diventa un artefatto in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Si abitueranno molto presto a indossare una pelle che non è la loro." —Elesh Norn, Grande Cenobita\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cbed6b4-066e-438b-a826-94a686fd94d1\', \'multiverseId\': 390926}, \'multiverseid\': 390926}, {\'name\': \'液鋼の塗膜\', \'text\': \'{T}：パーマネント１つを対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは他のタイプに加えてアーティファクトになる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「彼らもすぐに、自分のものでない皮膚を着ることに慣れることでしょう。」 ――大修道士、エリシュ・ノーン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'375cb9a4-2f4b-4f65-a621-6945125b70f8\', \'multiverseId\': 391263}, \'multiverseid\': 391263}, {\'name\': \'液金包覆\', \'text\': \'{T}：直到回合结束，目标永久物额外具有神器此类别。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「他们很快就会习惯穿戴着不属于自己的皮肤。」 ～大修道士艾蕾侬\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389915&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86f98103-8045-4848-99da-314dc655875c\', \'multiverseId\': 389915}, \'multiverseid\': 389915}]', '[{\'name\': \'Formender Parasit\', \'text\': \'Morph {2}{U} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur wirken. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)\\nWenn der Formende Parasit aufgedeckt wird, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl +2/-2 oder -2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Illusion\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390342&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b411f222-72be-40d4-8849-81c7c3eff717\', \'multiverseId\': 390342}, \'multiverseid\': 390342}, {\'name\': \'Parásito moldeador\', \'text\': \'Metamorfosis {2}{U}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta boca abajo como una criatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento pagando su coste de metamorfosis.)\\nCuando el Parásito moldeador se ponga boca arriba, la criatura objetivo obtiene +2/-2 o -2/+2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ilusión\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4ab0150-c008-4b29-a4a3-f513d8686fe5\', \'multiverseId\': 391690}, \'multiverseid\': 391690}, {\'name\': \'Parasite forgeur\', \'text\': "Mue {2}{U} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la à tout moment pour son coût de mue.)\\nQuand le Parasite forgeur est retourné face visible, la créature ciblée gagne +2/-2 ou -2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : illusion\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390679&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4354bb17-fe2e-4c69-9ca0-37fdcd583bae\', \'multiverseId\': 390679}, \'multiverseid\': 390679}, {\'name\': \'Parassita Plasmatore\', \'text\': \'Metamorfosi {2}{U} (Puoi lanciare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)\\nQuando il Parassita Plasmatore viene girato a faccia in su, una creatura bersaglio prende +2/-2 o -2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Illusione\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391016&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ced0b64-7cce-49db-af5a-cb1c2bdbcb13\', \'multiverseId\': 391016}, \'multiverseid\': 391016}, {\'name\': \'模る寄生\', \'text\': \'変異{2}{U}（あなたはこのカードを、{3}で２/２クリーチャーとして裏向きに唱えてもよい。これの変異コストで、これをいつでも表向きにしてよい。）\\n模る寄生が表向きになったとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/－２か－２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — イリュージョン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9758077-2ac6-4f55-8afe-d86774f71a00\', \'multiverseId\': 391353}, \'multiverseid\': 391353}, {\'name\': \'塑形寄生怪\', \'text\': \'变身{2}{U}（你可牌面朝下地施放此牌并支付{3}，将其当成2/2生物。可随时支付其变身费用使其翻回正面。）\\n当塑形寄生怪翻回正面时，目标生物得+2/-2或-2/+2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～虚影\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2175b8c9-8c05-4965-870e-1dbdf5947c3a\', \'multiverseId\': 390005}, \'multiverseid\': 390005}]', '[{\'name\': \'Freyalise, Llanowars Zorn\', \'text\': \'+2: Bringe einen 1/1 grünen (Elf, Druide)-Kreaturenspielstein mit „{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {G}" ins Spiel.\\n−2: Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\\n−6: Ziehe für jede grüne Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine Karte.\\nFreyalise, Llanowars Zorn, kann dein Kommandeur sein.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Freyalise\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390204&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'071e12cf-44e2-42fa-8fb9-0ee5a00569da\', \'multiverseId\': 390204}, \'multiverseid\': 390204}, {\'name\': \'Freyalise, furia de Llanowar\', \'text\': \'+2: Pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Druida Elfo verde 1/1 con "{T}: Agrega {G} a tu reserva de maná".\\n-2: Destruye el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo.\\n-6: Roba una carta por cada criatura verde que controlas.\\nFreyalise, la furia de Llanowar puede ser tu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Freyalise\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c23fadb5-16f3-4f98-8c17-9998d90d0574\', \'multiverseId\': 391552}, \'multiverseid\': 391552}, {\'name\': \'Freyalise, Fureur de Llanowar\', \'text\': "+2 : Mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Elfe et Druide avec « {T} : Ajoutez {G} à votre réserve. »\\n−2 : Détruisez l\'artefact ciblé ou l\'enchantement ciblé.\\n−6 : Piochez une carte pour chaque créature verte que vous contrôlez.\\nFreyalise, Fureur de Llanowar peut être votre commandant.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker : Freyalise\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390541&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad4e0d06-b6ee-4fb7-86c2-c726bd349e49\', \'multiverseId\': 390541}, \'multiverseid\': 390541}, {\'name\': \'Freyalise, Furia di Llanowar\', \'text\': \'+2: Metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Druido Elfo 1/1 verde con "{T}: Aggiungi {G} alla tua riserva di mana".\\n-2: Distruggi un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio.\\n-6: Pesca una carta per ogni creatura verde che controlli.\\nFreyalise, Furia di Llanowar può essere il tuo comandante.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Freyalise\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390878&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'850fb364-93e8-4c87-9bac-69ba6a1da648\', \'multiverseId\': 390878}, \'multiverseid\': 390878}, {\'name\': \'ラノワールの憤激、フレイアリーズ\', \'text\': \'＋２：「{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{G}を加える。」を持つ緑の１/１のエルフ・ドルイド・クリーチャー・トークンを１体場に出す。\\n－２：アーティファクト１つかエンチャント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\\n－６：あなたがコントロールする緑のクリーチャー１体につきカードを１枚引く。\\nラノワールの憤激、フレイアリーズは統率者として使用できる。\', \'type\': \'プレインズウォーカー — フレイアリーズ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391215&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbf798e4-4c82-4f55-bb13-50d1d447b0c3\', \'multiverseId\': 391215}, \'multiverseid\': 391215}, {\'name\': \'罗堰之怒妃雅丽兹\', \'text\': \'+2：将一个1/1绿色妖精／德鲁伊衍生生物放进战场，且具有「{T}：加{G}到你的法术力池中」。\\n−2：消灭目标神器或结界。\\n−6：你每操控一个绿色生物，便抓一张牌。\\n罗堰之怒妃雅丽兹可用作指挥官。\', \'type\': \'鹏洛客～妃雅丽兹\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d58f0eb6-e1b9-4411-be28-cac4dbcc19bb\', \'multiverseId\': 389867}, \'multiverseid\': 389867}]', '[{\'name\': \'Frischfleisch\', \'text\': \'Bringe für jede Kreatur, die in diesem Zug aus dem Spiel auf deinen Friedhof gelegt wurde, einen 3/3 grünen Bestie-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Der Tod ist der beste Appetitanreger des Aasfressers.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390203&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7e78526-966c-49f4-af3a-80b38153152d\', \'multiverseId\': 390203}, \'multiverseid\': 390203}, {\'name\': \'Carne fresca\', \'text\': \'Pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Bestia verde 3/3 por cada criatura puesta en tu cementerio desde el campo de batalla este turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'El aperitivo favorito de un carroñero es la muerte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f59026e-06f4-4908-8484-14cd33d33946\', \'multiverseId\': 391551}, \'multiverseid\': 391551}, {\'name\': \'Viande fraîche\', \'text\': \'Mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 3/3 verte Bête pour chaque créature mise dans votre cimetière depuis le champ de bataille ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "La mort est l\'amuse-gueule préféré des charognards.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390540&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38271b42-6c71-413d-b18d-6a1eaa51659d\', \'multiverseId\': 390540}, \'multiverseid\': 390540}, {\'name\': \'Carne Fresca\', \'text\': \'Metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Bestia 3/3 verde per ogni creatura messa nel tuo cimitero dal campo di battaglia in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "L\'antipasto preferito di un mangiacarogne è la morte.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390877&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd119c6f-2472-4e2c-89ac-c7ab2a5637b3\', \'multiverseId\': 390877}, \'multiverseid\': 390877}, {\'name\': \'新鮮な肉\', \'text\': \'このターンに戦場からあなたの墓地に置かれたクリーチャー１体につき、緑の３/３のビースト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'腐肉漁りの好む前菜は死だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5a10b9a-e62f-4f63-9eee-7ed830a7e58d\', \'multiverseId\': 391214}, \'multiverseid\': 391214}, {\'name\': \'鲜肉\', \'text\': \'本回合中每有一个生物从战场进入你的坟墓场，便将一个3/3绿色野兽衍生生物放进战场。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'腐食者最爱的前菜就是死亡。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389866&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cb8fc66-2c5d-4dbb-b4e3-6978d0b598c7\', \'multiverseId\': 389866}, \'multiverseid\': 389866}]', '[{\'name\': \'Frost-Titan\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Frost-Titan das Ziel eines Zauberspruchs oder einer Fähigkeit wird, den bzw. die ein Gegner kontrolliert, neutralisiere diesen Zauberspruch bzw. diese Fähigkeit, falls sein bzw. ihr Beherrscher nicht {2} bezahlt.\\nImmer wenn der Frost-Titan ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, tappe eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl. Sie enttappt nicht während des nächsten Enttappsegments ihres Beherrschers.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Riese\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390205&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18915462-de32-458b-bb6a-741b22490789\', \'multiverseId\': 390205}, \'multiverseid\': 390205}, {\'name\': \'Titán escarchado\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Titán escarchado sea objetivo de un hechizo o habilidad que controla un oponente, contrarresta ese hechizo o habilidad a menos que su controlador pague {2}.\\nSiempre que el Titán escarchado entre al campo de batalla o ataque, gira el permanente objetivo. No se endereza durante el próximo paso de enderezar de su controlador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e43ae5d-6cb0-4a37-b8d2-177aa6584c48\', \'multiverseId\': 391553}, \'multiverseid\': 391553}, {\'name\': \'Titan de givre\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que le Titan de givre devient la cible d\'un sort ou d\'une capacité qu\'un adversaire contrôle, contrecarrez ce sort ou cette capacité à moins que son contrôleur ne paie {2}.\\nÀ chaque fois que le Titan de givre arrive sur le champ de bataille ou qu\'il attaque, engagez le permanent ciblé. Il ne se dégage pas pendant la prochaine étape de dégagement de son contrôleur.", \'type\': \'Créature : géant\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390542&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e261f14f-bf0d-4e52-98e8-9e1bddc93e7f\', \'multiverseId\': 390542}, \'multiverseid\': 390542}, {\'name\': \'Titano del Gelo\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta il Titano del Gelo diventa bersaglio di una magia o abilità controllata da un avversario, neutralizza quella magia o abilità a meno che il suo controllore non paghi {2}.\\nOgniqualvolta il Titano del Gelo entra nel campo di battaglia o attacca, TAPpa un permanente bersaglio. Quel permanente non STAPpa durante il prossimo STAP del suo controllore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ee566fc-da00-429c-831f-e20384f120b6\', \'multiverseId\': 390879}, \'multiverseid\': 390879}, {\'name\': \'霜のタイタン\', \'text\': \'霜のタイタンが対戦相手がコントロールする呪文や能力の対象になるたび、それのコントローラーが{2}を支払わないかぎり、その呪文や能力を打ち消す。\\n霜のタイタンが戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、パーマネント１つを対象とし、それをタップする。それは、それのコントローラーの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 巨人\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0250863-8066-4cbf-9220-ddfd69291238\', \'multiverseId\': 391216}, \'multiverseid\': 391216}, {\'name\': \'冰霜泰坦\', \'text\': \'每当冰霜泰坦成为由对手操控的咒语或异能之目标时，除非该咒语或异能的操控者支付{2}，否则反击之。\\n每当冰霜泰坦进战场或攻击时，横置目标永久物。它于其操控者的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'生物～巨人\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389868&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'178842af-437c-4a52-a66f-9ebf81dc597f\', \'multiverseId\': 389868}, \'multiverseid\': 389868}]', '[{\'name\': \'Furchteinflößende Rückkehr\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\\nRückblende — Opfere drei Kreaturen. (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Wer die Schrecken der Vergangenheit vergisst, ist verdammt, ihnen eines Tages wieder zu begegnen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390165&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'beb060a9-d9fe-402b-ba89-dad0255cfa19\', \'multiverseId\': 390165}, \'multiverseid\': 390165}, {\'name\': \'Regreso pavoroso\', \'text\': \'Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\\nRetrospectiva—Sacrifica tres criaturas. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Aquellos que olvidan los horrores del pasado están condenados a reencontrarlos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc64218b-50ac-4eef-8f0b-a557e5573a07\', \'multiverseId\': 391513}, \'multiverseid\': 391513}, {\'name\': "Retour de l\'effroi", \'text\': \'Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière.\\nFlashback — Sacrifiez trois créatures. (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Ceux qui oublient les horreurs du passé sont condamnés à les rencontrer à nouveau.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390502&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c15612bb-f7c5-4900-b293-bbee7aa7e8b5\', \'multiverseId\': 390502}, \'multiverseid\': 390502}, {\'name\': \'Ritorno Terrificante\', \'text\': \'Rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\\nFlashback—Sacrifica tre creature. (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Coloro che dimenticano gli orrori del passato sono condannati a rincontrarli.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390839&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bad1f755-dda5-4882-946a-49fa40c55496\', \'multiverseId\': 390839}, \'multiverseid\': 390839}, {\'name\': \'戦慄の復活\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それを戦場に戻す。\\nフラッシュバック ― クリーチャーを３体生け贄に捧げる。（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードを、これのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'過去の邪霊を忘れた者は、それと再び出会う運命にある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e47cc516-a021-4cdb-9f10-4a89235c175f\', \'multiverseId\': 391176}, \'multiverseid\': 391176}, {\'name\': \'颤栗再现\', \'text\': \'将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\\n返照～牺牲三个生物。（你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'忘却过往梦魇的人，注定倒霉要再度碰上。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389828&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6502d891-671b-4988-bcbe-04f419c95996\', \'multiverseId\': 389828}, \'multiverseid\': 389828}]', "[{'name': 'Gebieterischer Perfekter', 'text': 'Andere Elf-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\n{G}, {T}: Bringe einen 1/1 grünen (Elf, Krieger)-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Elf, Krieger', 'flavor': 'In einer Kultur der Schönheit werden die Schönsten wie Götter behandelt.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390228&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fb8c176a-a8dc-410e-b494-ccd870d77128', 'multiverseId': 390228}, 'multiverseid': 390228}, {'name': 'Perfecta arrogante', 'text': 'Las otras criaturas Elfo que controlas obtienen +1/+1.\\n{G}, {T}: Pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Guerrero Elfo verde 1/1.', 'type': 'Criatura — Guerrero elfo', 'flavor': 'En una cultura basada en la belleza, las más bellas son adoradas como diosas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391576&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd1070111-028d-4959-bfb5-a00da55eb468', 'multiverseId': 391576}, 'multiverseid': 391576}, {'name': 'Parfaite impérieuse', 'text': 'Les autres créatures Elfe que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\n{G}, {T} : Mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Elfe et Guerrier.', 'type': 'Créature : elfe et guerrier', 'flavor': 'Dans une culture basée sur la perfection, les plus beaux sont vénérés comme des dieux.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390565&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8ff4108c-2caf-42df-8e3e-76d79c261aac', 'multiverseId': 390565}, 'multiverseid': 390565}, {'name': 'Perfetta Autoritaria', 'text': 'Le altre creature Elfo che controlli prendono +1/+1.\\n{G}, {T}: Metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Guerriero Elfo 1/1 verde.', 'type': 'Creatura — Guerriero Elfo', 'flavor': 'In una cultura che venera la bellezza, i più belli sono adorati come divinità.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390902&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8b6c49fc-edb0-4552-999b-8038119fa1f5', 'multiverseId': 390902}, 'multiverseid': 390902}, {'name': '傲慢な完全者', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールする他のエルフ・クリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n{G}, {T}：緑の１/１のエルフ・戦士・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エルフ・戦士', 'flavor': '美が基準の文明では、最も美しいものは神と崇められる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391239&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b92ad415-973b-4ba3-b472-2a102d1246ca', 'multiverseId': 391239}, 'multiverseid': 391239}, {'name': '骄傲至美', 'text': '由你操控的其他妖精生物得+1/+1。\\n{G}，{T}：将一个1/1绿色妖精／战士衍生生物放进战场。', 'type': '生物～妖精／战士', 'flavor': '在美感的文化中，会将最美丽者崇敬如神。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=389891&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8f4c5691-9245-4d54-90ff-22d78f179c12', 'multiverseId': 389891}, 'multiverseid': 389891}]", "[{'name': 'Gebirge', 'type': 'Standardland — Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390275&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a769bf9c-331a-4c6d-990f-c0c2bbb1edf0', 'multiverseId': 390275}, 'multiverseid': 390275}, {'name': 'Montaña', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Montaña', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391623&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '08792767-3959-477e-8169-18712fc135b5', 'multiverseId': 391623}, 'multiverseid': 391623}, {'name': 'Montagne', 'type': 'Terrain de base : montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390612&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '126c4ff2-13c5-4181-b93b-adb22241db15', 'multiverseId': 390612}, 'multiverseid': 390612}, {'name': 'Montagna', 'type': 'Terra Base — Montagna', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=390949&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6c0c409a-6eed-4082-98e3-4fee93b822b1', 'multiverseId': 390949}, 'multiverseid': 390949}, {'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=391286&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '31452c78-7358-4622-a6c3-fd73b2cf10b4', 'multiverseId': 391286}, 'multiverseid': 391286}, {'name': '山脉', 'type': '基本地～山脉', 'flav