neously sacrifices the artifact and returns the artifact card to the battlefield.", '{T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature for each Elf you control.', '{T}: Target creature gets +X/+X until end of turn, where X is the number of Elves on the battlefield.', '{T}: Target permanent becomes an artifact in addition to its other types until end of turn.', '{T}: You gain 1 life for each Elf on the battlefield.', '{U}, {T}: Target creature attacks target opponent this turn if able.\\nMorph {U} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)']
